msgid "Fashion Model"
msgstr "时尚模特"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Fashion Model"
msgstr "时尚模特"

#. ~ Profession (male Fashion Model) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Once worshiped for looks, not survival skills. Now that the world has "
"leveled the playing field, glamour won’t save you."
msgstr "曾经因美貌而非生存技能而备受追捧。如今，世界让大家回到了同一起跑线，光鲜亮丽可救不了你的命。"

