msgstr "你曾在驾驶舱里度过数年，驾驶着客机、货机或你自己的飞机翱翔天际。大灾变让你停飞了，但飞行的快感仍在呼唤着你……"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Helicopter Pilot"
msgstr "直升机驾驶员"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Helicopter Pilot"
msgstr "直升机驾驶员"

#. ~ Profession (male Helicopter Pilot) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You earned a living ferrying businesspeople and tourists from helipad to "
"helipad, now your flying skills are all you have to rely on."
msgstr "你以从直升机停机坪到直升机停机坪接送商务人士和游客为生，现在你唯一能依赖的就是你的飞行技能。"

