" before the radio went silent."
msgstr ""
"作为一名驾驶医疗直升机的急救员，你鸟瞰全局，目睹了事态的急剧恶化。就在你以为已经见识过最糟的情况时，那些“到场即死”（DOA）的病人开始从裹尸袋里爬了出来，调度中心在无线电静默前发来一条惊慌失措的消息，说医院已经被攻陷了。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Gyrocopter Pilot"
msgstr "陀螺旋翼机飞行员"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Gyrocopter Pilot"
msgstr "陀螺旋翼机飞行员"

#. ~ Profession (male Gyrocopter Pilot) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always loved tinkering with flying machines as a hobby.  With your "
"gyrocopter and what little flight gear you could scrounge up while the world"
" was ending, the sky's the limit."
msgstr "你一直喜欢把飞行器作为业余爱好进行改装。在世界末日来临时，你用自制的陀螺旋翼机和你所能找到的少量飞行装备，天空成为了你的舞台。"

#. ~ Profession (female Gyrocopter Pilot) description
#: data/json/professions.json
