msgstr "当你还是个孩子的时候，你就喜爱狩猎，用把步枪射来射去。现在，你看了看手中值得信赖的伙伴，朝大灾变带来的黑暗走去——今夜如此，夜夜皆然。"

#. ~ Profession (female Rifle Hunter) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and you soon took a liking to"
" the challenge of hunting with a rifle.  Why, if the world ended there's "
"nothing you'd want at your side more than your trusty rifle.  So when it "
"did, you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr "当你还是个孩子的时候，你就喜爱狩猎，用把步枪射来射去。现在，你看了看手中值得信赖的伙伴，朝大灾变带来的黑暗走去——今夜如此，夜夜皆然。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Handy Man"
msgstr "装修工"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Handy Woman"
msgstr "女装修工"

#. ~ Profession (male Handy Man) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a local hardware store, and you did a lot of home "
"renovations yourself.  Now you look out at the horizon of a ruined world, "
"and wonder - are your meager skills, and the few supplies you grabbed on the"
" way out, sufficient to help it rebuild?"
msgstr ""
"你曾在当地一家建材商店打工，没事儿也替邻居们修修房子。现在旧世界已经毁灭，新世界尚未诞生——你能凭借着自己的技术以及几件随身工具，让曙光重临黑暗大地吗？"

#. ~ Profession (female Handy Woman) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a local hardware store, and you did a lot of home "
"renovations yourself.  Now you look out at the horizon of a ruined world, "
"and wonder - are your meager skills, and the few supplies you grabbed on the"
" way out, sufficient to help it rebuild?"
msgstr ""
"你曾在当地一家建材商店打工，没事儿也替邻居们修修房子。现在旧世界已经毁灭，新世界尚未诞生——你能凭借着自己的技术以及几件随身工具，让曙光重临黑暗大地吗？"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "长途货车司机"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "长途货车司机"

#. ~ Profession (male Trucker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ruled the road in your big rig and managed to drive it somewhere you "
"hoped was safe when the riots hit.  Now it's just you and your trusty truck "
"cab."
msgstr "你所开的大货是马路上的王者，在骚乱发生时，你设法把它开到了你觉得安全的地方。现在只剩下你和你所信任的大货车了。"

#. ~ Profession (female Trucker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You ruled the road in your big rig and managed to drive it somewhere you "
"hoped was safe when the riots hit.  Now it's just you and your trusty truck "
"cab."
msgstr "你所开的大货是马路上的王者，在骚乱发生时，你设法把它开到了你觉得安全的地方。现在只剩下你和你所信任的大货车了。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "伐木工"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "伐木女工"

#. ~ Profession (male Lumberjack) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr "你是个伐木工而且你还活着。在世界末日前你不停地放倒树木，放倒丧尸不是更容易些呢？总之，没有报酬。"

#. ~ Profession (female Lumberjack) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr "你是个伐木工而且你还活着。在世界末日前你不停地放倒树木，放倒丧尸不是更容易些呢？总之，没有报酬。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Backpacker"
msgstr "背包客"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Backpacker"
msgstr "背包娘"

#. ~ Profession (male Backpacker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've traveled for a living, sightseeing here and there, and living off "
"your parents' trust fund.  But now they're gone, and the only thing between "
"you and death is the open road and your backpack."
msgstr "你靠着双亲信托基金四处游荡，遗憾的是如今你父母都不在了，幸好现在再也不需要钱了。问题是，你和死亡之间的距离只有眼前的大路和身后的背包。"

#. ~ Profession (female Backpacker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've traveled for a living, sightseeing here and there, and living off "
"your parents' trust fund.  But now they're gone, and the only thing between "
"you and death is the open road and your backpack."
msgstr "你靠着双亲信托基金四处游荡，遗憾的是如今你父母都不在了，幸好现在再也不需要钱了。问题是，你和死亡之间的距离只有眼前的大路和身后的背包。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Fast Food Cook"
msgstr "快餐店厨师"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Fast Food Cook"
msgstr "快餐店女厨"

#. ~ Profession (male Fast Food Cook) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a fancy fast food joint a week ago, but now you show the"
" meaning of \"fast\" food by running for your life."
msgstr "一周前你还在快餐店里炸薯条……现在你边跑边回头看那群饥饿的\"顾客\"，心想：\"叫你们见识'快'餐的真谛！\""

#. ~ Profession (female Fast Food Cook) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a fancy fast food joint a week ago, but now you show the"
" meaning of \"fast\" food by running for your life."
msgstr "一周前你还在快餐店里炸薯条……现在你边跑边回头看那群饥饿的\"顾客\"，心想：\"叫你们见识'快'餐的真谛！\""

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Electrician"
msgstr "电气工程师"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Electrician"
msgstr "电气女工程师"

#. ~ Profession (male Electrician) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to work for some small-time business owners doing minor electrical "
"work, and were on your way to another trivial job when the Cataclysm struck."
"  The power's out, but if you survive long enough you might be able to "
"improvise."
msgstr ""
"你曾在一些小型企业主那里做一些小型电工工作，正前往另一个琐碎的工作地点时，大灾变突然降临。虽然停电了，但如果你能活得足够久，也许还能随机应变。"

#. ~ Profession (female Electrician) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to work for some small-time business owners doing minor electrical "
"work, and were on your way to another trivial job when the Cataclysm struck."
"  The power's out, but if you survive long enough you might be able to "
"improvise."
msgstr ""
"你曾在一些小型企业主那里做一些小型电工工作，正前往另一个琐碎的工作地点时，大灾变突然降临。虽然停电了，但如果你能活得足够久，也许还能随机应变。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Computer Hacker"
msgstr "黑客"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Computer Hacker"
msgstr "女黑客"

#. ~ Profession (male Computer Hacker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen have given you"
" skills in an area that seem, on the face of it, distinctly less-than-useful"
" when the world has ended.  Unless you manage to find a military mainframe."
msgstr ""
"在电脑屏幕前的通宵熬夜和咖啡因药片，让你锻炼了不错的黑客技术，乍看起来，这技术在世界末日到来后并没啥用。除非你能找到一处军事基地的电脑主机。"

#. ~ Profession (female Computer Hacker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen have given you"
" skills in an area that seem, on the face of it, distinctly less-than-useful"
" when the world has ended.  Unless you manage to find a military mainframe."
msgstr ""
"在电脑屏幕前的通宵熬夜和咖啡因药片，让你锻炼了不错的黑客技术，乍看起来，这技术在世界末日到来后并没啥用。除非你能找到一处军事基地的电脑主机。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Robot Technician"
msgstr "机器人技师"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Robot Technician"
msgstr "机器人技师"

#. ~ Profession (male Robot Technician) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked as a robotics technician, keeping drones and machines running and"
" once even slipped a control laptop out of the lab for yourself. After the "
"world fell, your skill to repair and command broken robots makes you as "
"valuable and dangerous as any weapon."
msgstr ""
"你曾是一名机器人技师，负责维护无人机和机器的运行，甚至还曾偷偷从实验室里拿走了一台遥控用笔记本电脑。世界沦陷后，你修理和指挥破损机器人的技能使你像任何武器一样既有价值又充满危险。"

#. ~ Profession (female Robot Technician) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked as a robotics technician, keeping drones and machines running and"
" once even slipped a control laptop out of the lab for yourself. After the "
"world fell, your skill to repair and command broken robots makes you as "
"valuable and dangerous as any weapon."
msgstr ""
"你曾是一名机器人技师，负责维护无人机和机器的运行，甚至还曾偷偷从实验室里拿走了一台遥控用笔记本电脑。世界沦陷后，你修理和指挥破损机器人的技能使你像任何武器一样既有价值又充满危险。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Penetration Tester"
msgstr "渗透测试员"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Penetration Tester"
msgstr "渗透测试员"

#. ~ Profession (male Penetration Tester) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Years of sneaking past digital defenses and exploiting software "
"vulnerabilities taught you to manipulate systems others couldn’t touch. Now,"
" in a world of silent servers and dormant machinery, those same skills let "
"you turn abandoned tech into tools, weapons, or even allies."
msgstr ""
"多年来潜入数字防御系统、利用软件漏洞的经验，教会了你如何操控那些他人无法触及的系统。如今，在这个服务器沉寂、机械休眠的世界里，同样是这些技能，让你能将被遗弃的科技产品变成工具、武器，甚至是盟友。"

#. ~ Profession (female Penetration Tester) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Years of sneaking past digital defenses and exploiting software "
"vulnerabilities taught you to manipulate systems others couldn’t touch. Now,"
" in a world of silent servers and dormant machinery, those same skills let "
"you turn abandoned tech into tools, weapons, or even allies."
msgstr ""
