#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  At least now the grown-ups aren't telling you where you "
"can't roll."
msgstr "你超爱轮滑！至少现在那些烦人的大人们不会再告诉你哪里不准滑了。"

