#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Juvenile Delinquent"
msgstr "童党阿飞"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Juvenile Delinquent"
msgstr "童党太妹"

#. ~ Profession (male Juvenile Delinquent) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You never cared for grown-ups telling you what to do, and that's how you "
"ended up spending most of your days in the principal's office.  Now, not "
"needing grown-ups to tell you what to do is the only reason you're alive.  "
"Man, you really should've played hooky today."
msgstr "你从来不听大人们的教训，因此你大多是在校长室中度过一天的学习的。现在，再也不需要大人们天天教你做人啦。今日宜逃学，伙计！"

#. ~ Profession (female Juvenile Delinquent) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You never cared for grown-ups telling you what to do, and that's how you "
"ended up spending most of your days in the principal's office.  Now, not "
"needing grown-ups to tell you what to do is the only reason you're alive.  "
"Man, you really should've played hooky today."
msgstr "你从来不听大人们的教训，因此你大多是在校长室中度过一天的学习的。现在，再也不需要大人们天天教你做人啦。今日宜逃学，伙计！"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Survivalist Jr."
msgstr "生存狂子弟"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Survivalist Jr."
msgstr "生存狂子妹"

#. ~ Profession (male Survivalist Jr.) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"Cataclysm\" was coming, "
"and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You "
"didn't get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now "
"is what they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."
msgstr ""
"你的父母都是认为在不远的未来就会末日降临的生存狂们，同时也坚持教你各种应对末世的技巧。现在看来，他们是正确的，但是你没有得到一个对他们表达感谢的机会。现在你唯一要做的事情就是他们曾经教导你的，在末世来临时要做的事：生存。"

#. ~ Profession (female Survivalist Jr.) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"Cataclysm\" was coming, "
"and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You "
"didn't get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now "
"is what they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."
msgstr ""
"你的父母都是认为在不远的未来就会末日降临的生存狂们，同时也坚持教你各种应对末世的技巧。现在看来，他们是正确的，但是你没有得到一个对他们表达感谢的机会。现在你唯一要做的事情就是他们曾经教导你的，在末世来临时要做的事：生存。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Student"
msgstr "生化学生"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Student"
msgstr "生化女学生"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Student) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your parents were so obsessed with making sure you aced every test that they"
" had you outfitted with bionics to make you smarter and never forget "
"anything.  And now, you are facing the most dire test yet, and once again "
"you had better succeed, or else."
msgstr ""
"你的父母们为了让你门门考试拿第一，不惜用生化插件改造你，让你变得聪明和从不遗忘。现在，你将会面对一场最难的考试，而你将会（最好能会）取得最好的成绩。"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Student) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your parents were so obsessed with making sure you aced every test that they"
" had you outfitted with bionics to make you smarter and never forget "
"anything.  And now, you are facing the most dire test yet, and once again "
"you had better succeed, or else."
msgstr ""
