msgstr "你很喜欢玩躲避球。以前你没能躲开时只意味着你将下场，而现在如果你没能躲开，小命不保，可不要手滑了哦。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Science Club Member"
msgstr "科学俱乐部社员"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Science Club Member"
msgstr "科学俱乐部女社员"

#. ~ Profession (male Science Club Member) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school science club, and right now you're as upset "
"as you've ever been that the school wouldn't let you play with the really "
"fun chemicals that make things go boom.  At least now no one's around to "
"tell you that you can't."
msgstr "你是学校科学俱乐部的成员之一。虽然现在你同样在为学校内不准你玩这些有趣的爆炸化合物而可惜，不过，现在，至少没人阻止你到校外制造爆炸了~"

#. ~ Profession (female Science Club Member) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school science club, and right now you're as upset "
"as you've ever been that the school wouldn't let you play with the really "
"fun chemicals that make things go boom.  At least now no one's around to "
"tell you that you can't."
msgstr "你是学校科学俱乐部的成员之一。虽然现在你同样在为学校内不准你玩这些有趣的爆炸化合物而可惜，不过，现在，至少没人阻止你到校外制造爆炸了~"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "A/V Club Member"
msgstr "电影俱乐部男社员"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "A/V Club Member"
msgstr "电影俱乐部女社员"

#. ~ Profession (male A/V Club Member) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school A/V club.  You're sure there's some way you "
"can use your technical skills to help stay alive.  You just haven't figured "
"out how to make an awesome death ray yet."
msgstr "你是学校电影俱乐部的成员之一。你相信你能从电影中学到能够保命的技能，但是你仍然搞不懂如何才能发射死亡射线。"

#. ~ Profession (female A/V Club Member) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school A/V club.  You're sure there's some way you "
"can use your technical skills to help stay alive.  You just haven't figured "
"out how to make an awesome death ray yet."
msgstr "你是学校电影俱乐部的成员之一。你相信你能从电影中学到能够保命的技能，但是你仍然搞不懂如何才能发射死亡射线。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "教师"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "女教师"

#. ~ Profession (male Teacher) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids for the whole of your life, and they've mostly "
"listened to your teachings.  However, the dead won't write out lines for "
"eating you alive."
msgstr "你曾经是一名光荣的人民教师，学生们都很听你的话。但现在，你所能布置的作业的内容，只能是今天让他们吃掉你的哪条大腿了。"

#. ~ Profession (female Teacher) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids for the whole of your life, and they've mostly "
"listened to your teachings.  However, the dead won't write out lines for "
"eating you alive."
msgstr "你曾经是一名光荣的人民教师，学生们都很听你的话。但现在，你所能布置的作业的内容，只能是今天让他们吃掉你的哪条大腿了。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Photojournalist"
msgstr "摄影记者"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Photojournalist"
msgstr "摄影女记者"

#. ~ Profession (male Photojournalist) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a freelance photojournalist before the end.  You have a chance to "
"be the first journalist to cover the apocalypse, though finding a publisher "
"seems more difficult a prospect than usual.  You managed to hold onto your "
"camera, hopefully you can get some fantastic shots."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变前你曾是一名自由摄影记者。你有机会成为第一个报道大灾变的记者，虽然现在找到一个出版商似乎看起来比平常更困难。你成功将你的相机保留了下来，祝你能抓拍到一些美妙时刻。分享此刻，分享生活。"

#. ~ Profession (female Photojournalist) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a freelance photojournalist before the end.  You have a chance to "
"be the first journalist to cover the apocalypse, though finding a publisher "
"seems more difficult a prospect than usual.  You managed to hold onto your "
"camera, hopefully you can get some fantastic shots."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变前你曾是一名自由摄影记者。你有机会成为第一个报道大灾变的记者，虽然现在找到一个出版商似乎看起来比平常更困难。你成功将你的相机保留了下来，祝你能抓拍到一些美妙时刻。分享此刻，分享生活。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Gym Teacher"
msgstr "体育老师"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Gym Teacher"
msgstr "体育女老师"

#. ~ Profession (male Gym Teacher) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a career of teaching kids the art of sports they mostly hate, the "
"zombies around you refuse to do laps, even at the blow of your whistle."
msgstr "在学校里干了许久和别的老师不一样的活计之后，你发现丧尸们根本不像学生那样好捏，就算你吹哨子了它们也不去跑圈。"

#. ~ Profession (female Gym Teacher) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
