msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your jackhammer may be gassed up, but your "
"canteen is dry, and you're on your last pair of batteries for your mining "
"helmet…"
msgstr "你是个矿工，可不是什么未成年人！你手中的气钻或许燃料充足，但你的水壶已经干得底朝天，矿工帽里的电池也只剩下这最后的一对……"

