#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "防化部队"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "防化部队"

#. ~ Profession (male Hazmat Unit) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" pay grade."
msgstr "你被派去尸检一名暴徒，此人被击毙前曾表现出野兽般的行为。当那具尸体重新站起来时，你才明白这已经超出了你的职责范围。"

#. ~ Profession (female Hazmat Unit) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" pay grade."
msgstr "你被派去尸检一名暴徒，此人被击毙前曾表现出野兽般的行为。当那具尸体重新站起来时，你才明白这已经超出了你的职责范围。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Corpse Disposal"
msgstr "军方尸体处理部队"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Corpse Disposal"
msgstr "军方尸体处理部队"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Corpse Disposal) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain the infection by"
" burning the corpses.  With command consumed by the undead, your priorities "
"have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr "为应对疫情爆发，你被派去焚烧尸体以控制感染。但如今指挥部已被丧尸吞噬，你的首要任务也转为了基本生存。"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Corpse Disposal) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain the infection by"
" burning the corpses.  With command consumed by the undead, your priorities "
"have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr "为应对疫情爆发，你被派去焚烧尸体以控制感染。但如今指挥部已被丧尸吞噬，你的首要任务也转为了基本生存。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "少将"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "少将"

#. ~ Profession (male Major General) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big "
"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk"
" duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr ""
"你从一个无名小卒的列兵一路晋升，成为了备受尊敬、功勋卓著的少将。但不利的是，多年的文书工作已让你的枪法生疏，而如今，再多的勋章也保护不了你。"

#. ~ Profession (female Major General) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big "
"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk"
" duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr ""
"你从一个无名小卒的列兵一路晋升，成为了备受尊敬、功勋卓著的少将。但不利的是，多年的文书工作已让你的枪法生疏，而如今，再多的勋章也保护不了你。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Knight"
msgstr "骑士"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Knight"
msgstr "女骑士"

#. ~ Profession (male Knight) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Chivalry! Daring! Honor! All traits that are useless in the Cataclysm. But "
"you know how to fight with a sword and you have this armor so it could be "
"worse."
msgstr "骑士精神！英勇无畏！还有荣誉感！这些特质在大灾变中统统毫无用处。不过你懂得如何用剑战斗，身上还穿着这套盔甲，所以处境还不算太糟。"

#. ~ Profession (female Knight) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Chivalry! Daring! Honor! All traits that are useless in the Cataclysm. But "
"you know how to fight with a sword and you have this armor so it could be "
"worse."
msgstr "骑士精神！英勇无畏！还有荣誉感！这些特质在大灾变中统统毫无用处。不过你懂得如何用剑战斗，身上还穿着这套盔甲，所以处境还不算太糟。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Airship Captain"
msgstr "飞艇船长"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Airship Captain"
msgstr "飞艇船长"

#. ~ Profession (male Airship Captain) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once led a crew of skyfarers, traveling the skies for fame, bricks and "
"sand.  Now you are on your own, and the ground is swarming with zombies.  At"
" least this world has ground…"
msgstr "你曾率领一众空行者遨游天际，追寻名望、砖块与沙子。如今你孤身一人，地面上更是遍布丧尸。不过，至少这个世界还有地面……"

#. ~ Profession (female Airship Captain) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once led a crew of skyfarers, traveling the skies for fame, bricks and "
"sand.  Now you are on your own, and the ground is swarming with zombies.  At"
" least this world has ground…"
msgstr "你曾率领一众空行者遨游天际，追寻名望、砖块与沙子。如今你孤身一人，地面上更是遍布丧尸。不过，至少这个世界还有地面……"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Airboat Commander"
msgstr "飞船指挥官"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Airboat Commander"
msgstr "飞船指挥官"

#. ~ Profession (male Airboat Commander) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were part of a squadron of skyfarers, plying the vastness to protect "
"trade routes from nefarious air pirates.  Now you're adrift and alone, one "
"vessel against an alien world swarming with the undead…"
msgstr "你曾隶属于一支空行者中队，穿梭于浩瀚天际，誓死保卫贸易航线免受恶毒空贼的侵扰。如今你孤身漂泊，仅凭一艘孤艇对抗着这遍布亡灵的异星世界……"

#. ~ Profession (female Airboat Commander) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were part of a squadron of skyfarers, plying the vastness to protect "
"trade routes from nefarious air pirates.  Now you're adrift and alone, one "
"vessel against an alien world swarming with the undead…"
msgstr "你曾隶属于一支空行者中队，穿梭于浩瀚天际，誓死保卫贸易航线免受恶毒空贼的侵扰。如今你孤身漂泊，仅凭一艘孤艇对抗着这遍布亡灵的异星世界……"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Aircanoe Pilot"
msgstr "空中独木舟驾驶员"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Aircanoe Pilot"
msgstr "空中独木舟驾驶员"

#. ~ Profession (male Aircanoe Pilot) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lone skyfarer, scouting the endless blue for new routes across the "
"sky.  Now you've caught sight of more land than you've seen in a lifetime, "
"an unfamiliar land of monsters…"
msgstr "你是一名独行的空行者，在那无垠的蔚蓝中探索着新的天际航路。如今，映入眼帘的陆地比你毕生所见都要辽阔，但这却是一片怪兽横行的陌生大地……"

#. ~ Profession (female Aircanoe Pilot) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a lone skyfarer, scouting the endless blue for new routes across the "
