#. ~ Name for scenario 'Challenge - The Lost And Damned' for a male character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Challenge - The Lost And Damned"
msgstr "挑战 - 失落与诅咒"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Challenge - The Lost And Damned' for a female
#. character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Challenge - The Lost And Damned"
msgstr "挑战 - 失落与诅咒"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - The Lost And Damned' for a male
#. character.
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent the first few weeks of the Cataclysm in a dull haze.  The riots "
"have died down and the summer sun has drawn out the stench of decay.  You "
"stagger out of your hiding place with a gnawing hunger, unsure if you're the"
" only one left alive, or if this is what living death is like."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变的最初几周，你处于一种无聊的迷雾之中。暴乱已经平息，夏日的阳光带出了腐败的恶臭。你带着一种刺骨的饥饿从躲藏的地方摇摇晃晃地出来，不确定自己是否是唯一的幸存者，或者你这样就是活死人的样子。"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - The Lost And Damned' for a female
#. character.
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
