#. ~ Name for scenario 'Last Flight' for a male character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Last Flight"
msgstr "最后的飞行"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Last Flight' for a female character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Last Flight"
msgstr "最后的飞行"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Last Flight' for a male character.
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping"
" that your flying skills could lead you to safety.  With no safe landing "
"zones, knowing fuel will soon be a concern, you made a quick landing to plan"
" your next move."
msgstr ""
"在世界末日即将来临时，你决定飞上天空，希望你的飞行技能能带你找到安全的避难所。由于没有安全的降落区，而且燃料即将成为问题，你迫不及待地做出紧急降落，以规划下一步的行动。"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Last Flight' for a female character.
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
