msgid ""
"You were happiest tucked away below street level, tinkering and hiding in "
"your basement."
msgstr "躲在街道水平面之下的地下室里修修补补、以此藏身，是你最快乐的时光。"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Basement Dweller' for a female character.
