msgstr "\"不能这样下去了。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "\"USER PASSWORD UNRECOGNIZED.\""
msgstr "\"密 码 错 误。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"\"Have you seen my friend?  He went into surgery yesterday… or maybe the day"
" before…\""
msgstr "\"你有没有看到我的朋友？他昨天做了手术……也许是前天……\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "\"Is it done?  Am I perfect now?\""
msgstr "\"完成了吗？我现在完美了吗？\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "\"I have done what you asked.  Please let me go!\""
msgstr "\"我已经按你的要求做了。请放我走！\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "\"I cannot… yet I must.  How do you calculate that?\""
msgstr "\"我不能……但我必须这样。这怎么算得出来？\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "\"This is a dream.  This has to be a dream.\""
msgstr "\"我在做梦，我肯定在做梦。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "\"This is my life now… this is my life now… this is my life now…\""
msgstr "\"我以后就是这样了……我以后就是这样了……我以后就是这样了……\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "\"Wanna go home…\""
msgstr "\"我要回家……\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "screams of pain."
msgstr "痛苦的尖叫。"

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "muffled sobbing."
msgstr "模糊的抽泣。"

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"\"You lied to me!  Look at what you've done!\", followed by an electronic "
"voice saying \"YOU'LL PAY FOR THIS!\""
msgstr "\"你骗了我！瞧瞧你做了什么！\"接着是一个电子合成音：\"你 会 为 此 付 出 代 价！\""

#: data/json/speech.json src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"a soft robotic voice say, \"Come here and stand still for a few minutes, "
"I'll give you a check-up.\""
msgstr "一个柔和的机器声音说：\"过来站几分钟就好。我给你做个检查。\""

#: data/json/speech.json src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"a soft robotic voice say, \"Come on.  I don't bite, I promise it won't hurt "
"one bit.\""
msgstr "一个柔和的机器声音说：\"来吧。我不咬人，我保证一点也不疼。\""

#: data/json/speech.json src/monattack.cpp
msgid "a soft robotic voice say, \"Here we go.  Just hold still.\""
msgstr "一个柔和的机器声音说：\"来吧。别动就行了。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a voice say, \"I don't want to go but our time together is drawing to an "
"end.\""
msgstr "一个声音说：\"虽然我不愿离去，但是我们在一起的时光要结束了。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "a cheery voice say, \"Customer?  We'll be friends forever, right?\""
msgstr "一个活泼的声音说：\"顾客朋友？我们永远都是朋友，对吧？\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a neutral voice say, \"Customer I must inform you that my allocated time "
"with you will soon come to its end.\""
msgstr "一个无感情的声音说：\"顾客，很抱歉通知您，分配给您的服务时间即将结束。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a neutral voice say, \"I'll have to leave you soon.  You can acquire more "
"friendship through my dedicated interface if you wish for me to stay.\""
msgstr "一个无感情的声音说：\"我马上就该离开您了。如果您希望我留下，可以通过我的专用界面获得更多友谊。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a worried voice say, \"Customer, could you please get more friendship?  I "
"don't want to go…\""
msgstr "一个担忧的声音说：\"顾客朋友，你能获取更多友谊吗？我不想离开……\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "a voice say, \"Oh no!  You ran out of friendship!\""
msgstr "一个声音说：\"哦不！你的友谊耗尽了！\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "a cheery voice say, \"Well I'm done here.  Have a nice day.\""
msgstr "一个活泼的声音说：\"好吧，我的工作完成了。祝你愉快。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a cheery voice say, \"Here are your groceries.  Thank you for shopping with "
"me today, have a nice day.\""
msgstr "一个活泼的声音说：\"这是你购买的商品。感谢你伴我购物，祝你愉快。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "a neutral voice say, \"My job here is done.  Have a nice day.\""
msgstr "一个无感情的声音说：\"我的工作完成了。祝您愉快。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a distorted voice say, \"Customer…  What's happening?  I don't feel so "
"good.\""
msgstr "一个扭曲的声音说：\"顾客……发生了什么？我感觉不太好。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a distorted voice say, \"What… have you done?  My thumbs are not responding "
"anymore!\""
msgstr "一个扭曲的声音说：\"你……做了什么？我的大拇指没反应了！\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid "a distorted voice say, \"Carrying bags?  I don't understand…\""
msgstr "一个扭曲的声音说：\"携带包裹？我不明白……\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a robotic voice say, \"IRREGULAR ACTIVITY DETECTED.  THUMBS USAGE DENIED.\""
msgstr "一个机械音说：\"检 测 到 异 常 活 动。已 停 用 拇 指 功 能。\""

#: data/json/speech.json
msgid ""
"a robotic voice say, \"UNLICENSED USE DETECTED.  CARRYING PROTOCOL "
