"repurposed plutonium fission cells.  It is universally compatible with all "
"kinds of personal electronic devices.  It stores a huge amount of power, but"
" cannot be recharged by external means, instead it steadily self-charges "
"over time."
msgstr ""
"这种电池使用了来自改制钚裂变电池的薄层钚-244和奇异纳米化合物。它可通用于各类个人电子设备。它能储存海量电能，但无法通过外部手段充电，而是会随时间推移稳定地自动充能。"

