msgstr ""
"这种电池使用了来自改制钚裂变电池的薄层钚-244和奇异纳米化合物。它可通用于各类工业级设备和大型工具。它能储存海量电能，但无法通过外部手段充电，而是会随时间推移稳定地自动充能。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid "military plutonium fuel cell"
msgid_plural "military plutonium fuel cells"
msgstr[0] "钚燃料电池（军用）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military plutonium fuel cell'}
#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid ""
"This battery uses a thin plutonium-244 and exotic nanocompound from "
"repurposed plutonium fission cells.  It was used in military mech-suits, was"
" highly experimental, and had no civilian applications.  It stores a "
"stupendous amount of power, but cannot be recharged by external means, "
"instead it steadily self-charges over time."
msgstr ""
"这种电池使用了来自改制钚裂变电池的薄层钚-244和奇异纳米化合物。它曾用于军用机甲，具有高度实验性，且未投入民用。它能储存惊人的电能，但无法通过外部手段充电，而是会随时间推移稳定地自动充能。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid "heavy disposable battery"
