msgstr[0] "铝罐（开）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'opened aluminum can'}
#: data/json/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"An aluminum can, like what soda comes in.  This one is opened and can't be "
"easily sealed."
msgstr "一个铝罐，就是装汽水的那种。这个已经被打开了而且没法简单的重新密封。"

