"A three-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Sealed tightly to preserve contents from rot."
msgstr "一个有金属螺旋盖的3升玻璃罐，一般用来做罐头。这件已被密封以保证内容物不会腐坏。"

