"\"令人惊奇的是大灾变的汽油永远不会爆炸。\""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'lamp oil'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A thin and clean-burning oil made for use in oil lamps."
msgstr "一份轻型无烟灯油，在油灯中使用。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'motor oil'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "An oil made for use in car engines."
msgstr "一款供汽车引擎使用的机油。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "napalm"
msgid_plural "napalm"
msgstr[0] "凝固汽油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'napalm'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"This is gasoline mixed with some other components to make it stick to the "
"surface and increase burning temperature, meant to be used with a "
"flamethrower."
msgstr ""
"一种混合了一些特殊成分的汽油，使得其可以粘附在物体表面并增加燃烧时的温度。需要配合火焰喷射器使用。\n"
"\"我最爱在早上闻到凝固汽油弹的味道了！\""

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "gelled gasoline"
msgid_plural "gelled gasoline"
msgstr[0] "胶状汽油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gelled gasoline'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A flammable gel composed of gasoline and a chemical that renders it to a "
"gel, it is roughly similar in properties to napalm b.  It's meant to be used"
" with a flamethrower."
msgstr "一种由汽油和使其呈凝胶状的化学物质组成的可燃凝胶，性质类似凝固汽油。可以用作火焰喷射器的燃料。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "flamethrower fuel"
msgid_plural "flamethrower fuel"
msgstr[0] "火焰喷射器燃料"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'flamethrower fuel'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of gasoline and diesel oil in equal parts.  Its combustion "
"properties make it unfit for applications where you would use any of them "
"separately, but it can be used to feed a flamethrower."
msgstr "由等量的汽油和柴油混合而成。特殊的燃烧性质使其无法再像汽油或柴油一样使用，但是可以用作火焰喷射器的燃料。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'butane'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A flammable natural gas product typically used in lighters, stored as a "
"pressurized liquid.  It could be useful as a fuel, but also as a solvent or "
"chemical reagent."
msgstr "一种易燃的天然气产品，通常用于打火机，以加压液体的形式储存。它既可以作为燃料，也可以用作溶剂或化学试剂。"

#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid "air conditioner"
msgid_plural "air conditioners"
msgstr[0] "空调"

#. ~ Description for air conditioner
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid "A household AC unit, designed to be mounted in a window."
msgstr "一台家用空调，设计安装在窗户上。"

#. ~ Description for refrigerator
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid "A large and heavy fridge."
msgstr "一台大而沉重的冰箱。"

#. ~ Description for freezer
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A large and heavy freezer, used in restaurants, megastores and other "
"environments where you need a large volume of things frozen."
msgstr "一个又大又重的冰柜，用于餐馆、大型商店和其他需要大量冷冻物品的环境。"

#: data/json/items/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "glass refrigerator"
msgid_plural "glass refrigerators"
msgstr[0] "玻璃冰箱"

#. ~ Description for glass refrigerator
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid "A glass refrigerator.  Used to display chilled goods in shops."
msgstr "一个玻璃冰箱。用于在商店中展示冷藏商品。"

#: data/json/items/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "glass freezer"
msgid_plural "glass freezers"
msgstr[0] "玻璃冰柜"

#. ~ Description for glass freezer
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid "A glass freezer.  Used to display frozen goods in shops."
msgstr "一个玻璃冰柜。用于在商店中展示冷冻货物。"

#. ~ Description for oven
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid "A household electric oven."
msgstr "一台家用电烤箱。"

#. ~ Description for plutonium generator
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A generator used on large ships or submarines.  Using a compact nuclear "
"reactor, refined nuclear fuel is sealed within and configured to provide a "
"constant low yield of power when properly installed.  It could be taken "
"apart to reuse the minireactor for more energy-intensive applications, or "
"installed in a local grid to continue providing a small but limitless source"
" of electricity."
msgstr ""
"一种用于大型船舶或潜艇的发电机。采用紧凑型核反应堆，精炼的核燃料被密封在内部并配置好，在正确安装时可提供持续低产量的电力。可以将其拆卸下来，重新利用迷你反应堆用于更多能量密集型的应用，或者安装在本地电网中，继续提供少量但无限的电力来源。"

#. ~ Description for metal compactor
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A hydraulic compactor that can accept items made of various metals, and "
"press them into basic shapes, ready for further crafting."
msgstr "一台液压驱动的金属锻压机，可以将各种金属制品压制成金属块，以用于进一步加工。"

#. ~ Description for exercise machine
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Typically used for, well, exercising.  Could be set up to pump some iron, or"
" scrapped for parts."
msgstr "通常用于……嗯，锻炼。可以重新安置好来\"举铁\"，或者拆解以获取零件。"

#. ~ Description for ball machine
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A machine used to launch various balls for different types of sports.  Could"
" be set back up and connected to the grid to play with, or disassembled for "
"parts."
msgstr "一种用于各种体育运动的自动发球机器。可以重新安置并接通电源来玩耍，或者拆解以获取零件。"

#. ~ Description for pool table
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A good-looking pool table.  Could be set back up or scrapped for parts."
msgstr "一张漂亮的台球桌。可以重新安置，或者拆解以获取零件。"

#. ~ Description for arcade machine
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Play stupid games, win stupid prizes.  That was the idea, anyway.  Good for "
"all kinds of electronic parts, or you could hook it up to the grid and see "
"if it still works."
msgstr "玩蠢游戏，赢蠢奖品。反正当初的设计理念就是这样。它是获取各种电子零件的好来源，或者你也可以把它接通电源，看看是否还能运行。"

#. ~ Description for pinball machine
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Most underrated game of the 20th century.  Press buttons so the ball doesn't"
" go in the hole.  Unless you hook it back up to the power grid, it's only "
"good for parts."
msgstr "20世纪最被低估的游戏。通过按键防止弹球掉进洞里。除非你把它重新接通电源，否则它也就是一堆零件罢了。"

#. ~ Description for ergometer
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A rowing exercise machine, might have useful parts in it.  Could also be set"
" back up if you feel you need the exercise."
msgstr "一台划船健身机，里面可能含有有用的零件。如果你觉得需要锻炼，也可以将其重新安置使用。"

#. ~ Description for treadmill
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Used for training leg muscles.  If you set it back up and provide electrical"
" power it'd be a great way to run in circles, otherwise it's just a source "
"of scrap."
msgstr "用于锻炼腿部肌肉。如果重新安置并接通电源，这将是个原地奔跑的好去处，否则它只是一堆废料。"

#. ~ Description for punching bag
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Punch Punch!  Exercise those arms!  It won't be fighting back anytime soon, "
"now it's only good for parts unless you set it back up."
msgstr "挥拳！出击！锻炼你的双臂！它可不会还手。除非你将其重新安置，否则现在它只是一堆零件。"

#. ~ Description for dancing pole
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Tall metal pole meant for dancing.  Setting it back up again will let you "
"practice your moves."
msgstr "专用于舞蹈的高大金属杆。重新安置后，你就可以用它来练习舞姿了。"

#. ~ Description for roulette table
#: data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A big, scratched roulette table.  Could be set back up to take it for a "
"spin, or just taken apart for material."
msgstr "一张满是划痕的大型轮盘赌桌。可以重新安置好来\"转一把\"，或者直接拆解以获取材料。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "animal"
msgid_plural "animal"
msgstr[0] "动物"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "nearby fire"
msgid_plural "nearby fire"
msgstr[0] "靠近火源"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "muscle"
msgid_plural "muscle"
msgstr[0] "肌肉"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "wind"
msgid_plural "wind"
msgstr[0] "风速"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "sun light"
msgid_plural "sun light"
msgstr[0] "阳光"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "metabolism"
msgid_plural "metabolisms"
msgstr[0] "新陈代谢"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "nonsensoleum"
msgid_plural "nonsensoleums"
msgstr[0] "荒唐的能源"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "a smoking device and a source of flame"
msgid_plural "a smoking device and a source of flames"
msgstr[0] "一个抽油烟装置和火源"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "file"
msgid_plural "files"
msgstr[0] "文件"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'file'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Several documents with all kinds of information, customer data and charts "
"kept together, pretty useless now though."
msgstr "被归好档的几份文件资料，比如客户信息和市场分析图表什么。不过你可以肯定现在这些VIP客户的需求只剩下一个了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27A"
msgid_plural "INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27As"
msgstr[0] "事故报告：沉浸-27A"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27A'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A white piece of paper, with a fancy-looking logo printed on its upper left "
"corner.  It'd probably be very fascinating reading material."
msgstr "一张白纸，左上角印着一个很精美的标志。看起来可能是非常有趣的阅读材料。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "MATERIAL: T-SUBSTRATE"
msgid_plural "MATERIAL: T-SUBSTRATEs"
msgstr[0] "材料：T-基质"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "HAADF MICROGRAPH: T-SUBSTRATE"
msgid_plural "HAADF MICROGRAPH: T-SUBSTRATEs"
msgstr[0] "高角环形暗场成像：T-基质"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "foodplace loyalty card"
msgid_plural "foodplace loyalty cards"
msgstr[0] "美食广场会员卡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'foodplace loyalty card'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A bright pink loyalty card, all the points are stamped.  This would "
"definitely prove your fidelity to Foodplace, if it still meant anything…"
msgstr "一张亮粉色的会员积分卡，所有的积分都加盖了印戳。这肯定能证明你对美食之城的忠诚，如果这还有意义的话……"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "withered plant"
msgid_plural "withered plants"
msgstr[0] "枯萎植物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'withered plant'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A dead plant.  Good for starting fires or making a pile of leaves to sleep "
"on."
msgstr "一株枯萎的植物。适合生火或堆起来睡觉。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "fur pelt"
msgid_plural "fur pelts"
msgstr[0] "毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur pelt'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small bolt of fur from an animal.  Can be made into warm clothing."
msgstr "这是由可爱的动物做成的毛皮，可以用来制造保暖的衣物。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "faux fur pelt"
msgid_plural "faux fur pelts"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faux fur pelt'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small bolt of garishly colored faux fur.  Can be made into clothing."
msgstr "一小束颜色华丽的人造毛皮。可以用来制造保暖的衣物。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "leather patch"
msgid_plural "leather patches"
msgstr[0] "皮革片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather patch', 'str_pl': 'leather patches'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A smallish patch of leather, could be used to make tough clothing."
msgstr "一小块皮革片，可用于缝制坚实的衣物。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "felt patch"
msgid_plural "felt patches"
msgstr[0] "毛毡片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'felt patch', 'str_pl': 'felt patches'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A smallish patch of felt, could be disassembled for wool fiber."
msgstr "小块的毛毡片，可以拆解出羊毛纤维。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Nomex patch"
msgid_plural "Nomex patches"
msgstr[0] "芳纶布片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nomex patch', 'str_pl': 'Nomex patches'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small bolt of Nomex fire-resistant fabric."
msgstr "一小卷防火芳纶纤维布片。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "superglue"
msgid_plural "superglue"
msgstr[0] "万能胶"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'superglue'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A tube of strong glue.  Used in many crafting recipes."
msgstr "一管强力胶，用来制造许多东西。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "bone glue"
msgid_plural "bone glues"
msgstr[0] "骨胶"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone glue'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Glue made from boiling animal bones.  The adhesive isn't strong enough for "
"heavy-duty usages, but it can be used to hold together small items."
msgstr "用动物骨头熬制而成的胶。这种粘合剂粘着性并不太强，但可以用于粘合一些小物件。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pitch'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Sticky resin made from pine or birch tar.  Can be used for waterproofing or "
"holding together small items, or for improvised repairs with the right "
"tools.  When dried further it's known as rosin, often used as flux for "
"solder."
msgstr "由松树或桦树焦油制成的粘性树脂。可以用于防水或粘合小物件，或者在合适的工具下进行简易修复。进一步干燥后称为松香，常用于焊接的助焊剂。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json data/mods/flowerpots_plus/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/flowerpots_plus/items/overrides.json
msgid "fertilizer"
msgid_plural "fertilizers"
msgstr[0] "肥料"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fertilizer'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A token, representing fertilization of a plant."
msgstr "一种标志性的经典植物用肥料。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "steel chain"
msgid_plural "steel chains"
msgstr[0] "钢链"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steel chain'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy steel chain.  Useful as a weapon, or for crafting.  It has a chance "
"to wrap around your target, allowing for a bonus unarmed attack."
msgstr ""
"一个沉重的钢链。可以作为武器或用于制造。当它作为武器使用时，有几率直接缠绕对手，让你获得一次额外的徒手近战攻击。\n"
"\"我手持钢鞭将你打，打你这该死的活王八。\""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "chunk of chitin"
msgid_plural "chunks of chitin"
msgstr[0] "甲壳块"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of chitin', 'str_pl': 'chunks of chitin'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A piece of an insect's exoskeleton.  It is light and very durable."
msgstr "这是一块昆虫的坚硬躯壳，它不仅轻巧，而且很耐用。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "cluster of gas sacs"
msgid_plural "clusters of gas sacs"
msgstr[0] "气囊团"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cluster of gas sacs', 'str_pl': 'clusters of gas
#. sacs'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"This is a cluster of membranous bubbles, each about the size of a grape, "
"retrieved from inside a mutant insect.  They float like tiny helium "
"balloons, and are likely full of a lighter-than-air gas helping the bug to "
"fly."
msgstr ""
"一团薄膜状气泡，每一个都有葡萄大小，是从某种变异的巨型昆虫体内屠宰而来的。它们像微小的氦气球一样在空中漂浮，可能内部充满了比空气还轻的气体。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "set of 100 ceramic disk"
msgid_plural "ceramic disks"
msgstr[0] "陶瓷盘套件"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'set of 100 ceramic disk', 'str_pl': 'ceramic
#. disks'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A set of small slightly elongated disks, made of high-grade ceramic.  They "
"remind you of scales."
msgstr "一套略微椭圆的圆盘，由高级陶瓷制成，让你想起鳞片。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "chunk of biosilicified chitin"
msgid_plural "chunks of biosilicified chitin"
msgstr[0] "硅化甲壳块"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of biosilicified chitin', 'str_pl':
#. 'chunks of biosilicified chitin'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A lump of exoskeleton that has undergone biosilicification.  It is acid-"
"resistant and remarkably sturdy."
msgstr "一块经过生物硅化反应的昆虫外壳。防酸而且十分耐用。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "bundle of rags"
msgid_plural "bundles of rags"
msgstr[0] "布条捆"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bundle of rags', 'str_pl': 'bundles of rags'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Cotton rags, bundled tightly together for storage.  Activate or disassemble "
"to unpack."
msgstr "一捆被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的棉布条，使用或拆解来解包布条。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "bundle of leather"
msgid_plural "bundles of leather"
msgstr[0] "皮革片捆"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bundle of leather', 'str_pl': 'bundles of
#. leather'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Leather patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble to "
"unpack."
msgstr "一捆被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的皮革片，可拆解。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "bundle of felt"
msgid_plural "bundles of felt"
msgstr[0] "毛毡片捆"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bundle of felt', 'str_pl': 'bundles of felt'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Felt patches, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "一捆被紧紧地捆在一起以存放的毛毡片，可拆解。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "t-substrate sample"
msgid_plural "t-substrate samples"
msgstr[0] "T-基质样品"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 't-substrate sample'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An acrylic cube cast around a small black crystal.  It's tepid to the touch."
msgstr "一小块密封在亚克力玻璃内的黑色晶体，有着微热的触感。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "biollante bud"
msgid_plural "biollante buds"
msgstr[0] "变异花苞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biollante bud'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An unopened biollante flower, brilliant purple in color.  It may still have "
"its sap-producing organ intact."
msgstr "这是一株还未开花的异形花的花苞，呈现出绚丽的紫色，其中可能还原封不动地保存了一些植物的汁液。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "empty canister"
msgid_plural "empty canisters"
msgstr[0] "空罐"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'empty canister'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An empty canister, which may have once held tear gas or other substances."
msgstr "一个空罐子，里面可能装过催泪弹什么的，有股气味散发出来。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "petrified eye"
msgid_plural "petrified eyes"
msgstr[0] "石化之眼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'petrified eye'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A fist-sized eyeball with a cross-shaped pupil.  It seems to be made of "
"stone, but doesn't look like it was carved."
msgstr ""
"这颗拳头大小的眼球有个十字形的瞳孔，虽然看起来好像是石头做的，但完全看不出雕刻的痕迹。\n"
"\"似乎散发着奇异的感觉。\""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "spiral stone"
msgid_plural "spiral stones"
msgstr[0] "螺旋石"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spiral stone'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A rock the size of your fist.  It is covered with intricate spirals; it is "
"impossible to tell whether they are carved, naturally formed, or some kind "
"of fossil."
msgstr "拳头般大小的岩石。有着复杂的螺旋图形，你也不知道它是雕刻的，还是自然形成的，亦或是某种化石。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "USB drive"
msgid_plural "USB drives"
msgstr[0] "U盘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'USB drive'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A USB thumb drive.  Useful for holding software."
msgstr "一个U盘，用于存储电脑软件与数据。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json data/mods/DinoMod/items/items.json
msgid "genome drive"
msgid_plural "genome drives"
msgstr[0] "基因组驱动器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'genome drive'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A USB thumb drive labeled with tape.  Stores genetic information that can be"
" used in a genome workstation, to create DNA samples for cloning."
msgstr "一个贴着胶带标签的USB拇指驱动器。存储有遗传信息，可在基因组工作台上使用，以制造用于克隆的DNA样本。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "blank card"
msgid_plural "blank cards"
msgstr[0] "空白卡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blank card'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An RFID or NFC style card.  Useful for holding identifying information like "
"bank accounts or entry codes."
msgstr "一种 RFID 或 NFC 类型的卡片。可用于存储身份信息，例如银行账户或门禁码。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "data card"
msgid_plural "data cards"
msgstr[0] "数据卡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'data card'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Some type of advanced data storage device.  Useful for storing very large "
"amounts of information."
msgstr "某种类型的高级数据存储设备。用于存储大量信息。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "FEMA data"
msgid_plural "FEMA data"
msgstr[0] "FEMA 数据库"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'FEMA data'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Evacuation plans, disaster risk projections, personnel lists and last minute"
" communications from just before the end, all scrubbed from FEMA servers and"
" stored in an external hdd."
msgstr "撤离计划、灾难风险预测、人员名单以及灾变前最后一分钟的通信都从FEMA服务器上删除并存储在外部硬盘中。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "candlestick"
msgid_plural "candlesticks"
msgstr[0] "烛台"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'candlestick'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A gold candlestick."
msgstr "一个黄金烛台。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "blade"
msgid_plural "blades"
msgstr[0] "大刀片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blade'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large, relatively sharp blade.  Could be used to make bladed weaponry, or "
"attached to a car."
msgstr "一个锋利的大刀片，用于装在车上对目标造成物理伤害，也经过可简易的加工成为一把砍刀。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "scythe blade"
msgid_plural "scythe blades"
msgstr[0] "镰刀刀片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scythe blade'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large, curved blade.  Could be used to assemble a scythe, or make an "
"improvised polearm."
msgstr "一个大的弯曲的刀片。可以用来组装镰刀，或者做一个简易的长柄武器。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "circular sawblade"
msgid_plural "circular sawblades"
msgstr[0] "圆锯片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'circular sawblade'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An 8\" circular sawblade.  You could make a saw with it, or throw it.  "
"Wielding it without sturdy gloves is a bad idea."
msgstr "8吋圆锯刃片。可以拿它做把圆锯，扔出去也可以。边缘锋利，请先戴手套再扔它。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "tree spile"
msgid_plural "tree spiles"
msgstr[0] "树木插管"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tree spile'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A hollow metal cylinder which is inserted in a tree crust in order to slowly"
" harvest its sap.  Can be used on a maple tree in between late winter and "
"early spring to harvest maple sap."
msgstr "一根食指大小的中空金属管，把它深深地插进树皮里就可以从中缓慢的获得树汁。可以在晚冬早春时节从枫树里收集枫树树汁。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "wire"
msgid_plural "wires"
msgstr[0] "铁丝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wire'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A length of thin, relatively stiff, steel wire.  Like the sort you find in "
"wire fences."
msgstr "一条薄的、僵硬的钢丝，就像常见的铁丝网上的钢丝一样。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "barbed wire"
msgid_plural "barbed wires"
msgstr[0] "倒钩铁丝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'barbed wire'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of stiff wire, covered in sharp barbs."
msgstr "一条有着锋利的倒钩的长线。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "steel mesh"
msgid_plural "steel meshes"
msgstr[0] "钢丝网"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steel mesh', 'str_pl': 'steel meshes'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A mat of woven fine steel wire, useful for dryer lint traps and reusable "
"coffee filter baskets.  You could put these on a window to keep mosquitoes "
"and other bugs out, but chainlink fencing will do these days."
msgstr "一张细钢丝网，可以用作烘干机滤网或者用来滤咖啡。你也可以把它做成纱窗用来遮挡蚊虫，但是如今的蚊虫只需要勾花围栏就能挡住了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "rebar"
msgid_plural "rebars"
msgstr[0] "钢筋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rebar'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A length of rebar, makes a nice melee weapon, and could be handy in "
"constructing tougher walls and such."
msgstr "一个长方形的螺纹钢棍，可以用来建造墙壁等建筑。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small railroad track'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A length of track, made from some planks and rails."
msgstr "一段窄轨铁路轨道，由一些木板和铁轨制成。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'concrete'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Some concrete, ready to be used in a construction project."
msgstr "一堆混凝土，已经准备好，随时可以用到工程建设项目中。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "bone skewer"
msgid_plural "bone skewers"
msgstr[0] "骨串"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone skewer'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A thin skewer carved from bone.  Can be used to cook food over a fire or as "
"a terrible lockpick."
msgstr ""
"一根骨制的烤肉串。可以用来在火上烹饪食物，或者作为一个非常糟糕的开锁工具。\n"
"\"可惜这样并不会让松鼠烤肉串更美味。\""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "burnt out torch"
msgid_plural "burnt out torches"
msgstr[0] "火把（燃尽）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'burnt out torch', 'str_pl': 'burnt out torches'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A torch that has consumed all its fuel; it can be recrafted into another "
"torch."
msgstr "燃尽了的火炬，加上燃料或就能当新的用了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "dead flare"
msgid_plural "dead flares"
msgstr[0] "照明弹（燃尽）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dead flare'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "This is a spent magnesium flare.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "一个已经燃烧完毕的照明弹。本质上是垃圾，且不可回收。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "spring"
msgid_plural "springs"
msgstr[0] "弹簧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spring'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy-duty spring.  Expands with significant force when compressed."
msgstr "巨大的弹簧。可以承受不少力，且弹性十足。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "lawnmower"
msgid_plural "lawnmowers"
msgstr[0] "割草机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lawnmower'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A motorized pushmower that seems to be broken.  You could take it apart if "
"you had a wrench."
msgstr "一台已损坏的电动手推式割草机，可以使用扳手进行拆解以获得其中的零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "damaged tent"
msgid_plural "damaged tents"
msgstr[0] "帐篷（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'damaged tent'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small tent, just big enough to fit a person comfortably.  This tent is "
"broken and cannot be deployed."
msgstr "一顶已经损坏的小帐篷，无法撑开供人使用。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "large damaged tent"
msgid_plural "large damaged tents"
msgstr[0] "大帐篷（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large damaged tent'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A family sized tent, very bulky but with plenty of space.  This tent is "
"broken and can not be deployed."
msgstr "一个已经损坏的家庭装的帐篷，不能再重新展开供人使用。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "heating element"
msgid_plural "heating elements"
msgstr[0] "加热元件"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heating element'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A heating element, like the ones used in hotplates or kettles."
msgstr "加热元件，通常用在电炉或电水壶等中。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "bimetal thermostat"
msgid_plural "bimetal thermostats"
msgstr[0] "双金属恒温器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bimetal thermostat'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A simple thermostat controlled by thermal expansion of a bimetal strip."
msgstr "由双金属片的热膨胀控制的简单恒温器。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "television"
msgid_plural "televisions"
msgstr[0] "电视机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'television'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A large LCD television, full of delicious electronics."
msgstr "一台大屏幕液晶电视，接收不到信号无法观看电视节目，可以使用工具拆解以获得其中零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "pilot light"
msgid_plural "pilot lights"
msgstr[0] "辅助点火器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pilot light'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A pilot light from a gas-burning device, this particular one is a simple "
"piezoelectric igniter."
msgstr "从燃气装置上拆下来的辅助燃烧辅助点火器，这个是压电性的。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "delayed fuze"
msgid_plural "delayed fuzes"
msgstr[0] "延时引信"

#. ~ Description for delayed fuze
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A complex mechanical fuze.  It seems it can be used to detonate stable "
"explosives after a short time by triggering it."
msgstr "一个结构复杂的机械引信。它似乎可以在触发后经过一小段特定时间后引爆稳定炸药。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "impact fuze"
msgid_plural "impact fuzes"
msgstr[0] "撞击引信"

#. ~ Description for impact fuze
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A complex mechanical fuze.  It seems it can be used to detonate stable "
"explosives upon a solid impact."
msgstr "一个结构复杂的机械引信。它似乎可以在受到强烈撞击后引爆稳定炸药。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "toaster"
msgid_plural "toasters"
msgstr[0] "烤面包机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'toaster'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A small two slice toaster, not much use as anything but spare parts"
msgstr "一个一次只能烤两片面包的小型烤面包机，没有独立电源所以无法使用，可以使用工具进行拆解以获得其中的零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "microwave"
msgid_plural "microwaves"
msgstr[0] "微波炉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'microwave'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A home microwave, has probably seen its share of baked beans.  Good for "
"scrap parts."
msgstr "一个家用微波炉，用微波加热食物的现代化烹调灶具，没有独立电源所以无法使用，可以使用工具进行拆解以获得其中的零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken eyebot"
msgid_plural "broken eyebots"
msgstr[0] "眼球无人机（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken eyebot'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken eyebot.  Much less threatening now that it won't be calling for "
"backup.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的眼球无人机。因为再也不能呼叫支援所以不再构成威胁。可以拆解得到部件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken skitterbot"
msgid_plural "broken skitterbots"
msgstr[0] "掠行机器人（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken skitterbot'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken skitterbot.  Much less threatening now that it lies limp on solid "
"ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的掠行机器人。现在安静的散在地上构不成威胁了。可以拆解得到部件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken lab defense bot"
msgid_plural "broken lab defense bots"
msgstr[0] "实验室防御机器人（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken lab defense bot'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken lab defense bot, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could "
"be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的实验室防御机器人，它的外壳破损，有液体从中流出。可以拆解得到部件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken police bot"
msgid_plural "broken police bots"
msgstr[0] "警用机器人（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken police bot'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
