msgstr "一个坏掉的护士机器人。它光滑的脸茫然地凝视着空气。可以拆解回收零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken grocery bot"
msgid_plural "broken grocery bots"
msgstr[0] "食杂店机器人（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken grocery bot'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
