#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken secubot'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken secubot, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be gutted"
" for parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的安保机器人，它的外壳破损，有液体从中流出。可以拆解得到部件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
