#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken chickenbot'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"A broken chicken walker.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently"
" inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr "一个损坏的双足机器人。可能因为巨大的体积和质量的缘故，就算已经永久无法继续运作依旧看起来可怕无比。可以拆解得到部件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken M202A1 TALON"
msgid_plural "broken M202A1 TALONs"
msgstr[0] "M202A1 \"鹰爪\"型无人车（损坏）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken M202A1 TALON'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A broken TALON UGV, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be "
"gutted for parts."
msgstr "一架损坏的\"鹰爪\"型无人车，它的外壳破损，有液体从中流出。可以拆解得到部件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "fire brick"
msgid_plural "fire bricks"
msgstr[0] "耐火砖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fire brick'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A reinforced brick designed to withstand intense heat.  It could also be "
"used as an impromptu anvil for light metalworking."
msgstr "一种设计用于承受高温的加固砖。它还可以用作临时铁砧进行轻型金属加工。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "survival kit"
msgid_plural "survival kits"
msgstr[0] "生存工具箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survival kit'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A small box filled with tools and items to help you survive in case of an "
"emergency.  Disassemble to get its content."
msgstr "一个装着应急用工具及物品的小盒子。拆解它以获取内容物。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survival kit'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"The ultimate survival kit purchased either by the wealthy or the dedicated "
"urban survivalist.  It contains tools and items to help you survive in case "
"of an emergency.  Disassemble to get its contents."
msgstr "一套终极生存工具箱，可能是某个有钱人或是某个特别投入的城市生存主义者购买的。其中装满了各类高级应急用工具和物品。拆解它以获取内容物。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "plastic dice"
msgid_plural "plastic dice"
msgstr[0] "塑料骰子"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'plastic dice'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A six-sided plastic dice."
msgstr "一个六面的塑料骰子。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "salt lick"
msgid_plural "salt licks"
msgstr[0] "舔盐砖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salt lick'}
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy cube-shaped block of salt for livestock.  Don't lick it, it's gross."
msgstr "一大块沉重的立方体食盐块，供牲畜食用。别舔它，太恶心了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken light turret"
msgid_plural "broken light turrets"
msgstr[0] "轻型炮塔（损坏）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken medium milspec turret"
msgid_plural "broken medium milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] "中型军用炮塔（损坏）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "broken longrange milspec turret"
msgid_plural "broken longrange milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] "长程军用炮塔（损坏）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
