msgid "You close the headlamp's cover."
msgstr "你关上了头灯的灯罩。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic headlamp'}
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a custom-made reinforced headlamp powered by the magic of nuclear "
"decay, focused for more usable brightness.  The adjustable strap allows it "
"to be comfortably worn on your head or attached to your helmet.  Use it to "
"close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"这是一个自制的强化头灯，使用原子能衰变放出的能量照明，光线经过聚焦以达到能用的亮度。头灯上的带子可以调整，让你可以把它穿在头上或者系在头盔上。激活它来关上灯罩。"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "atomic headlamp (covered)"
msgid_plural "atomic headlamps (covered)"
msgstr[0] "原子头灯（关）"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'atomic headlamp (covered)', 'str_pl':
#. 'atomic headlamps (covered)'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'atomic lamp (covered)', 'str_pl':
#. 'atomic lamps (covered)'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'atomic reading light (covered)',
