#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of tabi', 'str_pl': 'pairs of tabi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of black tabi, as worn with traditional Japanese clothes."
msgstr "一双黑色的布袜，搭配日本传统服装。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of gi tabi"
msgid_plural "pairs of gi tabi"
msgstr[0] "白足袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of gi tabi', 'str_pl': 'pairs of gi tabi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "A pair of white tabi, as used by martial arts practitioners."
msgstr "一双白色的布袜，一般为习武者穿戴。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of armored sandals"
msgid_plural "pair of armored sandals"
msgstr[0] "装甲凉鞋"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pair of armored sandals'}
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of strapped sandals with a leather plate in the front to serve as "
"greaves, similar to those used by ancient Roman and Greek soldiers."
msgstr "一双带绑带的凉鞋，前部有皮革板，类似于古罗马和希腊士兵所使用的护胫。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of thick socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of thick socks"
msgstr[0] "厚袜子"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of carbon fiber boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of carbon fiber boots"
msgstr[0] "碳纤维靴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of carbon fiber boots', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. carbon fiber boots'}
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"A custom pair of boots made out of layered carbon fiber armor made using a "
"3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to a suit of armor than "
"kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."
msgstr "使用3D打印机定制的多层碳纤维靴子。 与凯夫拉相比，它的硬质板材更像是一套盔甲，但却具有很强的防护性，而且重量很轻。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid "pair of scaleskin boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of scaleskin boots"
msgstr[0] "鳞甲靴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of scaleskin boots', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. scaleskin boots'}
#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
msgid ""
"Boots made from the hardened scales of large reptiles.  It doesn't look "
"quite like normal alligator skin boots due to the armored design."
msgstr "由大型爬行动物坚硬的鳞片制成的靴子。由于其装甲设计，它看起来不像普通的鳄鱼皮靴子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "American flag"
msgid_plural "American flags"
msgstr[0] "美国国旗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'American flag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A large American flag made to fly in even the worst conditions."
msgstr ""
"一个大大的美国国旗，俗称\"星条旗\"，由13道红白相间的宽条构成，左上角还有一个包含了50颗白色小五角星的蓝色长方形。\n"
"\"请沿星条剪开，裁成布条。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Jolly Roger"
msgid_plural "Jolly Rogers"
msgstr[0] "骷髅旗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Jolly Roger'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black replica pirate flag."
msgstr ""
"一面黑色仿制海盗旗。\n"
"\"准备好了吗？孩子们！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black replica pirate flag, depicting a skull-and-crossbones."
msgstr ""
"一面黑色仿制海盗旗，上面刻有骷髅头和交叉骨。\n"
"\"是的！船长！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A black replica pirate flag, depicting a skull-and-crossbones over an "
"hourglass."
msgstr ""
"一面黑色仿制海盗旗，上面有一个沙漏上的骷髅头。\n"
"\"太小声啰！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black replica pirate flag, depicting a skull over a cutlass."
msgstr ""
"一面黑色仿制海盗旗，上面有一个头骨和一把弯刀。\n"
"\"是的！！！船长！！！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A black replica pirate flag, depicting a skeleton stabbing a heart with a "
"spear."
msgstr ""
"一面黑色仿制海盗旗，上面画着一个用长矛刺穿心脏的骷髅。\n"
"\"我们对喝醉的水手做什么好呢？在这清晨时分？\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black replica pirate flag, depicting an arm holding a cutlass."
msgstr ""
"一面黑色仿制海盗旗，描绘了一只手持弯刀的手臂。\n"
"\"嗨！嘿！扬帆起航！在这清晨时分！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black replica pirate flag, depicting a skull."
msgstr ""
"一面黑色的仿制海盗旗，上面有一个骷髅头。\n"
"\"把他丢到船长女儿的床上！在这清晨时分！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Foodperson's cape"
msgid_plural "Foodperson's capes"
msgstr[0] "美食家披风"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Foodperson's cape"}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A brightly-colored cape emblazoned with the \"Fp\" symbol."
msgstr "一件色彩鲜艳的斗篷，有“Fp”符号作为装饰。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "cloak"
msgid_plural "cloaks"
msgstr[0] "披风"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr ""
"一件套在衣服外面、覆盖全身的披风。\n"
"\"穿上去像是一名传奇的流浪武士。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "fur cloak"
msgid_plural "fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "毛皮披风"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr ""
"一件套在衣服外面、覆盖全身的毛皮披风，防雨，更加厚重，更加保暖。\n"
"\"穿上去就像一个披着兽皮的维京之王。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "leather cloak"
msgid_plural "leather cloaks"
msgstr[0] "皮披风"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A heavy leather cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  Provides decent "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"一件套在衣服外面、覆盖全身的皮革披风，防雨，更加厚重，防护更高。\n"
"\"穿上去就像一个威风凛凛的将军。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool cloak"
msgid_plural "wool cloaks"
msgstr[0] "羊毛披风"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy woolen cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "一件套在衣服外面、覆盖全身的羊毛披风，更加保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Jedi cloak"
msgid_plural "Jedi cloaks"
msgstr[0] "绝地武士斗篷"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Jedi cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"Long, flowing robes.  Simple and comfortable to wear.  Be sure to tear it "
"off dramatically before fighting any foes!"
msgstr ""
"一条长而飘逸的长袍，样式简单穿着舒适。\n"
"\"记得在对敌之前，将其戏剧性地撕碎！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks"
msgstr[0] "FB-51 光学披风"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your optical cloak flickers as it becomes transparent."
msgstr "你的光学披风闪了几下，变得透明了。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "You don't have enough UPS charges to turn on the %s"
msgstr "你的UPS能量不足以打开%s"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak (on)', 'str_pl': 'FB51
#. optical cloaks (on)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  You must be carrying a "
"unified power supply, or UPS, to use it.  Activate to toggle visibility."
msgstr ""
"一件塑料披风，镶嵌有照相机和LED灯。当被激活并穿戴之后，你将会在普通视觉上完全隐身。你需要一个统一化电源，或者说UPS，来供电使用它。激活它以切换隐身模式。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks (on)"
msgstr[0] "FB-51 光学披风（开）"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak (on)', 'str_pl': 'FB51
#. optical cloaks (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "The %s flickers for a moment as it becomes opaque."
msgstr "%s闪了几下，然后变得不透明了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool poncho"
msgid_plural "wool ponchos"
msgstr[0] "羊毛斗篷"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool poncho'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A simple wool garment worn over the torso.  Provides a bit of protection."
msgstr "一件披在上身的样式简单的羊毛服饰，能提供一些防护，而且保暖效果很棒。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "snuggie"
msgid_plural "snuggies"
msgstr[0] "毛毯衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'snuggie'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Perfect for reading all those books you scavenged."
msgstr "一件温暖而又舒适的保暖长内衣。能让你舒服地躺着阅读你捡回来的书。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "turnout coat"
msgid_plural "turnout coats"
msgstr[0] "消防外套"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'turnout coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy protective coat worn by firefighters.  Highly resistant to heat and "
"flame, it provides excellent protection from injury."
msgstr ""
"一件消防员经常穿的重型防护服。对高温和火焰有良好的防护性，提供优秀的伤害防护能力。\n"
"\"烈火雄心，尸海纵横。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "cassock"
msgid_plural "cassocks"
msgstr[0] "教士长袍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cassock'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A piece of clerical clothing, usually worn by Christian priests."
msgstr "一件通常是由基督教牧师穿着的神职人员服装。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur coat"
msgid_plural "fur coats"
msgstr[0] "毛皮大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm."
msgstr "一件毛皮大衣，有些口袋，保暖效果非常棒。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faux fur coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A garishly-colored faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not "
"as warm as the natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."
msgstr "一件华丽的人造毛皮大衣，有两个小口袋。虽然不像天然毛皮那么温暖，但它给你带来一些独特的风情。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sable coat"
msgid_plural "sable coats"
msgstr[0] "貂皮大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sable coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A very well-made fur coat, featuring thick panels of sable fur.  Very warm "
"and very good-looking."
msgstr "一条精心制造的貂皮大衣，厚厚的貂皮看起来非常漂亮，同时非常保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "lab coat"
msgid_plural "lab coats"
msgstr[0] "实验室大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lab coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket"
" protector."
msgstr "一件多用于科学家实验时穿着的长长的白色大褂，两侧有几个大口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rain coat"
msgid_plural "rain coats"
msgstr[0] "雨衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rain coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A plastic coat with a hood and two very large pockets.  Provides protection "
"from rain."
msgstr "一件有两个大口袋的带帽塑料雨衣。能让你在雨中保持干爽。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "gutskin parka"
msgid_plural "gutskin parkas"
msgstr[0] "爱斯基摩肠制大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gutskin parka'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An intricately sewn coat of treated and split intestines, prized for its "
"light weight and waterproofness among the indigenous peoples of the arctic."
msgstr "一件经过精心缝制的防寒大衣，使用处理过的割开的动物肠子制成。因其轻便防水，在北极的土著居民中备受青睐。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "winter coat"
msgid_plural "winter coats"
msgstr[0] "防寒大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'winter coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A padded coat with deep pockets and a hood.  Very warm."
msgstr "一件有着深口袋和兜帽的棉大衣，非常保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "duster"
msgid_plural "dusters"
msgstr[0] "防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A rugged full-length duster coat.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长棉制防尘风衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur duster"
msgid_plural "fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "毛皮防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长厚毛皮制防尘风衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faux fur duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for "
"storing things."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长厚人造毛皮制防尘风衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather duster"
msgid_plural "leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "皮制防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick leather full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长厚皮革防尘风衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "survivor duster"
msgid_plural "survivor dusters"
msgstr[0] "幸存者防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A Kevlar armored custom full-length duster, covered with pouches and "
"pockets.  Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr "一件凯夫拉强化的自制全身长防尘风衣，有许多的口袋，舒适、耐用，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "greatcoat"
msgid_plural "greatcoats"
msgstr[0] "羊毛大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'greatcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, full-length wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "一件覆盖全身的、相当保暖的厚重羊毛大衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "hakama"
msgid_plural "hakamas"
msgstr[0] "和服袴裤"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hakama'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain black hakama for use in kendo and other martial arts."
msgstr "一件剑道等武术练习时使用的黑色和服裤裙。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hakama'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A flowing, pleated garment which can be worn over a kimono."
msgstr "一种可以穿在和服外面的飘逸的衣服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "bathrobe"
msgid_plural "bathrobes"
msgstr[0] "浴袍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bathrobe'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An outer garment of absorbent, towel-like material traditionally worn to "
"cover one's nakedness to and from the bath.  It makes you wish you had "
"running water to bathe with."
msgstr "入浴和出浴所穿的服饰，多为毛巾质地的，这样可以更好的吸收身上的水分并包裹住身体。它让你回想到躺在浴缸里泡澡的日子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "army jacket"
msgid_plural "army jacket"
msgstr[0] "军装夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'army jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A tough jacket with lots of pockets.  Favored by the military."
msgstr "一件结实的夹克外套，外面有许多口袋。深受军人喜爱。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "厨师夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "chef's jacket"}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This double-breasted uniform is unusually thick to protect against the heat "
"of the kitchen."
msgstr ""
"一件相当厚、用来阻隔厨房高温的双排扣制服。\n"
"\"康师傅套装之一。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "emergency jacket"
msgid_plural "emergency jackets"
msgstr[0] "急救夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'emergency jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A bright & cheaply made FEMA-issue windbreaker jacket with a hood.  One "
"size, fits none.  Helps keep you unfrozen & visible for rescuers."
msgstr ""
"一件联邦紧急事务管理署分发的，有着鲜艳的红色反光条的廉价应急防风夹克，带了一顶兜帽。政府统一定制了一个谁穿都不会合身的尺寸，但能够帮助你保持体温并让搜救人员及时发现你。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "flannel jacket"
msgid_plural "flannel jackets"
msgstr[0] "法兰绒夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flannel jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from flannel-style denim, favored by outdoorsy types.  "
"Provides decent protection from cuts."
msgstr "一件法兰绒牛仔布制成的夹克，广受户外运动者的喜爱。提供不错的斩击保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "jean jacket"
msgid_plural "jean jackets"
msgstr[0] "牛仔夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jean jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from denim.  Provides decent protection from cuts."
msgstr "一件用牛仔布制成的夹克，有着一排工字纽扣、缝有双胸袋、标志性衬衫领。为你提供了良好的斩击保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from denim.  Provides decent protection from cuts.  This one "
"is haphazardly covered with patches featuring metal band logos."
msgstr "一件用牛仔布制成的夹克。有着一排工字纽扣、缝有双胸袋、标志性衬衫领。为你提供了良好的斩击保护。上面有一个金属质地带标志的补丁。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather jacket"
msgid_plural "leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "皮夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from thick leather.  Cumbersome, but offers excellent "
"protection from cuts."
msgstr ""
"一件采用特定工艺加工成的皮革做成的厚实外衣，有着皮制衣物一贯优良的特性：保暖、舒适、耐用，有着比较出色的防护能力。\n"
"\"机器刺客中型号为T-800、T-850行为显示出对此项物品的格外偏好。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "red leather jacket"
msgid_plural "red leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "红色皮夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'red leather jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A candy-apple-red leather jacket with black strips and shoulder protrusions."
"  It has a number of zippers and snaps in the front."
msgstr "一件苹果红的皮夹克，表面有些黑色条纹和肩带装饰。正面有许多拉链和纽扣。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "light jacket"
msgid_plural "light jackets"
msgstr[0] "轻型夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thin cotton jacket with a hood.  Good for brisk weather."
msgstr "一件有兜帽的棉制轻型夹克，没有什么储存空间，还不保暖，但非常轻便舒适。适合在天气凉爽时穿着。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "windbreaker"
msgid_plural "windbreakers"
msgstr[0] "冲锋衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'windbreaker'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A light synthetic jacket with a hood.  Not very warm, but will keep out the "
"rain."
msgstr "一件带有兜帽的合成纤维夹克，轻便耐用。保暖效果一般，但能够防雨。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "judo gi"
msgid_plural "judo gis"
msgstr[0] "柔道道服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'judo gi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Plain white judo gi.  Thick and a little stiff, it gives minor protection "
"from cuts and punches."
msgstr "一件质地厚硬的白色柔道袍服，能稍微防护下练习时的割伤和拳伤。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "karate gi"
msgid_plural "karate gis"
msgstr[0] "空手道道服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'karate gi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Plain white karate gi.  Loose and flowing, it offers little protection, and "
"little encumbrance."
msgstr "一件纯白色的空手道服。平滑而宽松，几乎没有防护能力，但也不累赘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kariginu"
msgid_plural "kariginus"
msgstr[0] "狩衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kariginu'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Shinto robe with several layers and very wide "
"sleeves."
msgstr "一件传统贴身的神道教斗篷，斗篷有好几层内衬以及具有非常宽大的袖子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "keikogi"
msgid_plural "keikogis"
msgstr[0] "武道服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'keikogi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain white keikogi for use in martial arts."
msgstr "一件纯白色的武道服，在练习武术时使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kimono"
msgid_plural "kimonos"
msgstr[0] "和服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kimono'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Japanese robe, wrapped around the body with a "
"sash."
msgstr "长至脚踝的传统日式长袍，穿好后还得缠上腰带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "yukata"
msgid_plural "yukatas"
msgstr[0] "日式浴衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'yukata'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An easy-to-wear, breezy robe secured with a sash.  Essentially Japanese "
"pajamas.  Great for summer nights."
msgstr "一种易穿、透气、用腰带固定的长袍。基本上是日本的睡衣。适合在夏天的夜晚穿着。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "haori"
msgid_plural "haoris"
msgstr[0] "羽织"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'haori'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose coat with wide sleeves that is worn unfastened over a kimono.  It is"
" jet black with sparse, tasteful golden embroidery."
msgstr "一种穿在和服上的宽松的大衣，袖子宽大。它是乌黑色的，上面有稀疏的、雅致的金色刺绣。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kittel"
msgid_plural "kittels"
msgstr[0] "基特尔白袍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kittel'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A white, knee-length cotton robe, traditionally worn by Jews on special "
"occasions."
msgstr "一件及膝的白色棉制长袍，是犹太人在特殊场合穿着的传统服饰。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "peacoat"
msgid_plural "peacoats"
msgstr[0] "厚呢短大衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'peacoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A heavy wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "一件厚重的羊绒大衣，由18世纪的荷兰船员发明。英国及荷兰海军都曾经将这种厚重的方形短上衣当做正式的军舰服装，以应对天气极为可怕的寒冷冬日。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "robe"
msgid_plural "robes"
msgstr[0] "长袍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'robe'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting outer garment with sleeves, and a mysterious amount of well-"
"hidden pockets."
msgstr "一个宽松的长袖外袍，内侧隐藏着几个小口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "ski jacket"
msgid_plural "ski jackets"
msgstr[0] "滑雪衫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ski jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with"
" sizable pockets."
msgstr "专为高山滑雪而设计的保暖透气连帽衫。非常暖和，带有很大的口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless dusters"
msgstr[0] "无袖防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A rugged full-length duster that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty "
"of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件耐用的、等身长的无袖防尘大衣，让你的手臂不受束缚。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "无袖毛皮防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless fur duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick fur full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚实的毛皮制的防尘罩衫，让你的手臂有足够的伸展自由。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "无袖人造毛皮防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless faux fur duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick, sleeveless faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many "
"pockets for storing things."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长厚人造毛皮制无袖防尘风衣，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless leather duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "无袖皮制防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless leather duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick leather full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚实的皮革制的防尘罩衫，让你的手臂有足够的伸展自由。衣服上有很多袋子让你放进子弹或者薯片什么的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless survivor duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless survivor dusters"
msgstr[0] "幸存者无袖防尘风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless survivor duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A custom Kevlar armored full-length duster without sleeves, covered with "
"pouches and pockets.  Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr "一件凯夫拉强化的自制全身长防尘风衣，有许多的口袋但是没有袖子，舒适、耐用，可以装很多东西。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "无袖风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thin cotton trenchcoat that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty of "
"storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件无袖的轻薄棉制风衣。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "无袖毛皮风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless fur trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick fur trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered.  Has"
" plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件无袖的厚实毛皮风衣，让你的手臂不受束缚。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "无袖人造毛皮风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat without sleeves.  Has plenty of storage space, "
"and looks pretty good."
msgstr "一件无袖的厚实人造毛皮风衣，让你的手臂不受束缚。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "无袖皮制风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless leather trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick leather trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered."
"  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件无袖的厚实皮革风衣，让你的手臂不受束缚。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless survivor trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless survivor trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "幸存者无袖风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless survivor trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A custom Kevlar armored trenchcoat without sleeves, covered with pouches and"
" pockets.  Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr "一件有镶嵌了凯夫拉片的自制无袖风衣，有许多的口袋，舒适、耐用，可以装很多东西。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless tunic"
msgid_plural "sleeveless tunics"
msgstr[0] "无袖上衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless tunic'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A sleeveless cloth garment that covers the torso and legs."
msgstr "一件无袖连身衣，覆盖了躯干和腿部。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "thawb"
msgid_plural "thawb"
msgstr[0] "阿拉伯长袍"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'thawb'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long, loose-fitting robe with wide sleeves, a traditional Arab garment."
msgstr "长而宽松大袖管的白袍，阿拉伯传统服饰。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thin cotton trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "一件薄的棉制风衣，缝着不少口袋，提供非常大的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "毛皮风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "一件厚厚的毛皮风衣，缝着不少口袋，提供非常大的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faux fur trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage, and "
"makes you the talk of the town."
msgstr "一件厚厚的人造毛皮风衣，缝着不少口袋，提供非常大的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "皮制风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick leather trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "一件厚厚的皮革风衣，缝着不少口袋，提供非常大的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "survivor trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "survivor trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "幸存者风衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor trenchcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A Kevlar armored custom trenchcoat, covered with pouches and pockets.  "
"Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr "一件有镶嵌了凯夫拉片的自制风衣，有许多的口袋，舒适、耐用，可以装很多东西。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "tunic"
msgid_plural "tunics"
msgstr[0] "束腰外衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tunic'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A simple garment long enough to cover down to the knees."
msgstr "一件简单的衣服，长度足以覆蓋膝盖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rag tunic"
msgid_plural "rag tunics"
msgstr[0] "布条束腰外衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rag tunic'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A poorly made long tunic with a string tied around the waist to keep it all "
"in place."
msgstr "一件粗制滥造的束腰外衣，用一根束腰带固定在位置上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "tuxedo"
msgid_plural "tuxedos"
msgstr[0] "燕尾礼服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tuxedo'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-body tuxedo.  Makes the apocalypse feel a little more classy."
msgstr ""
"一套全身燕尾服。\n"
"\"在末日来临之时也要有绅士风范。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "waistcoat"
msgid_plural "waistcoats"
msgstr[0] "西装背心"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'waistcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An elegant waistcoat.  Ideal for those occasions when wearing only a shirt "
"would be too casual and a suit would be just overdoing it."
msgstr "一件优雅的背心。当穿衬衫太随意，穿正装又太过的时候，就选择它吧。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "army winter jacket"
msgid_plural "army winter jackets"
msgstr[0] "防寒军装夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'army winter jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A tough hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  "
"Favored by the military."
msgstr "一件结实的外套，上面缝着不少口袋，有防寒衬里。军队指定用品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of eclipse glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of eclipse glasses"
msgstr[0] "日食护目镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of eclipse glasses', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. eclipse glasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of cardboard-framed glasses with UV and IR-filtered lenses topped "
"with a layer of aluminum coating.  They allow safe viewing of extremely "
"bright and harmful sources of light, like the sun during a solar eclipse."
msgstr ""
"一副用硬纸板作为镜框的眼镜，在已经过UV及IR镀膜的镜片外又再用一层铝箔覆盖。这让佩戴者能够用眼睛安全直视非常亮的会伤眼的光源，例如日食时的太阳。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of stylish sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "时尚太阳镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of stylish sunglasses', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. stylish sunglasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses.  Look good while keeping the glare out of your"
" eyes."
msgstr "一副时髦的太阳镜，看起来非常时尚，同时可以防止太阳光刺激导致的眩目。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of fit-over sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of fit-over sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "外式太阳镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of fit-over sunglasses', 'str_pl': 'pairs
#. of fit-over sunglasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of fit-over sunglasses designed to be worn over a pair of corrective "
"glasses.  Good for keeping the glare out of your eyes."
msgstr "一副外罩式太阳镜，可罩在普通眼镜外边，避免你的眼睛被太阳光刺激导致眩目。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of ballistic glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of ballistic glasses"
msgstr[0] "战术护目镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of ballistic glasses', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. ballistic glasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"Modern tactical eyewear that protects from small projectiles and fragments."
"  Provides excellent protection from environmental dangers."
msgstr ""
"一副现代战术护目镜，可防御小口径子弹和破片伤害，同时对于环境危害也能提供出色防护。\n"
"\"无法提供自动瞄准功能。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of bifocal glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of bifocal glasses"
msgstr[0] "双焦点眼镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of bifocal glasses', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. bifocal glasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and far-"
"sighted.  You can use them to focus sunlight."
msgstr "一副可调焦点的眼镜，针对同时近视及远视的人群。你可以用它来聚焦阳光。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "pair of eyeglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of eyeglasses"
msgstr[0] "近视眼镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of eyeglasses', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. eyeglasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse the "
"sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr "一副近视眼镜。凹透镜将阳光散射，所以无法用于生火。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "monocle"
msgid_plural "monocles"
msgstr[0] "单片眼镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'monocle'}
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
