#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boiled leather medium quadruped barding with
#. caprison', 'str_pl': 'boiled leather medium quadruped bardings with
#. caprison'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a battle between a monstrous "
"dragon and regal griffin.  You could put this on a friendly medium "
"quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰描述了一只恶龙与一匹皇家狮鹫之间的战斗。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a red dragon breathing fire on "
"cities.  You could put this on a friendly medium quadruped."
msgstr "一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰描述了一只红龙向城市喷吐烈火。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a bear on its hind legs and "
"forelegs outstretched in a menacing manner.  You could put this on a "
"friendly medium quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰描述了一只熊用后腿直立起来，并威胁性地伸展它的前腿，准备扑击。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting an assortment of fruits and "
"vegetables with a very large orange featured in the foreground.  You could "
"put this on a friendly medium quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰描绘了一个巨大的橘子，背景中还有各种水果蔬菜。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a massive vulture perched on a "
"mountain.  You could put this on a friendly medium quadruped."
msgstr "一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰描绘了一只栖息在高山上的秃鹫。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting the mythical Erymanthian boar in"
" various artistic forms.  You could put this on a friendly medium quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰以多种艺术形式描绘了希腊神话中凶恶的厄律曼托斯野猪。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison seems to be sponsored by Rycon Construction, "
"with a tag line of \"From down under to your home, we play all the roles "
"from start to finish!\".  You could put this on a friendly medium quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰看起来由瑞康建筑公司赞助，包含公司的广告词：\"从澳大利亚到您的家中，从动土到封顶，我们什么活都接！\"。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for medium quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison seems to be sponsored by Core Generator Tech,"
" with a tag line of \"Providing power solutions from culinary to graphic "
"design, we have the magic touch for your problems!\".  You could put this on"
" a friendly medium quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰看起来由核心发电科技公司赞助，包含公司的广告词：\"提供从烹饪到平面设计的电源解决方案，有难题找我们！\"。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的中型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
