#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biosilicified chitin small quadruped armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from "
"biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a "
"friendly small quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套自制的装甲，包含保护颈部的鸡颈、保护胸部的当胸和保护臀部的搭后，上面的生物硅化甲壳片和薄薄的网状织物贴合在一起。你可以将这套装甲穿在一匹友好的小型四足动物身上。"

