#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from chitin "
"fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly small quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套自制的装甲，包含保护颈部的鸡颈、保护胸部的当胸和保护臀部的搭后，上面的甲壳片和薄薄的网状织物贴合在一起。你可以将这套装甲穿在一匹友好的小型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid "chainmail small quadruped armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail small quadruped armors"
