#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainmail small quadruped armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"Protecteth yon hund fram ful daemons!  A heavy covering of chainmail, "
"suitably made for small quadrupeds as protection.  You could put this on a "
"friendly small quadruped."
msgstr "一套厚厚的铁环链甲，专门为保护小型四足动物打造。你可以将这套链甲穿在一头友好的小型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather small quadruped barding with caprison"
msgid_plural "boiled leather small quadruped bardings with caprison"
msgstr[0] "小型华丽皮革兽铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boiled leather small quadruped barding with
#. caprison', 'str_pl': 'boiled leather small quadruped bardings with
#. caprison'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for small quadrupeds consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a battle between a monstrous "
"dragon and regal griffin.  You could put this on a friendly small quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一套全身兽铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。铠甲上的装饰描述了一只恶龙与一匹皇家狮鹫之间的战斗。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的小型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather small quadruped barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather small quadruped bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "小型骨钉皮革兽铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boiled leather small quadruped barding with
#. bones', 'str_pl': 'boiled leather small quadruped bardings with bones'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"Decorative bones affixed to leather small quadruped barding to invoke fear "
"in bandits and raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly "
"small quadruped."
msgstr "一套鞣制皮革制成的兽铠，上面附加了许多装饰性的骨钉，足以使强盗、掠夺者和商人们感到恐惧！你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的小型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid "small quadruped rain sheet"
msgid_plural "small quadruped rain sheets"
msgstr[0] "小型兽用雨披"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small quadruped rain sheet'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering adapted for small quadrupeds to protect from acid "
"rain and other caustic sources.  You could put this on a friendly small "
"quadruped."
msgstr "一层薄薄的能覆盖动物全身的塑料布，能够防护酸雨和其他腐蚀性物质。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的小型四足动物身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
