#. ~ Description for {'str': 'superalloy small quadruped armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_small_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin mesh interwoven with superalloy plates for military working small "
"quadrupeds that covers from the dewlap to the croup, down to the elbows.  "
"You could put this on a friendly small quadruped."
msgstr ""
"一层薄薄网状织物，与超合金板编织在一起，用于小型四足动物，从颈下一直覆盖至臀部，下方延伸至膝盖处。你可以将这套铠甲穿在一匹友好的小型四足动物身上。"

