#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "heavy power armor helmet"
msgid_plural "heavy power armor helmets"
msgstr[0] "重型动力装甲头盔"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heavy power armor helmet'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heavy power armor helmet (active)', 'str_pl':
#. 'heavy power armor helmets (active)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"An extremely heavy-duty fully enclosed combat helmet for hazardous "
"environments, this was designed to fit with a powered exoskeleton.  In the "
"field, soldiers reported that the protection was not worth the awkward size "
"and limited visuals.  The environmental controls function best with direct-"
"skin contact."
msgstr ""
"一个特别沉重的全覆盖式的危险环境防护作战头盔，设计与动力外骨骼一同使用，使用内置相机扩大视野范围。实地测试的士兵报告它所提供的额外防护与它尴尬的体积和有限的视野相比起来并不值得。环境防护功能需要直接接触皮肤才能更好生效。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "heavy power armor helmet (active)"
msgid_plural "heavy power armor helmets (active)"
msgstr[0] "重型动力装甲头盔（开启）"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "light power armor helmet"
msgid_plural "light power armor helmets"
msgstr[0] "轻型动力装甲头盔"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light power armor helmet'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light power armor helmet (active)', 'str_pl':
#. 'light power armor helmets (active)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"This full-enclosure helmet was designed based on commercial diving "
"equipment, in response to complaints that earlier designs were impossible to"
" use in combat.  While still a little more restrictive than regular combat "
"headgear - and frustrating should your nose itch - this one received far "
"better reviews from soldiers.  Sadly, civilization ended before they could "
"roll out in significant numbers.  The environmental controls function best "
"with direct-skin contact."
msgstr ""
"这种全封闭式头盔是依照商业潜水头盔设计的，以回应早期型号的使用者对其无法在作战时使用的抱怨。虽然比常规的战斗头盔更限制行动——而且当你鼻痒的时候会让你发疯——但这个型号却得到了士兵们更好的评价。可悲的是，在它进入批量生产前人类文明就已经结束了。环境防护功能需要直接接触皮肤才能更好生效。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "light power armor helmet (active)"
msgid_plural "light power armor helmets (active)"
msgstr[0] "轻型动力装甲头盔（开启）"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor hauling frame"
msgid_plural "power armor hauling frames"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲携行系统"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor hauling frame'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy duty hauling frame designed to interface with military exoskeletons."
msgstr "一个与军用外骨骼配套使用的携行系统。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor weapon rack"
msgid_plural "power armor weapon racks"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲武器架"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor weapon rack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy duty set of clamps and rail interfaces, secured to the back.  Can "
"comfortably hold blades or firearms of various sizes.  Designed to interface"
" with a military exoskeleton.  Activate to holster/draw a blade or gun."
msgstr "一套重型夹具和导轨接口，固定在背部。可以舒适地放置各种尺寸的刀具或枪支。设计用于与军事外骨骼接口。激活后可收纳或拔出刀具或枪支。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor leg mount"
msgid_plural "power armor leg mounts"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲腿部挂架"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor leg mount'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A set of seals and rail interfaces to comfortably hold a wide range of "
"firearms and tools.  Designed to interface with a military exoskeleton, "
"clipped to the leg.  Activate to holster/draw a blade, tool, or gun."
msgstr "一套密封件和导轨接口，可舒适地放置各种枪支和工具。设计用于与军事外骨骼接口，夹在腿部。激活后可收纳或拔出刀具、工具或枪支。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor magazine carrier"
msgid_plural "power armor magazine carriers"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲弹匣携带器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor magazine carrier'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A set of compartments capable of carrying two magazines close at hand, "
"including larger drum mags, ammo belts, or UPS batteries.  Designed to "
"interface with a military exoskeleton.  Activate to store/retrieve your "
"magazines."
msgstr "一组能够近距离携带两个弹匣的隔层，包括较大的圆鼓弹匣，弹药带或UPS电池。设计用于与军用外骨骼相连接。激活以存储/检索您的弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor back holster"
msgid_plural "power armor back holsters"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲枪套（背）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor back holster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A leather holster, big enough for a rifle or other large gun.  Designed to "
"be strapped to the back, it's been converted to clip onto power armor.  "
"Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一个绑在背部的皮枪套，大小足以容纳步枪及其他大型枪械。已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。激活后可收纳或拔出枪支。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor holster"
msgid_plural "power armor holsters"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲枪套"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor holster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol sized guns.  It's been "
"converted to clip onto power armor.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一个挂在臀部的皮枪套，可以放一把手枪尺寸的枪械。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor fast draw holster"
msgid_plural "power armor fast draw holsters"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲快拔枪套"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor fast draw holster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick draw holster for small guns.  It's been converted to "
"clip onto power armor.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一款舒适的小型枪支快拔枪套。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor shoulder holster"
msgid_plural "power armor shoulder holsters"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲枪套（肩）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor shoulder holster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A shoulder holster that allows a gun to hang comfortably beneath the arm, "
"converted to clip onto power armor.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一种能让枪支舒适地挂在手臂下方的肩部枪套。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。激活它来收拔枪械。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor XL holster"
msgid_plural "power armor XL holsters"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲枪套（XL）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor XL holster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster, it's been "
"converted to clip onto power armor.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr "一种由环和带子组成的腰带枪套，用于携带大型枪械。比标准枪套稍显笨重，已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。激活后可收纳或拔出枪支。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor ring holster"
msgid_plural "power armor ring holsters"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲环式工具套"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor ring holster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A combination of leather and a metal ring to hold an axe, hammer, or similar"
" tool at your side.  It's been converted to clip onto power armor."
msgstr "由皮革和金属环组合而成，可将斧头、锤子或类似工具挂在身侧。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor baldric"
msgid_plural "power armor baldrics"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲大刀鞘（肩）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor baldric'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for anything up to a longsword, or even a bit"
" larger than that.  Designed to be worn at the waist, it's been converted to"
" clip onto power armor.  Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr "一个皮革刀鞘，大小足够容纳一把长剑，或是比它稍大的武器。刀鞘穿在腰间，它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上，使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor back scabbard"
msgid_plural "power armor back scabbards"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲刀鞘（背）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor back scabbard'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for almost any sword.  Designed to be "
"strapped to the back, it's been converted to clip onto power armor.  "
"Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr "一个皮制的刀鞘，足够容纳大部分刀剑类武器，刀鞘通过肩带系在后背，它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor scabbard"
msgid_plural "power armor scabbards"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲剑鞘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor scabbard'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades.  It's "
"been converted to clip onto power armor.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个巨大的可调节刀鞘，大小足够容纳大型刀剑类武器。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor sheath"
msgid_plural "power armor sheaths"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲刀鞘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor sheath'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A leather sheath for holding knives and other small blades.  It's been "
"converted to clip onto power armor.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个皮革小刀鞘，大小足够容纳匕首，或是类似的小型刀具。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "power armor ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲弹药包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor ammo satchel'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition, "
"rockets will not fit.  It's been converted to clip onto power armor.  "
"Activate to store ammunition."
msgstr "一个小袋子，可以用来存储大多数的小型弹药，但是装不下火箭弹。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上，激活它来存储弹药。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor magazine satchel"
msgid_plural "power armor magazine satchels"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲弹匣包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor magazine satchel'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist which is capable of holding two "
"magazines, ammo belts, speedloaders of nearly any size close at hand.  It's "
"been converted to clip onto power armor."
msgstr "一种佩戴在腰间的布制弹药包，可随身携带两个弹匣、弹药带和几乎任何尺寸的快速装弹器。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor leg magazine pouch"
msgid_plural "power armor leg magazine pouches"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲弹匣包（腿）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor leg magazine pouch', 'str_pl':
#. 'power armor leg magazine pouches'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg and capable of holding "
"two magazines close at hand, converted to clip onto power armor."
msgstr "一个绑在腿上的布包，能够装下两个弹匣，保证弹药随手取用。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor leg magazine satchel"
msgid_plural "power armor leg magazine satchels"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲弹匣包（腿）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor leg magazine satchel'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to the leg, capable of holding a "
"single magazine, ammo belt, or speedloader of modest size.  It's been "
"converted to clip onto power armor."
msgstr "一个绑在腿上的弹匣包。可容纳单个弹匣、弹药带或大小适中的快速装弹器。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor leg ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "power armor leg ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "弹药包（腿）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor leg ammo satchel'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch wrapped around the leg that can be used to store most types of"
" small ammunition, rockets will not fit.  It's been converted to clip onto "
"power armor.  Activate to store ammunition."
msgstr "缠绕在腿上的一个小袋子，可以用来存储大多数的小型弹药，但是装不下火箭弹。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上，激活它来存储弹药。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor grenade ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "power armor grenade ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲榴弹弹药袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor grenade ammo pouch', 'str_pl':
#. 'power armor grenade ammo pouches'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch for storing cartridge grenades with straps for attaching it to"
" your belt or other webbing, converted to clip onto power armor."
msgstr "一个小口袋，用来存储榴弹弹药。自带一条带子，可以附加到腰带或者其他带子上。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor hand grenade pouch"
msgid_plural "power armor hand grenade pouches"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲手榴弹袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor hand grenade pouch', 'str_pl':
#. 'power armor hand grenade pouches'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pouch for holding up to four full-sized grenades of various types, "
"converted to clip onto power armor."
msgstr "一个能存放四颗各式手雷的大型榴弹袋。它已改装为可以夹在动力装甲上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "survivor armored exo-suit"
msgid_plural "survivor armored exo-suits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者裝甲外骨骼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor armored exo-suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Although power armor took the world's militaries by storm, not everyone has "
"access to it.  This particular suit is cobbled together from scavenged "
"materials, but it works for what it is."
msgstr "尽管动力装甲风靡全球军队，但并非人人都能拥有。 这套特殊的盔甲是用捡来的材料拼凑而成的，但就其本质而言，它还是有效的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "survivor armored exo-suit (active)"
msgid_plural "survivor armored exo-suit (active)"
msgstr[0] "幸存者裝甲外骨骼（开启）"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'survivor armored exo-suit (active)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Although power armor took the world's militaries by storm, not everyone has "
"access to it.  This particular suit is cobbled together from scavenged "
"materials, but it works for what it is.  It is currently turned on, activate"
" it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"尽管动力装甲风靡全球军队，但并非人人都能拥有。 这套特殊的盔甲是用捡来的材料拼凑而成的，但就其本质而言，它还是有效的。当前已打开，激活后即可关闭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "military exo-suit"
msgid_plural "military exo-suits"
msgstr[0] "军用外骨骼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military exo-suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Although power armor took the world's militaries by storm, the technologies "
"used to make them also allowed for smaller, less protective external rigging"
" that rely on UPS to boost strength and speed, ones designed for operatives "
"or light infantry."
msgstr ""
"尽管动力装甲风靡全球军队，用于制造它的技术也催生了体积更小、防护性较弱的外部装置，这些装置依赖UPS来增强力量和速度，专为特工或轻步兵设计。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "military exo-suit (active)"
msgid_plural "military exo-suits (active)"
msgstr[0] "军用外骨骼（开启）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military exo-suit (active)', 'str_pl': 'military
#. exo-suits (active)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Although power armor took the world's militaries by storm, the technologies "
"used to make them also allowed for smaller, less protective external rigging"
" that rely on UPS to boost strength and speed, ones designed for operatives "
"or light infantry rather than heavy infantry.  It is currently turned on, "
"activate it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"尽管动力装甲风靡全球各国军队，用于制造它的技术也促使了更小型、保护性较弱的外部装置的出现，这些装置依靠UPS来增强力量和速度，设计上更适用于特工或轻步兵，而非重装步兵。当前已打开，激活后即可关闭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "industrial exo-suit"
msgid_plural "industrial exo-suits"
msgstr[0] "工业用外骨骼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'industrial exo-suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Although power armor took the world's militaries by storm, the technologies "
"used to make them also allowed for smaller, industrial powered suits meant "
"for heavy lifting."
msgstr "尽管动力装甲风靡全球军队，用于制造它们的技术也使得用于重型举升的较小工业动力装甲成为可能。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "industrial exo-suit (active)"
msgid_plural "industrial exo-suits (active)"
msgstr[0] "工业用外骨骼（开启）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'industrial exo-suit (active)', 'str_pl':
#. 'industrial exo-suits (active)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Although power armor took the world's militaries by storm, the technologies "
"used to make them also allowed for industrial powered suits meant for heavy "
"lifting.  It is currently turned on, activate it to turn it off."
msgstr "尽管动力装甲风靡全球军队，但用于制造它们的技术也使得工业用动力装甲成为可能，这些装甲用于重型举升。当前已打开，激活后即可关闭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "knit cowl"
msgid_plural "knit cowls"
msgstr[0] "针织围脖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'knit cowl'}
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A snuggly woolen cowl.  It's one of those stylish and bulky cowls you see in"
" fashion magazines."
msgstr "一件松垮的羊毛围脖。这件款式和你在时尚杂志上看到那种时髦而笨重的款式一样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "headscarf"
msgid_plural "headscarfs"
msgstr[0] "头巾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'headscarf'}
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "A loose cloth worn over the head and around the neck."
msgstr "戴在头上和脖子上的一块宽松的布。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "keffiyeh"
msgid_plural "keffiyehs"
msgstr[0] "阿拉伯头巾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'keffiyeh'}
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A type of headdress traditionally used in the Middle East.  It can be used "
"in different ways to protect the head and mouth from the elements."
msgstr "一条阿拉伯国家男子普遍穿戴的头巾，沙漠坏境产物，夏季遮阳防晒，冬天御寒保暖，有着多种戴法。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "cyan scarf"
msgid_plural "cyan scarfs"
msgstr[0] "青色领巾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cyan scarf'}
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A simple cloth scarf worn by Marloss Voices.  Wherever the Voices go, long "
"sought peace soon follows, for better or for worse."
msgstr "一条马洛斯之声成员佩戴的造型朴素的青色领巾。据说只要是马洛斯之声所到之处，人们期盼已久的和平总会到来。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "ring holster"
msgid_plural "ring holsters"
msgstr[0] "环式工具套"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'ring holster'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "Sheath tool"
msgstr "收纳工具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ring holster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A combination of leather and a metal ring to hold an axe, hammer, or similar"
" tool at your side."
msgstr "一条带着金属环的皮带，可以在你的腰间收纳一把斧头、锤子或类似工具。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "baldric"
msgid_plural "baldrics"
msgstr[0] "大刀鞘（肩）"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'baldric'}.
#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'back scabbard'}.
#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'scabbard'}.
#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'hollow cane'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "Sheath sword"
msgstr "收刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'baldric'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for anything up to a longsword, or even a bit"
" larger than that.  Designed to be worn at the waist, secured by a shoulder "
"belt.  Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr "一个皮革刀鞘，大小足够容纳一把长剑，或是比它稍大的武器。刀鞘穿在腰间，加以肩带系稳。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "ankle sheath"
msgid_plural "ankle sheaths"
msgstr[0] "小刀鞘（脚）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ankle sheath'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use "
"without practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个穿在脚踝上的小型刀鞘。不经过练习用起来很笨拙。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "wrist sheath"
msgid_plural "wrist sheaths"
msgstr[0] "小刀鞘（腕）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrist sheath'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed knife sheath worn on the wrist.  It is quick to use but "
"can only carry very small blades.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "这是一种佩戴在手腕上的小型隐藏式小刀鞘。它使用起来迅速，但只能容纳非常小的刀片。激活以将武器插入/抽出。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "back scabbard"
msgid_plural "back scabbards"
msgstr[0] "刀鞘（背）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'back scabbard'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for almost any sword.  Designed to be "
"strapped to the back, it's very difficult to draw from without considerable "
"practice.  Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr "一个皮制的刀鞘，足够容纳大部分刀剑类武器，刀鞘通过肩带系在后背，不经过一定练习很难将武器快速拔出。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "scabbard"
msgid_plural "scabbards"
msgstr[0] "大刀鞘（腰）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scabbard'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades.  "
"Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个巨大的可调节刀鞘，大小足够容纳大型刀剑类武器。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "sheath"
msgid_plural "sheathes"
msgstr[0] "小刀鞘（腰）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sheath', 'str_pl': 'sheathes'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather sheath for holding knives and other small blades.  It is easy to "
"use without much practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个皮革小刀鞘，大小足够容纳匕首，或是类似的小型刀具。它很容易使用，不需要太多练习。使用它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "birchbark sheath"
msgid_plural "birchbark sheathes"
msgstr[0] "桦树皮刀鞘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'birchbark sheath', 'str_pl': 'birchbark
#. sheathes'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A hand made sheath made from birch bark, for holding knives and other small "
"blades.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一种由桦树皮手工制成的刀鞘，用于收纳刀具和其他小型利刃。激活可收起/拔出武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "spear strap"
msgid_plural "spear straps"
msgstr[0] "长矛背带"

#. ~ Use action holster_msg for {'str': 'spear strap'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "You holster your %s."
msgstr "你套好 %s。"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'spear strap'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid "Holster weapon"
msgstr "收起武器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spear strap'}
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap tied around the torso for toting spears, two-handed axes, or"
" similar weapons while keeping your hands free.  Activate to holster/draw a "
"weapon."
msgstr "一根系在身上的皮带子，可以拴住长矛、双手斧或类似武器，同时解放双手。激活它来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "wooden shield"
msgid_plural "wooden shields"
msgstr[0] "木盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A crude wooden shield lacking any metal or leather reinforcement.  Tolerable"
" weight but not very tough."
msgstr "一件粗糙的木制盾牌，缺少金属及皮革的加固部件。可接受的重量但不坚固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "large wooden shield"
msgid_plural "large wooden shields"
msgstr[0] "大木盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large wooden shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A crude wooden tower shield lacking any metal or leather reinforcement.  "
"Bulky, but offers a decent amount of protection."
msgstr "一个粗糙的木制防御塔盾，缺少金属及皮革的加固部件。相当笨重，但提供不错的防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "riot shield"
msgid_plural "riot shields"
msgstr[0] "防暴盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'riot shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A large but fairly light plastic shield designed for riot police officers.  "
"Not too encumbering, but designed for fending off thrown rocks rather than "
"bullets."
msgstr "一块大而相对轻便的塑料盾牌，设计用于防暴警察。它不会过于沉重，但更适用于抵挡被投掷的石块，而不是子弹。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "ballistic shield"
msgid_plural "ballistic shields"
msgstr[0] "防弹盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ballistic shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A heavy composite shield used by SWAT teams and other armed forces.  It can "
"handle the occasional pistol bullet, but its heavy-duty nature means it's "
"quite encumbering and doesn't cover the legs very well."
msgstr "一种由特警队和其他武装部队使用的重型复合材料盾牌。它能够抵挡偶然射出的手枪子弹，但其重型设计使其相当笨重，且对腿部保护不够完善。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "large ballistic shield"
msgid_plural "large ballistic shields"
msgstr[0] "大型防弹盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large ballistic shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A tall composite shield used by SWAT teams and other armed forces, rated for"
" pistol bullets.  Covers the body and legs quite well, but is much heavier "
"and more encumbering than lighter models."
msgstr ""
"一种由特警队和其他武装部队使用的高大复合材料盾牌，防护等级可抵御手枪子弹。它能很好地为身体和腿部提供掩护，但与轻型盾牌相比要重得多，也更笨重。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "leather-reinforced shield"
msgid_plural "leather-reinforced shields"
msgstr[0] "皮革强化盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather-reinforced shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A simple round shield made of wood with leather reinforcement.  Sturdier and"
" stronger than a simple wooden shield, and less encumbering than a metal "
"one."
msgstr "一个由木头制成并用皮革加固的简单圆形盾牌。比普通的木盾更坚固、更强韧，而且比金属盾牌更轻便。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "banded shield"
msgid_plural "banded shields"
msgstr[0] "环带盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'banded shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A simple round shield made of wood with bands of iron reinforcing it.  "
"Stronger than a simple wooden shield, but also more encumbering."
msgstr "一个由木头制成并用铁条加固的简单圆形盾牌。比普通的木盾更强韧，但也更加沉重。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "large leather-reinforced shield"
msgid_plural "large leather-reinforced shields"
msgstr[0] "大型皮革强化盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large leather-reinforced shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A large shield made of wood with leather reinforcement.  Sturdier and "
"stronger than a basic wooden shield, and less encumbering than a metal one."
msgstr "一个由木头制成并用皮革加固的大型圆形盾牌。比基本的木盾更坚固、更强韧，而且比金属盾牌更轻便。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "large banded shield"
msgid_plural "large banded shields"
msgstr[0] "大型环带盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large banded shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A large shield made of wood with iron bands reinforcing it.  Stronger than a"
" simple wooden shield, but also more encumbering."
msgstr "一个由木头制成并用铁条加固的大型圆形盾牌。比普通的木盾更强韧，但也更加沉重。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "welded shield"
msgid_plural "welded shields"
msgstr[0] "焊接盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'welded shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A shield made out of steel armor plating with handles welded on.  It's a lot"
" heavier and less well-made compared to a proper medieval shield, but it "
"certainly works."
msgstr "由钢铁装甲板制成，焊接了手柄的盾牌。与合适的中世纪盾牌相比，它更重且制作较差，但绝对能够发挥作用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "welded hard steel shield"
msgid_plural "welded hard steel shields"
msgstr[0] "焊接硬钢盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'welded hard steel shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A shield made out of hardened steel armor plating with handles welded on.  "
"While incredibly heavy compared to a traditional shield, it's also quite "
"protective."
msgstr "一面由硬化钢装甲板制成的盾牌，上面焊接有把手。与传统盾牌相比，它异常沉重，但防护能力也相当出色。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "welded composite shield"
msgid_plural "welded composite shields"
msgstr[0] "焊接复合盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'welded composite shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A shield made out of military grade vehicle armor with handles welded on.  "
"Incredibly heavy but can also take a fair bit of punishment."
msgstr "一面由军用级车辆装甲制成的盾牌，上面焊接有把手。极其沉重，但也能承受相当大的打击。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "welded superalloy shield"
msgid_plural "welded superalloy shields"
msgstr[0] "焊接超合金盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'welded superalloy shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A shield made out of superalloy armor plating with handles welded on.  It's "
"heavier and less well-made compared to a proper medieval shield, but it "
"certainly works."
msgstr "一面由超合金护甲板制成，上面焊接有把手的盾牌。与正统的中世纪盾牌相比，它更重，质量较差，但肯定能发挥作用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "buckler"
msgid_plural "bucklers"
msgstr[0] "小圆盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'buckler'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A small metal shield historically used for dueling rather than protection "
"from arrows.  It's small and light enough to not hinder the use of your "
"hands."
msgstr "一个小金属盾牌，历史上主要用于决斗，而不是用来防箭。它小巧轻便，不会妨碍手部的使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "superalloy buckler"
msgid_plural "superalloy bucklers"
msgstr[0] "超合金小圆盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'superalloy buckler'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A small metal shield historically used for dueling rather than protection "
"from arrows.  This one is made of modern superalloy instead of steel.  It's "
"small and light enough to not hinder the use of your hands."
msgstr "一个小金属盾牌，历史上主要用于决斗，而不是用来防箭。这个盾牌采用现代超合金制作，而非钢铁。它小巧轻便，不会妨碍手部的使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "spiked shield"
msgid_plural "spiked shields"
msgstr[0] "尖刺盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spiked shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A metal reinforced shield with spikes jutting out of it.  Can be used as a "
"melee weapon if need be."
msgstr "一种金属加固的盾牌，上面突出着尖刺。如果需要，可以用作近战武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "large spiked shield"
msgid_plural "large spiked shields"
msgstr[0] "大型尖刺盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large spiked shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A large metal reinforced shield with spikes jutting out of it.  Can be used "
"as a melee weapon if need be."
msgstr "一种金属加固的大型盾牌，上面突出着尖刺。如果需要，可以用作近战武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "bronze shield"
msgid_plural "bronze shields"
msgstr[0] "青铜盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bronze shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A simple round shield made of wood, faced with a sheet of work-hardened "
"bronze in the vein of a Greek hoplon.  Tougher against cutting weapons than "
"iron-banded shields for the same encumbrance, but heavier and less "
"protective against bashing weapons."
msgstr ""
"一面简单的木制圆盾，盾面覆盖着一张经过冷锻硬化的青铜板，类似于希腊重装步兵圆盾。在同等负重下，它比铁箍盾更能抵抗劈砍武器，但重量更大，对钝击武器的防护能力也较弱。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "scaleskin shield"
msgid_plural "scaleskin shields"
msgstr[0] "鳞甲盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scaleskin shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A tall oval shield made from the hardened scales of large reptiles, stitched"
" together and boiled to harden it into a single stiff panel, then mounted on"
" a central wooden handgrip similar to shields historically associated with "
"southeastern Africa.  Surprisingly light and durable."
msgstr ""
"一面高大的椭圆形盾牌，由大型爬行动物的硬化鳞片制成。这些鳞片被缝合在一起，经过煮沸硬化成一整块坚硬的面板，然后安装在中央的木制握把上，类似于历史上非洲东南部的盾牌。出人意料地轻便耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "wooden targe"
msgid_plural "wooden targes"
msgstr[0] "木制小圆盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden targe'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A small, round wooden shield designed more for swashbuckling than for "
"fending off arrows.  It's small and light enough to not hinder the use of "
"your hands."
msgstr "一面小巧的木制圆盾，它更适合用于近身格挡，而非抵御箭矢。它小而轻，不会妨碍你使用双手。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "carbon fiber buckler"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber bucklers"
msgstr[0] "碳纤维小圆盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon fiber buckler'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A custom buckler made out of layered carbon fiber armor over synthetic "
"fabric padding made using a 3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more "
"comparable to a sheet of metal than kevlar, but it's very protective and "
"lightweight."
msgstr "使用3D打印机制作的层叠碳纤维装甲和合成织物填充物定制的圆盾。与凯夫拉相比，它的硬质板材更像金属板，但却具有很强的防护性，而且重量很轻。"

#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid "carbon fiber ballistic shield"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber ballistic shields"
msgstr[0] "碳纤维防弹盾牌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon fiber ballistic shield'}
#: data/json/items/armor/shields.json
msgid ""
"A custom ballistic shield made out of layered carbon fiber armor over "
"synthetic fabric padding made using a 3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more"
" comparable to a sheet of metal than kevlar, but it's very protective and "
"lightweight."
msgstr ""
"使用3D打印机制作的层叠碳纤维装甲和合成织物填充物定制的防弹盾牌。与凯夫拉相比，它的硬质板材更像金属板，但却具有很强的防护性，而且重量很轻。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "backpack"
msgid_plural "backpacks"
msgstr[0] "背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A small backpack.  Good storage for a little encumbrance."
msgstr "一个小型布制背包，用一点点累赘换取可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "hiking backpack"
msgid_plural "hiking backpacks"
msgstr[0] "旅行背包"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'hiking backpack'}.
#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'survivor hiking backpack'}.
#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': "technomancer's toolbelt"}.
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Sheath blade"
msgstr "收刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hiking backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large sized hiking backpack with plenty of storage space."
msgstr "一个大容量的旅行背包，提供了很大的存储空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "giant novelty backpack"
msgid_plural "giant novelty backpacks"
msgstr[0] "巨大新奇背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'giant novelty backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge fabric backpack made mostly as a joke before the Cataclysm.  Now, "
"it's still rather silly, but it can store a lot of stuff."
msgstr "一个体积巨大的纤维织物背包，在大灾变前看上去很可笑。现在，虽然看着还是很蠢，但是能储存许多物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "leather backpack"
msgid_plural "leather backpacks"
msgstr[0] "皮质背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A small leather backpack.  Good storage for a little encumbrance."
msgstr "一个小型皮制背包，用一点点累赘换取可观的储存空间，相比普通背包更加耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "large tactical backpack"
msgid_plural "large tactical backpacks"
msgstr[0] "大型战术背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large tactical backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large tactical multi-compartment backpack that has great lower back "
"support."
msgstr "一个大型战术背包，内设多个隔间，对背部下方的支撑性能优异。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "laundry basket"
msgid_plural "laundry baskets"
msgstr[0] "洗衣篮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'laundry basket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A plastic basket meant for storing and hauling clothing."
msgstr "一个用来存放和搬运衣物的塑料篮。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "high-volume rucksack"
msgid_plural "high-volume rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "大容量帆布包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'high-volume rucksack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Also known as a \"bigpack\", this rucksack is prized by pack rats but may "
"lead to a bad back."
msgstr "这个帆布包也被称作“大背包”。它巨大的容量受到松鼠党的一致好评，但是这也可能让太多的重物压断你的腰。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "bindle"
msgid_plural "bindles"
msgstr[0] "包袱挑"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bindle'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"You're ready for a trip down some train tracks.  Also known as a hobo stick."
msgstr ""
"一件在棍子的一头绑上包着铺盖卷的大布头，能够为你提供一些储存空间，这东西也被称作流浪汉的铺盖卷。\n"
"\"准备好沿着铁路流浪。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "box backpack"
msgid_plural "box backpacks"
msgstr[0] "木箱背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'box backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A makeshift backpack comprised of a wooden box and a pair of ropes."
msgstr "一个简易背包，由一个木箱和一对绳索组成。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "briefcase"
msgid_plural "briefcases"
msgstr[0] "手提箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'briefcase'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Useful for carrying money, documents, or smuggled goods."
msgstr "一个配有提手的箱子，内部可存放纸币、文档、或者是走私物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "violin case"
msgid_plural "violin cases"
msgstr[0] "小提琴盒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'violin case'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Useful to carry your precious musical instrument around protected from any "
"harm."
msgstr "用于随身携带并且保护你珍贵的乐器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "daypack"
msgid_plural "daypacks"
msgstr[0] "单日健行背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'daypack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An ultralight nylon backpack intended for one-day hiking trips.  Waterproof,"
" slim, and spacious."
msgstr "一种超轻的尼龙背包，常用于单日的徒步旅行。这个防水背包在轻便的外表下还拥有很大的存储空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "dive bag"
msgid_plural "dive bags"
msgstr[0] "潜水背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dive bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A lightweight mesh backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr "一件很轻的潜水员用网眼背包，提供比较可观的储物空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "duffel bag"
msgid_plural "duffel bags"
msgstr[0] "行李袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'duffel bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge duffel bag.  Provides plenty of storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr "一个巨大的无纺布编织袋，提供了极其可观的储存空间，但相当的累赘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "tactical dump pouch"
msgid_plural "tactical dump pouches"
msgstr[0] "战术储存袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tactical dump pouch', 'str_pl': 'tactical dump
#. pouches'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"An expandable pouch secured with straps.  Provides a bit of extra storage "
"with minimal encumbrance."
msgstr "一个可以张开的战术横腰袋，提供额外的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "fanny pack"
msgid_plural "fanny packs"
msgstr[0] "腰包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fanny pack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Provides a bit of extra storage, with minimal encumbrance."
msgstr "一件固定在腰间的小包，以极小的累赘换取一点额外的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "golf bag"
msgid_plural "golf bags"
msgstr[0] "高尔夫球包"

#. ~ Use action holster_msg for {'str': 'golf bag'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "You awkwardly sheath your %s"
msgstr "你笨拙地将 %s 收入球包中"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'golf bag'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Sheath golf club"
msgstr "收起球棍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'golf bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A tall canvas and plastic bag with fold-out legs used for golfing.  It even "
"has straps to be worn on the back."
msgstr "一个细长的带有可折叠支架的高尔夫球背包，采用帆布和塑料制成。附有背带可以佩戴在后背。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "hide bag"
msgid_plural "hide bags"
msgstr[0] "生皮袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hide bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The raw skin of an animal, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage."
"  It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr "一个由动物生皮匆忙制成的简易储存袋，如果不加工与鞣制它就会腐烂。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "tainted hide bag"
msgid_plural "tainted hide bags"
msgstr[0] "感染生皮袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tainted hide bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The raw skin of a monster, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage."
"  It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr "一个由怪物生皮匆忙制成的简易储存袋，如果不加工与鞣制它就会腐烂。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
msgid_plural "H&K operational briefcases (empty)"
msgstr[0] "H&K 特工手提箱（空）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'H&K operational briefcase (empty)', 'str_pl':
#. 'H&K operational briefcases (empty)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"This is a plain, hard-sided black briefcase with a trigger in the handle and"
" a concealed hole in the side.  Squeezing the trigger would currently do "
"nothing, as it is empty.  Don't forget to put a suitable MP5 back inside "
"before you try to pay any ransom fees with lead."
msgstr ""
"这是一个乍一看平平无奇的硬壳黑色手提箱，但实际上它的把手上藏有一个扳机，而箱子一侧开有一个隐秘的枪孔。现在箱子是空的，扳动扳机没什么作用。在你准备赴鸿门宴之前不要忘了放一把合适的"
" MP5 冲锋枪进去！"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "jerrypack"
msgid_plural "jerrypacks"
msgstr[0] "肩背式油桶背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jerrypack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A jerrycan modified to be worn in a similar manner to a backpack."
msgstr ""
"一个五加仑装的油桶绑上带子，剪个大口，然后背到背上，成为了一个背包。\n"
"\"天才的造物！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "leather pouch"
msgid_plural "leather pouches"
msgstr[0] "皮革小袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather pouch', 'str_pl': 'leather pouches'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A bag stitched together from leather scraps.  Doesn't hold an awful lot but "
"is easy to wear."
msgstr "这是一个由皮革简单缝制成的耐用小袋子，提供少量储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "pair of drop leg pouches"
msgid_plural "pairs of drop leg pouches"
msgstr[0] "绑腿包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of drop leg pouches', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. drop leg pouches'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A set of pouches that can be worn on the thighs using buckled straps.  This "
"variety is favored by the military."
msgstr "一组能用系带绑扣在腿部的小包，这种款式深受军人的喜爱。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "makeshift knapsack"
msgid_plural "makeshift knapsacks"
msgstr[0] "简易背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift knapsack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A pair of pants with the bottom ends tied with string, and then passed "
"through the belt loops so the knapsack can be carried on the back."
msgstr "一条底部被绳索绑起来的裤子，绳索接着穿过皮带扣，使得整条裤子能够像背包背在背上，提供比较可观的储物空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "makeshift sling"
msgid_plural "makeshift slings"
msgstr[0] "简易肩背袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift sling'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A large sheet tied into a crude, over-the-shoulder sling."
msgstr "用一块小床单折叠起来的简易过肩吊袋，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "messenger bag"
msgid_plural "messenger bags"
msgstr[0] "信使包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'messenger bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Light and easy to wear, but doesn't offer much storage."
msgstr "一个常见的呈长方形、比较大的挎包，常见于邮递员投送报纸、信件时候所配备，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "MOLLE pack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE packs"
msgstr[0] "MOLLE战术背包"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'MOLLE pack'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Stow gear"
msgstr "收起装备"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MOLLE pack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"backpack.  Covered with pockets and equipment straps, it strikes a fine "
"balance between storage space and encumbrance."
msgstr "模块化轻型承载装备（MOLLE）是一种先进的军用背包。它上面布满了口袋和装备挂带，在存储空间和负重之间取得了很好的平衡。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "petpack"
msgid_plural "petpacks"
msgstr[0] "宠物包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'petpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm this would allow your four-legged friend to see the "
"world, now it's used to shield them from the world."
msgstr "在大灾变来临前，这个背包可以让你带着你四条腿的朋友见识这个世界，但现在它也可以用来保护他们免遭世界的伤害。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "plastic shopping bag"
msgid_plural "plastic shopping bags"
msgstr[0] "塑料购物袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic shopping bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bag used to carry groceries home."
msgstr "一个能携带各类杂货的购物袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "purse"
msgid_plural "purses"
msgstr[0] "手提包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'purse'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A bit cumbersome to wear, but provides some storage."
msgstr "一个用于随身携带、有拎带的手提包，拿起来有些不便，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "pouch"
msgid_plural "pouches"
msgstr[0] "小袋子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pouch', 'str_pl': 'pouches'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift bag, cobbled together from rags.  Doesn't hold an awful lot but "
"is easy to wear."
msgstr "一个临时拼凑的布袋。虽然装不了多少东西，但很容易穿戴。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "military rucksack"
msgid_plural "military rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "军用背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military rucksack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A huge military rucksack, provides a lot of storage."
msgstr "一个广泛用于士兵行军、远足者旅行的结实耐用的大背包，提供非常可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "runner pack"
msgid_plural "runner packs"
msgstr[0] "跑步者背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'runner pack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"The obvious choice for outdoor athletes, this ergonomic backpack is light "
"and easy to wear, ensuring comfort when carrying heavy and bulky items."
msgstr ""
"一个设计严格符合人体工程学的轻便舒适小背包，提供少量的储存空间。\n"
"\"信不信我可以在里面装着个大铁砧还能来个百米冲刺？\""

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "sling pack"
msgid_plural "sling packs"
msgstr[0] "单肩挎包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sling pack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A simple single-sling backpack.  Easier to access than a normal backpack, "
"but can't comfortably hold as much."
msgstr "一个单肩挎包，相比普通背包更加轻便，提供比较可观的储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "straw basket"
msgid_plural "straw baskets"
msgstr[0] "草篮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'straw basket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "Hand made straw basket.  Carry it with you for extra storage."
msgstr "一个手工编织的干草篮。随身携带可以让你获得额外的存储空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "pack basket"
msgid_plural "pack baskets"
msgstr[0] "背筐"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pack basket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large hand made straw basket, with shoulder straps to wear like a "
"backpack."
msgstr "一个大型手工草编篮子，带有肩带，可像背包一样背负。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "suitcase"
msgid_plural "suitcases"
msgstr[0] "旅行箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'suitcase'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A huge wheeled suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other "
"possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it"
" around is neither fast nor comfortable."
msgstr "一个主要用于旅行期间存放衣物和杂物的巨大轮式旅行箱，提供充足的储存空间，但拉起来很累赘。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'suitcase'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A mid-sized suitcase used mainly for transporting clothes and other "
"possessions during trips, provides a decent amount of storage but hauling it"
" around is not exactly comfortable."
msgstr "一个主要用于旅行期间存放衣物和杂物的中型旅行箱，提供充足的储存空间，但拉起来很累赘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "survivor hiking backpack"
msgid_plural "survivor hiking backpacks"
msgstr[0] "幸存者登山包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor hiking backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built hiking backpack.  Durable and carefully crafted to hold as "
"much stuff as possible."
msgstr "一件自制的重型背包，经久耐用并且被经过精心制造，使得它能够装下尽可能多的物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "survivor duffel bag"
msgid_plural "survivor duffel bags"
msgstr[0] "幸存者行李包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor duffel bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built heavy duffel bag.  Durable and carefully crafted to hold as "
"much stuff as possible."
msgstr "量身打造的沉重的编织袋，额外缝了很多口袋上去。值得信赖的手工技术将它打造得至为舒适耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "survivor backpack"
msgid_plural "survivor backpacks"
msgstr[0] "幸存者背包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor backpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built backpack.  Durable and carefully crafted to hold as much "
"stuff as possible."
msgstr "一件自制的背包，经久耐用并且被经过精心制造，使得它能够装下尽可能多的物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "survivor rucksack"
msgid_plural "survivor rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "幸存者帆布包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor rucksack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built heavy backpack.  Durable and carefully crafted to hold as "
"much stuff as possible."
msgstr "一件自制的重型背包，经久耐用并且被经过精心制造，使得它能够装下尽可能多的物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "survivor runner pack"
msgid_plural "survivor runner packs"
msgstr[0] "幸存者跑步包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor runner pack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built lightweight runner pack.  Durable and carefully crafted to "
"hold as much stuff as possible."
msgstr "一个自制的轻便的慢跑背包。经久耐用，细心的做工使得它能够装下尽可能多的物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "swag bag"
msgid_plural "swag bags"
msgstr[0] "赃物袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'swag bag'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A large canvas sack, re-purposed for makeshift storage.  Goes well with a "
"striped shirt and a domino mask."
msgstr ""
"一个大型帆布袋，进过重新改造用于临时存储。\n"
"\"和黑白条纹衫及小偷面具配合很搭。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "travelpack"
msgid_plural "travelpacks"
msgstr[0] "登山包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'travelpack'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A hiking pack used for short trips."
msgstr "用于短途旅行的登山包。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "utility vest"
msgid_plural "utility vests"
msgstr[0] "工具背心"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'utility vest'}
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "A light vest covered in pockets and straps for storage."
msgstr "一件有着可以存东西的口袋及肩带的轻型背心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "bondage suit"
msgid_plural "bondage suits"
msgstr[0] "紧缚服装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bondage suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A suit of snug, black leather.  Has no pockets, but does feature an "
"abundance of unusually located zippers."
msgstr "一套黑色皮革做的紧身衣。没有口袋，但在奇怪位置安装了许多拉链。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "clown suit"
msgid_plural "clown suits"
msgstr[0] "小丑服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clown suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A colorful and ridiculous costume fit for a clown.  Provides decent storage."
msgstr ""
"一件五颜六色的滑稽搞笑的小丑装扮服。\n"
"\"丧尸没有小丑恐惧症。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "dinosaur suit"
msgid_plural "dinosaur suits"
msgstr[0] "恐龙套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dinosaur suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full-body costume in the form of an anthropomorphic dinosaur.  It is quite"
" encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "一套全身恐龙外形的服装。十分累赘，而且没多少储存空间，但是非常暖和。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "连身衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jumpsuit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin, short-sleeved jumpsuit; similar to those worn by prisoners.  "
"Provides decent storage and is not very encumbering."
msgstr "一件轻薄的短袖连身衣。可以提供一些储存空间，而且也不太累赘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "Hub 01 jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "HUB 01 连身衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hub 01 jumpsuit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "A brown jumpsuit worn by the staff of Hub 01."
msgstr "一件棕色的连身服，是HUB 01的工作服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "subject suit"
msgid_plural "subject suits"
msgstr[0] "研究样本服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'subject suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin, short-sleeved and short-legged one-piece suit.  Judging by the odd "
"tailoring and adjustment points… maybe you don't want to know who wore it.  "
"Provides nominal storage and is not very encumbering."
msgstr "一件薄薄的、短袖和短腿的连体服。由奇怪的剪裁和拼接来看……也许你不想知道它之前被谁穿过。提供了一定的储存空间，也不是很累赘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "union suit"
msgid_plural "union suits"
msgstr[0] "连衫裤"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'union suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A one-piece suit of full-body long underwear that helps to maintain body "
"temperature.  It laces closed in the front."
msgstr "一件连身内衣，能维持体温。正面有拉链可以拉上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "wolf suit"
msgid_plural "wolf suits"
msgstr[0] "狼人套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wolf suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full body fursuit in the form of an anthropomorphic wolf.  It is quite "
"encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "一套全身狼人外形的毛皮套装。十分累赘，而且没多少储存空间，但是非常暖和。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "wool suit"
msgid_plural "wool suits"
msgstr[0] "羊毛套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An encumbering wool suit covered in nice patterns.  It looks like full body "
"armor but it only protects against cold, sadly."
msgstr "一套穿着有点累赘的羊毛套装，它看起来就像一套完整的防弹衣，可惜，它只能抵御寒冷。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "zentai"
msgid_plural "zentais"
msgstr[0] "全包紧身衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zentai'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Short for 'zenshin taitsu', a zentai is a form fitting full body nylon and "
"spandex garment.  Though it covers your face, you can see through the "
"integrated hood.  With a couple of these and some friends and you could put "
"on some kabuki."
msgstr ""
"又被称为\"ゼンタイ\"，全包紧身衣是一种由尼龙和氨纶制成的包裹全身的连体服。虽然它遮住了你的脸，但你可以通过其集成的兜帽看到外界。有几件这样的衣服，再找来一些朋友，你就可以办一场歌舞伎表演了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "AEP suit"
msgid_plural "AEP suits"
msgstr[0] "AEP套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'AEP suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"An armored environmental protection suit.  Custom-built from a cleansuit and"
" body armor, it provides excellent protection against both physical harm and"
" ambient radiation."
msgstr "一件装甲化的防护服。由无尘衣和装甲自制而成，他能非常好的防御物理攻击和辐射伤害。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "ANBC suit"
msgid_plural "ANBC suits"
msgstr[0] "ANBC套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ANBC suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"An armored, impermeable full-body suit that functions as body armor, as well"
" as protecting from nuclear, biological, and chemical hazards.  It requires "
"a separate gas mask for full protection."
msgstr "一套不透气的、经过装甲加强的全身防护服，在充当护甲的同时能够抵御核生化威胁。需要额外配套的防化面具才能提供完整三防。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "boiled leather armor"
msgid_plural "boiled leather armors"
msgstr[0] "鞣制皮甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boiled leather armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Thick leather body armor that has been hardened via chemical treatment.  "
"Light and strong."
msgstr "一件经过化学鞣制硬化的厚实皮甲。轻巧而耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "chitinous armor"
msgid_plural "chitinous armors"
msgstr[0] "甲壳护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chitinous armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Leg and body armor made from the exoskeletons of insects.  Light and "
"durable."
msgstr "一件由昆虫甲壳制成的护甲，覆盖了腿部和躯干，轻便耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "biosilicified chitin armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin armors"
msgstr[0] "硅化甲壳护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biosilicified chitin armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "一副由经过精心清理并裁剪过的酸蚁硅化躯壳制成的全身护甲，轻便耐用而且防酸。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "fur body armor"
msgid_plural "fur body armors"
msgstr[0] "毛皮护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur body armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Thick body armor made from furs.  Warm and comfortable."
msgstr "一件用毛皮制成的厚实护甲，舒适而温暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "leather body armor"
msgid_plural "leather body armors"
msgstr[0] "皮革护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather body armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Thick leather body armor.  Light and comfortable."
msgstr "一件用皮革制成的厚实护甲，轻便而舒适。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "plate armor"
msgid_plural "plate armors"
msgstr[0] "板甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plate armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A suit of Gothic plate armor."
msgstr "一套哥特式全身板甲。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "superalloy plate armor"
msgid_plural "superalloy plate armors"
msgstr[0] "超合金板甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'superalloy plate armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A suit of Gothic plate armor, remade using modern superalloy."
msgstr "一套哥特式板甲，使用现代超合金重新制作。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "nomad gear"
msgid_plural "nomad gears"
msgstr[0] "游牧装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'nomad gear'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift outfit made from pre-Cataclysm clothing designed for long "
"travels.  It has a lot of storage space."
msgstr "一套由大灾变前的衣物制造的自制服装，有大量的储存空间，专为长途旅行设计。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "light nomad gear"
msgid_plural "light nomad gears"
msgstr[0] "轻型游牧装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light nomad gear'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A light makeshift outfit made from pre-Cataclysm clothing designed for long "
"summer travels.  It offers less storage space and armor compared to regular "
"nomad gear."
msgstr "一套由大灾变前的衣物制造的轻便自制服装，有大量的储存空间，专为夏季长途旅行设计。相较于普通游牧装，储存空间和护甲较低。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "plated leather armor"
msgid_plural "plated leather armors"
msgstr[0] "镶板皮甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plated leather armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Thick leather body armor that has been reinforced with strategically-placed "
"metal plates.  Strong and comfortable."
msgstr "一件在重要位置进行金属护板加强、坚韧而舒适的厚皮甲。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "ornamental plate armor"
msgid_plural "ornamental plate armors"
msgstr[0] "装饰板甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ornamental plate armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "An extremely heavy suit of ornamental armor."
msgstr "一套装饰用金属铠甲，造型十分威武，因为一般用于摆设装饰而非战斗，所以相当沉重、不宜穿戴，但实在需要时也可以进行装备。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "ornamental superalloy plate armor"
msgid_plural "ornamental superalloy plate armors"
msgstr[0] "装饰超合金板甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ornamental superalloy plate armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A heavy suit of ornamental armor, remade using modern superalloy."
msgstr "一套重型的装饰性盔甲，采用现代超合金重新制作。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "riot armor"
msgid_plural "riot armors"
msgstr[0] "防暴装甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'riot armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Black armor used by riot police officers.  The padded layers and hard "
"plastic shoulder guards offer good protection without much encumbrance.  The"
" word POLICE is emblazoned across the front."
msgstr "防暴警察使用的黑色盔甲。软垫层和硬塑料护肩能提供良好的保护，并不是很累赘。它前面印着\"警察\"两个大字。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "O-yoroi"
msgid_plural "O-yorois"
msgstr[0] "大铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'O-yoroi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "An ornamental suit of Japanese samurai armor."
msgstr ""
"一套日本武士盔甲，华丽、沉重，最早起源于日本平安中期，防护性能出色，区别于武士战斗时普遍装备的胴丸，大铠更倾向于装饰作用。\n"
"\"武士の魂。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "scavenger gear"
msgid_plural "scavenger gears"
msgstr[0] "拾荒者套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scavenger gear'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy scavenger's outfit made from refitted protective gear and "
"reinforced with kevlar and heavy plastic.  It has a lot of storage space."
msgstr ""
"一套坚固的拾荒者装备，由改装的防护装备制成，并加固了凯夫拉纤维和厚重塑料。装备拥有大量的存储空间。\n"
"\"穿上它开开心心的捡破烂。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "scrap suit"
msgid_plural "scrap suits"
msgstr[0] "废金属套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scrap suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of armor made from scraps of metal secured by simple strings; the "
"loose collection of plates provides decent but not the most convenient "
"protection."
msgstr "一套用金属碎片做成的装甲，碎片之间用小绳子固定。这些松垮的小片片能提供不错的防护，但是还不够完美。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "beekeeping suit"
msgid_plural "beekeeping suits"
msgstr[0] "防蜂服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'beekeeping suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A white suit commonly worn by professional beekeepers with straps on your "
"ankles and wrists to prevent bees from flying in.  It's not a very tough "
"fabric, but it's lightweight and has plenty of storage thanks to a chest "
"pocket."
msgstr ""
"一套白色套装，通常是职业养蜂人穿戴，在袖口和脚踝处有系带防止蜜蜂飞入蛰伤。这件衣服使用的纤维并不坚固，但很轻便，此外胸口的大袋子提供了不少的储存空间。\n"
"\"防的是小蜜蜂，而不是巨型蜜蜂和巨型黄蜂。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "chainmail hauberk"
msgid_plural "chainmail hauberks"
msgstr[0] "锁甲连衣裤"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainmail hauberk'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  The shirt,"
" arms, and leggings have been modified with straps and combined with a "
"gambeson to deal with uneven weight distribution, cold environments and to "
"allow them to be used separately."
msgstr "一套自制的完整链甲套装，没有头盔。胸甲、护臂、护胫都用带子连接来平衡重量的分布，与软铠甲结合使它能很好抵御寒冷。它们能够分开使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "锁环甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainmail armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail suit.  The coif, shirt, arms, and leggings have"
" been modified with straps and combined with a gambeson to deal with uneven "
"weight distribution, cold environments and to allow them to be used "
"separately."
msgstr "一套自制的完整链甲套装，包含头巾。胸甲、护臂、护胫都用带子连接来平衡重量的分布，与软铠甲结合使它能很好抵御寒冷。它们能够分开使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "faraday chainmail suit"
msgid_plural "faraday chainmail suits"
msgstr[0] "法拉第锁环服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faraday chainmail suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail suit that can be worn over your normal "
"clothing.  The suit is conductively interconnected, protecting against "
"electricity."
msgstr "一套特别定制的锁环甲套装，可以穿在你正常的衣服上。衣服内各个部件是导电连接的，有效防护电击。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "cleansuit"
msgid_plural "cleansuits"
msgstr[0] "无尘衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cleansuit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A simple hazardous materials handling suit.  Though somewhat restrictive and"
" fragile, wearing it will provide excellent protection against ambient "
"radiation."
msgstr "一套简单的危险物处理防护服。虽然穿着有些累赘而且容易损坏，但是能够很好防护环境中的辐射。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "entry suit"
msgid_plural "entry suits"
msgstr[0] "避火服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'entry suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A flame-resistant whole-body garment worn by firefighters as protection "
"against extreme heat.  Though very restrictive, wearing it will provide "
"excellent protection against fire and smoke.  It requires a separate gas "
"mask for full protection."
msgstr ""
"一件全身式消防避火套装，在极端严酷的火场条件下为消防员提供全方位保护。虽然非常限制行动，但能够提供对火焰和烟尘的绝佳防护。需要额外配套的防化面具才能提供完整三防。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "survivor firesuit"
msgid_plural "survivor firesuits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装（防火）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor firesuit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Heavy, hand-built combination armor made from a cut-down bulletproof vest "
"and a reinforced flame-resistant Nomex jumpsuit.  Protects the wearer from "
"fire and the elements."
msgstr "一件自制的重型复合防护服，由防弹背心和强化芳纶纤维防火服组合而成，可以提供火焰、环境和伤害防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "gambeson"
msgid_plural "gambesons"
msgstr[0] "软铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gambeson'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A thick jacket of quilted fabric extending down to your knees, designed to "
"be worn underneath mail or other armor.  Or worn on its own, if you can't "
"afford proper armor."
msgstr "一件长到你膝盖的填塞了棉花的、可穿在链甲或其他装甲底下的厚针织外套，如果你负担不起正式的铠甲，也可以只穿这一件。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "hazmat suit"
msgid_plural "hazmat suits"
msgstr[0] "三防服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hazmat suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"An impermeable whole-body garment worn as protection against hazardous "
"materials.  Though very restrictive and fragile, wearing it will provide "
"complete protection against ambient radiation.  It requires a separate gas "
"mask for full protection."
msgstr "一套不透气的、十分累赘而且容易损坏的危险物处理全身防护服。穿上它能够完全防护环境中的辐射。需要额外配套的防化面具才能提供完整三防。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "heavy survivor suit"
msgid_plural "heavy survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装（重型）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heavy survivor suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, hand-built combination armor made from a reinforced bulletproof "
"vest and a metal-plated jumpsuit.  Protects from the elements as well as "
"from harm."
msgstr "一件自制的重型复合防护服，由强化防弹衣及经过金属板强化的连身衣缝制而成，可以提供环境和伤害防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "superalloy survivor suit"
msgid_plural "superalloy survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者超合金套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'superalloy survivor suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, hand-built combination armor made from a reinforced bulletproof "
"vest and a superalloy-plated jumpsuit.  Lighter and easier to move in than "
"an equivalent suit made with steel.  Protects from the elements as well as "
"from harm."
msgstr "一件自制的重型复合防护服，由强化防弹衣及经过超合金板强化的连身衣缝制而成。比同等的钢制套装更轻、更容易穿进去。可以提供环境和伤害防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "light superalloy survivor suit"
msgid_plural "light superalloy survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "轻型幸存者超合金套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light superalloy survivor suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, hand-built combination armor made from a bulletproof vest and"
" a fabric jumpsuit, all reinforced with superalloy.  It's fairly protective,"
" but less so than a thicker, more comprehensive suit."
msgstr "这是一种由防弹背心和织物连体服手工制造的轻型组合盔甲，全部用超合金加固。 它的防护能力相当强，但不如更厚、更全面的防护服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "light survivor suit"
msgid_plural "light survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装（轻型）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light survivor suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, hand-built combination armor made from a cut-down bulletproof"
" vest and a reinforced fabric jumpsuit.  Protects from the elements as well "
"as from harm."
msgstr "一件自制的轻型复合防护服，由防弹背心和强化紧身衣组合而成，可以提供环境和伤害防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "flame-resistant suit"
msgid_plural "flame-resistant suits"
msgstr[0] "防火服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flame-resistant suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A snug body suit made from thin and lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric."
"  Tough yet breathable, it is light and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr "一套芳纶纤维防火服。贴身、结实却透气。这套衣服量很轻并且也适于穿在其他衣服下面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Hub 01 environmental suit"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 environmental suits"
msgstr[0] "HUB 01 环护服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hub 01 environmental suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight environmental suit worn by Hub personnel in their rare forays "
"aboveground.  Colored brown and blue, the white seal of Hub 01 is "
"embroidered on both of its upper arms.  It requires a separate gas mask for "
"full protection."
msgstr ""
"一种轻便的环护服，由 HUB 工作人员在执行少有的地面突袭任务时穿着。主色调是棕色和蓝色，上臂印着 HUB 01 "
"的白色袖章。只需要再戴一个防毒面具就能够给你全方位的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "WS-47G moisture retention suit"
msgid_plural "WS-47G moisture retention suits"
msgstr[0] "WS-47G 保湿衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'WS-47G moisture retention suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"The WebbStar moisture retention suit utilizes advanced technology to prevent"
" up to 30% of moisture loss through perspiration.  The suit is powered by "
"the micro-motions of the body, especially breathing and walking motions.  "
"Because of this, your walking speed is impaired while wearing it."
msgstr ""
"WebbStar牌保湿衣采用最新科技，能减少30%因流汗引起的水分流失。这件衣服由身体的微运动充能，特别是呼吸和行走动作。因此穿着时会减慢你的步行速度。\n"
"\"这款曾经被一些顾客戏称为逃出克隆岛的家伙们的专用服装。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "suit"
msgid_plural "suits"
msgstr[0] "西装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full-body cotton suit.  Makes the apocalypse a truly gentlemanly "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"一套笔挺的全身棉制商务正装西服。\n"
"\"在末日来临之时也要有绅士风范。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "survivor suit"
msgid_plural "survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A hand-built combination armor made from a bulletproof vest and a reinforced"
" leather jumpsuit.  Protects from the elements as well as from harm."
msgstr "一件自制的复合防护服，由防弹衣及强化连身皮衣缝制而成，可以提供环境和伤害防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "SWAT armor"
msgid_plural "SWAT armors"
msgstr[0] "SWAT装甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'SWAT armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of black bulletproof armor with lots of pockets.  The word SWAT is "
"emblazoned across the back."
msgstr "一件黑色的战术防弹护甲，带有许多战术口袋，印有SWAT字样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "leather touring suit"
msgid_plural "leather touring suits"
msgstr[0] "皮制摩托套装"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather touring suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A thick leather body suit made for protection while riding motorcycles.  "
"Light and very comfortable."
msgstr "这件厚皮外套可以在骑摩托车的时候保护你。轻巧而舒适。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "winter survivor suit"
msgid_plural "winter survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装（防寒）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'winter survivor suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A warm and heavy hand-built combination armor made from a reinforced "
"bulletproof vest and an insulated leather jumpsuit.  Protects from the "
"elements as well as from harm."
msgstr "一件自制的防寒重型复合防护服，由防弹衣及强化保暖的连身皮衣缝制而成，保暖的同时可以提供环境和伤害防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "carbon fiber armor"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber armors"
msgstr[0] "碳纤维护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon fiber armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A custom suit of layered carbon fiber armor over neoprene padding made using"
" a 3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to a suit of armor than"
" kevlar, but it's very protective and moves surprisingly well."
msgstr "使用3D打印机定制的一套多层碳纤维护甲，外覆氯丁橡胶衬垫。 与凯夫拉相比，它的硬板更像是一套盔甲，但它的保护性很强，移动性也出奇地好。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "scaleskin armor"
msgid_plural "scaleskin armors"
msgstr[0] "鳞甲护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scaleskin armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Leg and body armor made from the hardened scales of large reptiles."
msgstr ""
"由大型爬行动物坚硬的鳞片制成的腿部和身体护甲。\n"
"\"再配上其他部位的鳞甲装备后，你就看起来像个怪物猎人了。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "pair of swimming trunks"
msgid_plural "pairs of swimming trunks"
msgstr[0] "泳裤"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of swimming trunks', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. swimming trunks'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of swimming trunks, with netting."
msgstr "一件男性平角泳裤，有绳子可以绑。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "wetsuit"
msgid_plural "wetsuits"
msgstr[0] "潜水服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wetsuit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A full-body neoprene wetsuit."
msgstr "一件全身氯丁橡胶潜水服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "wetsuit hood"
msgid_plural "wetsuit hoods"
msgstr[0] "潜水服兜帽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wetsuit hood'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A neoprene hood, commonly worn by divers."
msgstr "一个橡胶的兜帽，通常是潜水员穿的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "survivor wetsuit hood"
msgid_plural "survivor wetsuit hoods"
msgstr[0] "幸存者兜帽（潜水）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor wetsuit hood'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A customized armored neoprene and Kevlar hood, very strong and durable."
msgstr "一件自制的凯夫拉-氯丁橡胶复合兜帽，非常结实、耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "survivor wetsuit"
msgid_plural "survivor wetsuits"
msgstr[0] "幸存者套装（潜水）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor wetsuit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, hand-built combination armor made from a cut-down bulletproof"
" vest and a reinforced neoprene wetsuit.  Protects from the elements as well"
" as from harm."
msgstr "一件自制的轻型复合防护服，由防弹背心和强化橡胶潜水服组合而成，可以提供环境和伤害防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "pair of survivor wetsuit gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of survivor wetsuit gloves"
msgstr[0] "幸存者手套（潜水）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of survivor wetsuit gloves', 'str_pl':
#. 'pairs of survivor wetsuit gloves'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, Kevlar armored neoprene gloves, modified to be easy to"
" wear while providing maximum protection under extreme conditions."
msgstr "一双自制的凯夫拉-氯丁橡胶复合手套，更易于穿戴，即使在极端情况下也能提供最大防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "spring suit"
msgid_plural "spring suits"
msgstr[0] "连身泳衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spring suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A long-sleeved spring wetsuit with pink color details and cleavage-"
"enhancing, hip-accentuating construction.  Not as protective as a full-body "
"suit, but also less restrictive."
msgstr ""
"一件长袖的保暖潜水衣，上面有着粉红色的点缀。流线型的贴身设计充分彰显出你前凸后翘的傲人身材。虽然这件衣服安全性上没有全身潜水服好，但是其胜在轻便不勒身。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "faraday shark suit"
msgid_plural "faraday shark suits"
msgstr[0] "法拉第防鲨服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faraday shark suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A one piece chainmail suit used by scuba divers for protection against shark"
" bites.  It has been conductively interconnected, protecting against "
"electricity."
msgstr "一件潜水员用来防止被鲨鱼咬伤、覆及全身的一体链甲套装。内部有电传导系统，有效防护电击。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "shark suit"
msgid_plural "shark suits"
msgstr[0] "防鲨服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shark suit'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A one piece chainmail suit used by scuba divers for protection against shark"
" bites.  It comes with attached plastic helmet and booties."
msgstr "一件潜水员用来防止被鲨鱼咬伤、覆及全身的一体链甲套装。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "pair of swim goggles"
msgid_plural "pairs of swim goggles"
msgstr[0] "游泳护目镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of swim goggles', 'str_pl': 'pairs of swim
#. goggles'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A small pair of goggles made for swimming."
msgstr "一副符合光学和医用标准，水下视物清晰、视野宽阔的游泳镜。"

#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "pair of swimming gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of swimming gloves"
msgstr[0] "潜水手套"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of swimming gloves', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. swimming gloves'}
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of very flexible neoprene-silicone rubber gloves, suitable for "
"underwater use."
msgstr "一双高延展性的氯丁橡胶手套，适合水下使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "bell cuirass"
msgid_plural "bell cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "钟形胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bell cuirass', 'str_pl': 'bell cuirasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "An ancient Greek breastplate, made of bronze."
msgstr "一件古希腊的胸甲，由青铜制成。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "皮革胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lamellar cuirass', 'str_pl': 'lamellar
#. cuirasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of multiple pieces of tough leather, laced together for "
"durable yet flexible protection."
msgstr "一件将多块坚韧皮革系在一起而制成的胸甲，耐用且轻便灵活，能提供不错的防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "plated lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "plated lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "鳞甲胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plated lamellar cuirass', 'str_pl': 'plated
#. lamellar cuirasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of multiple pieces of tough leather and metal scales laced "
"together, forming durable yet flexible protection."
msgstr "一种由多片坚韧皮革与金属鳞片编连而成的胸甲，既坚固又灵活。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "lorica segmentata"
msgid_plural "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[0] "罗马片甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'lorica segmentata'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Roman laminar armor, made of overlapping metal strips connected "
"to internal leather straps."
msgstr "一件古罗马片甲，由互相重叠的金属片连接而成，内部由皮带联结。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "bookplate"
msgid_plural "bookplates"
msgstr[0] "纸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bookplate'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A crude form of armor made from stacked paper and rolls of duct tape, this "
"breastplate offers a surprising amount of protection."
msgstr ""
"一种由叠纸和胶带卷制成的粗糙胸甲，有着出人意料的防护性能。\n"
"\"事实上，一叠纸是液压机都搞不定的强悍对手。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "锁环胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainmail vest'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A customized chainmail vest.  It's a sleeveless piece of chainmail with "
"small straps designed to better distribute the weight."
msgstr "一件自制的锁链胸甲，这件无袖胸甲由多条带子连结，均匀地分散装甲的重量。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "hard chest guard"
msgid_plural "hard chest guards"
msgstr[0] "硬质护胸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hard chest guard'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A plastron of interlocking plastic plate protecting your torso."
msgstr "一件用互锁的塑料板制成的胸甲，用来保护你的躯干。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "cuirass"
msgid_plural "cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "钢制胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cuirass', 'str_pl': 'cuirasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A steel breastplate, and a vital part of plate armor.  Even as full armor "
"went into decline, cuirasses remained in use among cavalry in Europe."
msgstr "一件钢制的胸腹部护甲，一套盔甲的核心部位。就算在全身覆甲的潮流被时代所淘汰之后，钢制胸甲仍然在欧洲的骑兵部队中有被装备。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "superalloy cuirass"
msgid_plural "superalloy cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "超合金钢制胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'superalloy cuirass', 'str_pl': 'superalloy
#. cuirasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A superalloy breastplate, and a vital part of plate armor.  Even as full "
"armor went into decline, cuirasses remained in use among cavalry in Europe."
msgstr "一件超合金制的胸腹部护甲，一套盔甲的核心部位。就算在全身覆甲的潮流被时代所淘汰之后，钢制胸甲仍然在欧洲的骑兵部队中有被装备。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "scrap cuirass"
msgid_plural "scrap cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "废料胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scrap cuirass', 'str_pl': 'scrap cuirasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A cuirass made from scraps of metal secured by simple strings; the loose "
"collection of plates provides decent but not the most convenient protection."
msgstr "一套用金属碎片做成的装甲，碎片之间用小绳子固定。这些松垮的小片片能提供不错的防护，但是还不够完美。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "fencing jacket"
msgid_plural "fencing jackets"
msgstr[0] "击剑夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fencing jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A padded jacket with the zipper on the back used by fencers to prevent "
"accidents.  It doesn't have any storage room, but it is very comfortable."
msgstr "一件拉链在背后、设计用于助于防止击剑等运动时发生意外击剑上衣。它没有储存空间，但相当舒适。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "armored leather jacket"
msgid_plural "armored leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "装甲皮夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armored leather jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"An armored jacket made from thick leather and metal plates.  Cumbersome, but"
" offers excellent protection from harm."
msgstr "一件由厚实的皮革加上金属板制成的护甲外套。累赘，但是提供了绝佳的伤害保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "occult bone armor"
msgid_plural "occult bone armors"
msgstr[0] "邪异骨甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'occult bone armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A black jacket made from thick leather and covered with intricately carved "
"bones.  You've never seen patterns like those before, each time you look at "
"them you spot a new one as if they were changing on their own."
msgstr ""
"一件由厚皮制成的黑色夹克，上面布满了雕刻复杂的骨头。你以前从来没有见过上面这种花纹，每当你再次细细查看，你就会发现一个新的花纹，好像它们会自己改变一样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "lamé (foil)"
msgid_plural "lamés (foil)"
msgstr[0] "导电服（花剑）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lamé (foil)', 'str_pl': 'lamés (foil)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin, lightweight conductive vest with the zipper on the back used by "
"fencers for electronic scoring.  Its outer layer is a woven mix of sturdy "
"cotton and stainless steel strands."
msgstr "一件轻薄的导电背心，背部有拉链，用于在击剑时电子计分。它的最外层是由结实的棉布和不锈钢丝交织而成的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "lamé (saber)"
msgid_plural "lamés (saber)"
msgstr[0] "导电服（佩剑）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lamé (saber)', 'str_pl': 'lamés (saber)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin, lightweight conductive jacket used by fencers for electronic "
"scoring.  Its outer layer is a woven mix of sturdy cotton and stainless "
"steel strands."
msgstr "一件轻薄的导电夹克，用于在击剑时电子计分。它的最外层是由结实的棉布和不锈钢丝交织而成的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "football armor"
msgid_plural "football armors"
msgstr[0] "橄榄球护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'football armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy plastic armor for your upper torso.  Normally worn by football "
"players."
msgstr "一件沉重的、通常由橄榄球员穿着的塑料护甲。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "Kevlar vest"
msgid_plural "Kevlar vests"
msgstr[0] "凯夫拉背心"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kevlar vest'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, bullet resistant vest.  Suitable for wearing under clothing."
msgstr ""
"一件轻便、贴身的凯夫拉材质防弹背心。\n"
"\"反派一枪杀不死卧底警探的头号元凶。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "light survivor body armor"
msgid_plural "light survivor body armors"
msgstr[0] "轻型幸存者护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light survivor body armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Lightweight, custom-built body armor made from Kevlar and tough fabric.  "
"Mostly waterproof."
msgstr "一件轻巧、量身订造的护甲，由凯夫拉和坚韧的纤维制成，有一定防水能力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "motorcycle armor"
msgid_plural "motorcycle armors"
msgstr[0] "摩托车手上衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'motorcycle armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A suit of armor used by dirt bikers and motorcyclists."
msgstr "一件为摩托车手和越野自行车手所使用的护甲，凯夫拉材质提供了出色的防护能力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "underarm protector"
msgid_plural "underarm protectors"
msgstr[0] "腋下护甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'underarm protector'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy cotton plastron that protects much of the torso, the dominant "
"shoulder, and underarm while fencing."
msgstr "一件结实的棉质胸甲，能在击剑时保护大部分躯干、肩膀主要部分和腋下。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "plastic chest protector"
msgid_plural "plastic chest protectors"
msgstr[0] "塑料胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic chest protector'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A rigid plastic plastron with molded cups to be worn by female fencers for "
"protection while fencing."
msgstr "一件硬质塑料胸甲，有模制的胸罩，可供女子击剑运动员佩带，以在击剑时提供保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "armored leather vest"
msgid_plural "armored leather vests"
msgstr[0] "装甲皮背心"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armored leather vest'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"An armored vest made from thick leather and metal plates.  Cumbersome, but "
"offers excellent protection from harm."
msgstr "一件由厚实的皮革加上金属板制成的护甲背心。累赘，但是提供了绝佳的伤害保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "bone cuirass"
msgid_plural "bone cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "骨制胸甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone cuirass', 'str_pl': 'bone cuirasses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A cuirass made from large pieces of carved bone, laced together like "
"lamellar armor.  Tough but stiff, and a bit brittle."
msgstr "由大型雕刻骨片制成的胸甲，像鳞片甲一样用绳索编织在一起。坚韧但略显僵硬，还有些脆弱。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "carbon fiber chestguard"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber chestguards"
msgstr[0] "碳纤维护胸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon fiber chestguard'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom chestplate of layered carbon fiber armor made using a 3D printer.  "
"Its rigid plates are more comparable to a suit of armor than kevlar, but "
"it's very protective and lightweight."
msgstr "使用3D打印机定制的多层碳纤维护胸。 与凯夫拉相比，它的硬质板材更像是一套盔甲，但却具有很强的防护性，而且重量很轻。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "leather apron"
msgid_plural "leather aprons"
msgstr[0] "皮围裙"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather apron'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An apron made of thick leather.  Cumbersome, but offers excellent protection"
" from cuts."
msgstr "一件厚皮革制成的围裙。相当累赘，但是提供了绝佳的斩击防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "blazer"
msgid_plural "blazers"
msgstr[0] "运动夹克"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blazer'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A professional-looking wool blazer.  Quite cumbersome."
msgstr "一件羊毛制的专业运动夹克。相当累赘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "dress"
msgid_plural "dresses"
msgstr[0] "连衣裙"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dress', 'str_pl': 'dresses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A long cotton dress.  Though comfortable to wear, it lacks any storage "
"space."
msgstr "一件棉制长连衣裙。虽然穿着很舒适，但没有任何储存空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "dress shirt"
msgid_plural "dress shirts"
msgstr[0] "礼服衬衫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dress shirt'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A white button-down shirt with long sleeves.  Looks professional!"
msgstr ""
"一件白色纽扣领的长袖衬衫。\n"
"\"穿着像个专业人士！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "wedding dress"
msgid_plural "wedding dresses"
msgstr[0] "婚纱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wedding dress', 'str_pl': 'wedding dresses'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A beautiful white wedding dress.  What good will it be now?"
msgstr "一件美丽的白色婚纱。现在还适合穿吗？"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "flag shirt"
msgid_plural "flag shirts"
msgstr[0] "爱国衫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flag shirt'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A t-shirt embroidered with the pattern of an American flag."
msgstr "一件印着星条旗花纹的T恤衫。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "flotation vest"
msgid_plural "flotation vests"
msgstr[0] "救生衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flotation vest'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A brightly-colored vest designed to keep you upright and floating in water."
msgstr "一件有着醒目颜色的，能让你在水上保持垂直漂浮的背心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "makeshift flotation vest"
msgid_plural "makeshift flotation vests"
msgstr[0] "简易救生衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift flotation vest'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A flotation vest made of inflated animal skins."
msgstr "一件用充满气的动物皮毛制造而成的救生衣。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "evening gown"
msgid_plural "evening gowns"
msgstr[0] "晚礼服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'evening gown'}
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A luxurious evening gown.  It accentuates your curves, or lack thereof."
msgstr "一件晚上20:00以后穿用的正式礼服，常与披肩、外套、斗篷之类的衣服相配，是女士礼服中最高档次、最具特色、充分展示个性的礼服样式。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "halter top"
