"A cozy hoodie patterned with thick earth-toned stripes—burnt umber, forest "
"green, and sand.  The texture is rough but comforting."
msgstr "一件厚重的、由土色调条纹（焦褐色、森林绿和沙色）组成的舒适连帽衫。手感粗糙但令人安心。"

