"Tan and teal stripes dance across the weave of this soft, oversized hoodie."
"  Looks perfect for stargazing in the desert."
msgstr "棕褐色和青绿色条纹交错在这件柔软而宽松的连帽衫上。看起来非常适合在沙漠中仰望星空。"

