msgid_plural "copies of the Lunyu"
msgstr[0] "论语"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lunyu', 'str_pl': 'copies of the Lunyu'}
#: data/json/items/book/bloat.json
msgid ""
"An English translation of the most-revered sacred scripture in the Confucian"
" tradition, compiled by the succeeding generations of Confucius's disciples."
"  It is sometimes viewed as a philosophy and sometimes as a religion."
msgstr "一本在儒家传统中备受尊崇的圣典的英文翻译，由孔子的弟子们编纂而成。有时被视为哲学，有时被视为宗教。"

#: data/json/items/book/bloat.json
msgid "Book of Pagan prayer"
