msgstr[0] "高级商业和军事密码"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'High Level Commercial and Military
#. Cryptology'}
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly dense volume describing different advanced cryptographical "
"methods, their strenghts, and weaknesses.  This text would probably be "
"easier to digest with an added decade in Computer Science Academia."
msgstr ""
"这是一本非常难以读懂的书，描述了不同的高级加密方法以及它们的优点和缺点。如果你在计算机科学院有过十几年的工作经验，也许这本书会变得容易理解一些。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
