msgid "campfire hot dog"
msgid_plural "campfire hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "篝火热狗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'campfire hot dog'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"The simple hot dog, cooked over an open fire.  Would be better on a bun, but"
" it's quite an improvement over eating it uncooked"
msgstr "一份经过简单的明火烤熟加工的热狗，味道尝起来显然没有裹上面包与其他调料的更好，但作为充饥品已经非常不错了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "cooked hot dog"
msgid_plural "cooked hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "熟热狗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cooked hot dog'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Surprisingly, not made from dog.  Cooked, this hot dog now tastes much "
"better, but will spoil."
msgstr "一份经过加热的热狗，尝起来更棒，但容易变质。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "malted milk ball"
msgid_plural "malted milk balls"
msgstr[0] "麦丽酥"

#. ~ Description for malted milk ball
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
