#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'potted meat'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Salted meat slowly cooked and preserved in butter or melted fat, a form of "
"food preservation from the days before canning.  Also known as confit.  Rich"
" and fattening, it will last for a long time."
msgstr "慢慢烹饪的咸肉，在黄油或融化的脂肪中保存，这是罐装前的一种食物保存形式。也称为油焖肉。它丰富而肥美，可以保存很长一段时间。"

