#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bibimbap'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A mixed meat and rice dish from Korea, often with eggs and various veggies."
"  This version has gone for a full-house of ingredients, making it extra "
"tasty."
msgstr "一种来自韩国的拌饭菜肴，通常包括肉、米饭、鸡蛋和各种蔬菜。这一版本使用了丰富的食材组合，使其风味更加美味可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "simple bibimbap"
msgid_plural "simple bibimbap"
msgstr[0] "简易韩式拌饭"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'simple bibimbap'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A mixed meat and rice dish from Korea, often with eggs and various veggies."
msgstr "一种来自韩国的拌饭菜肴，通常包括肉、米饭、鸡蛋和各种蔬菜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "kimchi fried rice"
msgid_plural "kimchi fried rice"
msgstr[0] "韩式泡菜炒饭"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'kimchi fried rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Fried rice with the unique flavor of kimchi.  The rich oil and spicy flavor "
"are well balanced."
msgstr "带有泡菜独特风味的炒饭，油香浓郁，辣味适中，味道平衡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "samhap"
msgid_plural "samhap"
msgstr[0] "韩式三合"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'samhap'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A Korean dish that combines boiled meat, kimchi, and raw fish all at once.  "
"The flavors blend into delicious harmony."
msgstr "一种韩国菜，将煮熟的肉、泡菜和生鱼片结合在一起，味道和谐融合，美味无比。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "bossam"
msgid_plural "bossam"
msgstr[0] "韩式包肉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bossam'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A Korean dish of boiled meat served with kimchi.  The tender meat is paired "
"with a spicy flavor."
msgstr "一道韩国菜，以煮熟的肉配上泡菜，肉质鲜嫩，搭配辛辣的风味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "kebab"
msgid_plural "kebab"
msgstr[0] "烤肉串配蔬菜"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'kebab'} when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'meat kebab'} when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "donner kebab"
msgid_plural "donner kebabs"
msgstr[0] "烤肉串配蔬菜（人肉）"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'kebab'} when COMPONENT_ID matches mutant
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'meat kebab'} when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. mutant
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#, c-format
msgid "killer %s"
msgid_plural "killer %s"
msgstr[0] "%s（变异肉）"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'kebab'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Cooked meats and veggies on a stick.  Popular street food originating from "
"the Middle East and later spread to Asia and the rest of the world."
msgstr "烤制的肉类和蔬菜串在一起。起源于中东的流行街头美食，后来传播到亚洲及世界各地。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "meat kebab"
msgid_plural "meat kebab"
msgstr[0] "烤肉串"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'meat kebab'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Cooked meats on a stick.  Popular street food originating from the Middle "
"East and later spread to Asia and the rest of the world."
msgstr "烤制的肉类串在一起。起源于中东的流行街头美食，后来传播到亚洲及世界各地。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "fried bugs"
msgid_plural "fried bugs"
msgstr[0] "炸虫子"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fried bugs'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A crispy, crunchy mix of fried bugs.  Roasted and seasoned, they almost "
"taste like a snack food if you can get over what you're eating."
msgstr "一份香脆可口的油炸什锦虫。经过烘烤和调味，它们的味道几乎就像零食一样——只要你别去想吃的是什么。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid "fried clam"
msgid_plural "fried clam"
msgstr[0] "炸蛤蜊"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fried clam'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Crispy fried clam strips, golden-brown and delicious.  A New England "
"specialty."
msgstr "香酥的炸蛤蜊肉条，金黄诱人，美味可口。一道新英格兰地区的特色菜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "first aid kit"
msgid_plural "first aid kits"
msgstr[0] "急救箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'first aid kit'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A full medical kit, with bandages, local anesthetics, and rapid healing "
"agents.  Used for healing large amounts of damage.  Disassemble to get its "
"content."
msgstr "一个完整的急救包，里面有绷带、局部麻醉剂、伤口恢复药。用于严重伤害的治疗。拆解它以获取内容物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "melatonin tablet"
msgid_plural "melatonin tablets"
msgstr[0] "褪黑素片"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for melatonin tablet.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You pop a melatonin tablet."
msgstr "你服用了褪黑素片。"

#. ~ Description for melatonin tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Over-the-counter melatonin supplements, commonly prescribed to treat sleep "
"deprivation and to mitigate its effects.  One tablet a day combined with a "
"good night's sleep will help you recover faster."
msgstr "非处方褪黑激素补充剂，通常用于治疗睡眠不足并减轻其影响。一天一片，再加上一整晚良好的睡眠，可以帮助你更快地恢复健康。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Adderall"
msgid_plural "Adderall"
msgstr[0] "安非他命"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'Adderall'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some adderall."
msgstr "你服用了一些安非他命。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Adderall'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Medical grade amphetamine salts mixed with Dextroamphetamine salts, commonly"
" prescribed to treat hyperactive attention deficits.  It suppresses the "
"appetite, and is quite addictive."
msgstr "医用级苯丙胺盐，常用于治疗注意力分散和多动症。它能抑制食欲，而且是非常容易上瘾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "syringe of adrenaline"
msgid_plural "syringes of adrenaline"
msgstr[0] "肾上腺素注射针"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'syringe of adrenaline', 'str_pl': 'syringes of
#. adrenaline'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A syringe filled with a shot of adrenaline.  It serves as a powerful "
"stimulant when you inject yourself with it.  Asthmatics can use it in an "
"emergency to clear their asthma."
msgstr ""
"一管装满了肾上腺素的注射器，医用时，可以在紧急情况下使用它来解除哮喘病人的哮喘；也可用作为一种强大的兴奋剂，使人暂时爆发出强大的肌体力量与神经反射能力，效果消失后也有着一定的副作用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antibiotics"
msgid_plural "antibiotics"
msgstr[0] "抗生素"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'antibiotics'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A strong antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the spread of "
"infection.  It's the safest way to cure any infections you might have.  One "
"dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr "一份强效抗生素，用于预防和治疗感染。这是大概是当前能够治愈感染的最安全的方式。一剂药持续十二小时。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antifungal drug"
msgid_plural "antifungal drugs"
msgstr[0] "抗真菌药"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'antifungal drug'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Powerful chemical tablets designed to eliminate fungal infections in living "
"creatures."
msgstr "一些非常有效的化学药片，可以为生物清除体内的真菌感染。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiparasitic drug"
msgid_plural "antiparasitic drug"
msgstr[0] "抗寄生药"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'antiparasitic drug'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Broad spectrum chemical tablets designed to eliminate parasitic infestations"
" in living creatures.  Though designed for use on pets and livestock, it "
"will likely work on humans as well."
msgstr "一些广谱的抗寄生虫药片，用来清除生物体内的寄生虫。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "aspirin"
msgid_plural "aspirins"
msgstr[0] "阿司匹林"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'aspirin'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some aspirin."
msgstr "你服用了一些阿司匹林 。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'aspirin'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetylsalicylic acid, a mild anti-inflammatory.  Take to relieve pain and "
"swelling."
msgstr "一种温和的消炎药，亦称乙酰水杨酸，用以缓解轻微的痛肿。最好避免与酒或其他止痛药一起服用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "bandage"
msgid_plural "bandages"
msgstr[0] "绷带"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bandage'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Simple cloth bandages.  Used for healing small amounts of damage."
msgstr "一捆简单的医用绷带，可以用来包扎伤口并阻止伤口流血。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "makeshift bandage"
msgid_plural "makeshift bandages"
msgstr[0] "简易绷带"

#. ~ Description for makeshift bandage
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Simple cloth bandages.  Better than nothing."
msgstr "简单的由布条撕成的绷带，总比没有好了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "bleached makeshift bandage"
msgid_plural "bleached makeshift bandages"
msgstr[0] "简易绷带（漂白）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bleached makeshift bandage'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Simple cloth bandages.  It is white, as real bandages should be."
msgstr "简单的由布条撕成的绷带。用漂白剂漂白过，和真的绷带一样地白。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "boiled makeshift bandage"
msgid_plural "boiled makeshift bandages"
msgstr[0] "简易绷带（煮沸）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boiled makeshift bandage'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Simple cloth bandages.  It was boiled to make it more sterile."
msgstr "简单的由布条撕成的绷带。用沸水煮过，较有效地杀菌了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiseptic powder"
msgid_plural "antiseptic powder"
msgstr[0] "医用抗菌粉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'antiseptic powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered form of chemical antiseptic, this bismuth formic iodide cleans "
"wounds quickly and painlessly."
msgstr "一些粉末形式的化学抗菌剂，这些碘化铋甲酸消毒粉可以轻松无痛的清洁伤口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/items/vanilla_extentions.json
msgid "caffeinated chewing gum"
msgid_plural "caffeinated chewing gum"
msgstr[0] "咖啡因口香糖"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'caffeinated chewing gum'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You chew your caffeinated chewing gum."
msgstr "你嚼着你的咖啡因口香糖。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'caffeinated chewing gum'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Sugar-free chewing gum with added caffeine, it's a nice pick-me-up."
msgstr "添加了咖啡因的口香糖，不含糖，能够提神醒脑。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "caffeine pill"
msgid_plural "caffeine pills"
msgstr[0] "咖啡因含片"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for caffeine pill.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a caffeine pill."
msgstr "你服用了咖啡因含片。"

#. ~ Description for caffeine pill
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"No-doz brand caffeine pills, maximum strength.  Useful in pulling an all-"
"nighter, one pill is about equivalent to a strong cup of coffee."
msgstr "一些没有品牌的咖啡因药丸，为保证出色的效果有着最大咖啡因量，熬夜工作时很有用，一颗相当于一大杯咖啡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "chewing tobacco"
msgid_plural "chewing tobaccos"
msgstr[0] "咀嚼烟草"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for chewing tobacco.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You chew your chewing tobacco."
msgstr "你嚼着你的咀嚼烟草。"

#. ~ Description for chewing tobacco
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Fruit flavored chewing tobacco.  While still absolutely terrible for your "
"health, it was once a favorite amongst baseball players, cowboys, and other "
"macho types."
msgstr "水果味的咀嚼烟草。虽然对你的健康十分不利，它曾经是棒球运动员，牛仔，或者其他的男子汉最喜欢的食物之一。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hydrogen peroxide"
msgid_plural "hydrogen peroxide"
msgstr[0] "过氧化氢"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hydrogen peroxide'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Dilute hydrogen peroxide, for use as an antiseptic and for bleaching hair or"
" textiles.  Foams a little when in contact with organic matter, but "
"otherwise harmless."
msgstr "稀释的过氧化氢，可当抗菌剂，或用来漂白头发与织物。与有机物接触时会轻微起泡，不过基本无害。"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for cigarette.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You light up the cigarette."
msgstr "你点燃了香烟。"

#. ~ Description for cigarette
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of dried tobacco leaf, pesticides, and chemical additives, rolled "
"into a filtered paper tube.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite."
"  Highly addictive and hazardous to health."
msgstr "将制备好的干燥烟草和添加剂香料混合在一起，卷成一个纸卷，用来吸食。刺激感知，并降低食欲。高度容易上瘾并危害健康。"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for cigar.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You light up the cigar."
msgstr "你点燃了雪茄。"

#. ~ Description for cigar
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Rolled, cured tobacco leaf, addictive and hazardous to health."
msgstr ""
"一份卷式烤烟，会上瘾，对身体有害。\n"
"\"绅士大亨们经常一边抽着这玩意一边高谈阔论。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "chloroform soaked rag"
msgid_plural "chloroform soaked rags"
msgstr[0] "氯仿布条"

#. ~ Description for chloroform soaked rag
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A debug item that lets you put NPCs (or yourself) to sleep."
msgstr "调试用物品，可让NPC或自己入睡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "codeine"
msgid_plural "codeine"
msgstr[0] "可待因"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'codeine'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some codeine."
msgstr "你服用了一些可待因。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'codeine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mild opiate used in the suppression of pain, cough, and other ailments.  "
"While relatively weak for a narcotic, it is still addictive, with a "
"potential for overdose."
msgstr "一种用于抑制疼痛温和的阿片类药物，可以治疗咳嗽，和其他疾病。相对温和麻醉剂，过量使用，仍会上瘾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json src/addiction.cpp
msgid "cocaine"
msgid_plural "cocaine"
msgstr[0] "可卡因"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'cocaine'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You snort a bump of coke."
msgstr "你吸食了一小撮可卡因。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cocaine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Crystalline extract of the coca leaf, or at least, a white powder with some "
"of that in it.  A topical analgesic, it is more commonly used for its "
"stimulatory properties.  Highly addictive."
msgstr "古柯叶提取物的结晶，一种白色粉末。可以用来局部镇痛，含有刺激特性。高度上瘾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "methacola"
msgid_plural "methacolas"
msgstr[0] "冰毒可乐"

#. ~ Description for methacola
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent cocktail of amphetamines, caffeine and corn syrup, this stuff puts "
"a spring in your step, a fire in your eye, and a bad case of tachycardia "
"tremors in your somersaulting heart."
msgstr "一种强有力的药酒，含有咖啡因和玉米糖浆，这东西使你身体迸发力量，你眼睛里冒火，心跳加速。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "pair of contact lenses"
msgid_plural "pairs of contact lenses"
msgstr[0] "隐形眼镜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of contact lenses', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. contact lenses'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A pair of extended wear contacts with soft lenses designed to be discarded "
"after a week of use.  They are a great replacement to wearing glasses and "
"sit comfortably on the surface of the eye."
msgstr "一副隐形眼镜，周抛型。佩带舒适，保证不会引起角膜穿孔等副作用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cotton balls"
msgid_plural "cotton balls"
msgstr[0] "棉花球"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cotton balls'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy balls of clean white cotton.  Can serve as makeshift bandages in an "
"emergency."
msgstr "毛茸茸的白棉球。紧急情况下可以勉强作为简易绷带使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "crack"
msgid_plural "crack"
msgstr[0] "快克"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'crack'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You smoke your crack rocks.  Mother would be proud."
msgstr "你吸食了快克可卡因，妈妈会为你骄傲的。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'crack'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Deprotonated cocaine crystals, incredibly addictive and deleterious to brain"
" chemistry."
msgstr "高纯度的可卡因结晶，非常容易上瘾，容易伤害大脑。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "non-drowsy cough syrup"
msgid_plural "non-drowsy cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "抗感冒药水（白）"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'non-drowsy cough syrup'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Daytime cold and flu medication.  Non-drowsy formula.  Will suppress "
"coughing, aching, headaches and runny noses, but you'll still need lots of "
"fluids and rest."
msgstr "白天使用的对抗感冒和流感的药物，吃了不瞌睡。可以抑制咳嗽，疼痛，头痛，流鼻涕，但你仍然需要多喝水和休息。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiseptic"
msgid_plural "antiseptic"
msgstr[0] "抗菌剂"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'antiseptic'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powerful antiseptic commonly used for contaminated wounds."
msgstr "一份强效的抗菌剂，用于清洁伤口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "makeshift antiseptic"
msgid_plural "makeshift antiseptics"
msgstr[0] "简易抗菌剂"

#. ~ Description for makeshift antiseptic
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift antiseptic made from ethanol.  Can be used to disinfect a wound."
msgstr "一份用乙醇制成的简易抗菌剂，可用于伤口消毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json src/addiction.cpp
msgid "diazepam"
msgid_plural "diazepam"
msgstr[0] "安定药片"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'diazepam'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A strong benzodiazepine drug used to treat muscle spasms, anxiety, seizures,"
" and panic attacks."
msgstr "一种强大的苯二氮卓类药物，用于治疗肌肉痉挛，焦虑，癫痫，恐慌。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "saline eye drop"
msgid_plural "saline eye drops"
msgstr[0] "生理盐水眼药水"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'saline eye drop'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Sterile saline eye drops.  Can be used to treat dry eyes, or to wash out "
"contaminants."
msgstr "无菌的生理盐水滴眼液，可以用来治疗眼部干燥，也可以洗掉进入眼中的污染物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/sweet_species.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/items/vanilla_extentions.json
msgid "chewing gum"
msgid_plural "chewing gum"
msgstr[0] "口香糖"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'chewing gum'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You chew your chewing gum."
msgstr "你嚼着你的口香糖。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chewing gum'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Sugar-free chewing gum wrapped in bright pink packaging, with a question "
"mark on the label.  It's a mystery what flavor it is, but the label claims "
"there's 20 unique flavors."
msgstr "包裹在亮粉色包装里的无糖口香糖，包装上有一个问号。口味是个谜，但标签声称包含 20 种独特口味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hand-rolled cigarette"
msgid_plural "hand-rolled cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "手卷烟"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for hand-rolled cigarette.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You light up the hand-rolled cigarette."
msgstr "你点燃了手卷烟。"

#. ~ Description for hand-rolled cigarette
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A roll-your-own made from tobacco and rolling paper.  Stimulates mental "
"acuity and reduces appetite.  Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly "
"addictive and hazardous to health."
msgstr ""
"一根你用卷烟纸和烟草DIY的香烟，刺激感知能力并且降低进食欲望。\n"
"\"即便自产自销但依旧无法掩盖会导致上瘾且有害健康的事实。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "phantom vape"
msgid_plural "phantom vapes"
msgstr[0] "幻影电子烟"

#. ~ Description for phantom vape
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A fake item used for ecig addiction.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "用于模拟电子烟上瘾的虚假物品。如果你拥有它，这是一个BUG。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "heroin"
msgid_plural "heroin"
msgstr[0] "海洛因"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'heroin'}.
#. ~ Use action activation_message for morphine.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You shoot up."
msgstr "你注射完成。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'heroin'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An extremely strong opioid narcotic derived from morphine.  Incredibly "
"addictive, the risk of overdose is extreme, and the drug is contraindicated "
"for nearly all medical purposes."
msgstr "一种提取自吗啡的非常强大的阿片类麻醉药物。非常容易上瘾，过量使用时会有致命危险，它被禁用于几乎所有医疗用途。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "GHB"
msgid_plural "GHB"
msgstr[0] "GHB"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'GHB'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You measure out a dose of GHB with the syringe."
msgstr "你用注射器量取了一剂GHB。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'GHB'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent CNS depressant and natural neurotransmitter, used medically for "
"narcolepsy and sometimes alcohol withdrawal.  Recreational use is risky due "
"to high overdose potential, especially with alcohol."
msgstr ""
"一种强效的中枢神经系统抑制剂和天然神经递质，医学上用于治疗发作性睡病，有时也用于缓解酒精戒断症状。因其过量服用风险高，娱乐性使用具有危险性，尤其是与酒精同服时。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "potassium iodide tablet"
msgid_plural "potassium iodide tablets"
msgstr[0] "碘化钾片"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for potassium iodide tablet.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some potassium iodide."
msgstr "你服下了一些碘化钾。"

#. ~ Description for potassium iodide tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Potassium iodide tablets.  If taken prior to exposure, they help to mitigate"
" injury caused by radiation absorption."
msgstr "碘化钾片。在接触辐射前使用，可减少辐射产生的不良影响。"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for joint.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You light up the joint."
msgstr "你点燃了手卷大麻烟。"

#. ~ Description for joint
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a"
" piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""
"一些大麻，或说是飞草，这是一个将之用纸卷起来随时可以抽的\"好东西\"。\n"
"\"$m0k3 W33d 3v3ryd@y（每迗磕大痲）——！\""

#. ~ Use action activation_message for blunt.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You light up the blunt."
msgstr "你点燃了大麻雪茄。"

#. ~ Description for blunt
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a"
" large tobacco leaf and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""
"一些大麻，或说是飞草，这是一个将之用大烟草叶子卷起来随时可以抽的\"好东西\"。\n"
"\"$m0k3 W33d 3v3ryd@y（每迗磕大痲）——！\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "pink tab"
msgid_plural "pink tabs"
msgstr[0] "邮票毒品"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for pink tab.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You eat the pink tablet."
msgstr "你服用了摇头丸。"

#. ~ Description for pink tab
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Tiny pink tabs resembling postage stamps, already dosed with some sort of "
"drug.  Really only useful for entertainment.  Will cause hallucinations."
msgstr "类似邮票的粉红色小药片，已经加入某种药物。只是消遣性毒品，会引起幻觉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "medical gauze"
msgid_plural "medical gauzes"
msgstr[0] "医用纱布"

#. ~ Description for medical gauze
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"This is decent sized piece of cotton, sterilized and sealed.  It's designed "
"for medical purposes."
msgstr "一团医用棉，大小正合适。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgid_plural "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgstr[0] "劣质冰毒"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'low-grade
#. methamphetamine'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You smoke some meth."
msgstr "你抽了一口冰毒。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'low-grade methamphetamine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A profoundly addictive and powerful stimulant.  While extremely effective at"
" enhancing alertness, it is hazardous to health and the risk of an adverse "
"reaction is great."
msgstr "一种高度的成瘾性和强大的兴奋剂。而在提高警觉性非常有效，但是对健康和产生不良反应的风险是巨大的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "morphine"
msgid_plural "morphines"
msgstr[0] "吗啡"

#. ~ Description for morphine
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A very strong semi-synthetic narcotic used to treat intense pain in hospital"
" settings.  This injectable drug is very addictive."
msgstr "一种强烈的半合成麻醉药，用于抑制治疗过程中的强烈疼痛。这种可注射的药物十分容易上瘾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "mugwort oil"
msgid_plural "mugwort oils"
msgstr[0] "艾蒿油"

#. ~ Description for mugwort oil
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Some essential oil made from mugwort, which may kill parasites when "
"ingested.  Consume it with water!"
msgstr "从艾蒿中提取出来的一些精油。可以口服，用以驱除体内的寄生虫。用水送服！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "nicotine gum"
msgid_plural "nicotine gum"
msgstr[0] "尼古丁口香糖"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'nicotine gum'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You chew your nicotine gum."
msgstr "你嚼着你的尼古丁口香糖。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'nicotine gum'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Mint flavored sugar-free nicotine chewing gum.  For smokers who desire to "
"quit."
msgstr "薄荷味的尼古丁口香糖，不含糖。适合准备戒烟的吸烟者。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cough syrup"
msgid_plural "cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "抗感冒药水（黑）"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cough syrup'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Nighttime cold and flu medication.  Useful when trying to sleep with a head "
"full of virions.  Will cause drowsiness."
msgstr "晚上使用的对抗感冒和流感的药物，吃了睡得香，特别是在你被满脑子的病毒弄得头疼的时候。药效的发挥会使人感到困倦。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "oxycodone"
msgid_plural "oxycodones"
msgstr[0] "羟考酮"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for oxycodone.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some oxycodone."
msgstr "你服用了一些羟考酮。"

#. ~ Description for oxycodone
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A strong semi-synthetic narcotic used in the treatment of intense pain.  "
"Highly addictive."
msgstr "一些半合成的纯阿片受体激动药片，主要通过激动中枢神经系统内的阿片受体而起镇痛作用，镇痛效力中等。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Ambien"
msgid_plural "Ambien"
msgstr[0] "安眠药"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Ambien'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A habit-forming tranquilizer with a variety of psychoactive side effects.  "
"Used in the treatment of insomnia.  Its active ingredient is zolpidem "
"tartrate."
msgstr "一些活性成分为石酸唑吡坦的小药片，有成瘾性和各种精神上的副作用的镇静剂，用来治疗失眠。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "poppy painkiller"
msgid_plural "poppy painkillers"
msgstr[0] "罂粟止痛药"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for poppy painkiller.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some poppy painkiller."
msgstr "你服用了罂粟止痛药"

#. ~ Description for poppy painkiller
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Potent opioid palliative produced by the refining of the mutated poppy.  "
"Notably devoid of euphoric or sedative effects, as an opiate it may still be"
" addictive."
msgstr "一些变异的罂粟提炼所产生的临时性强效药片。值得注意的是它没有的令人愉悦或镇静的作用，作为药片它仍然可能会令人上瘾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "poppy sleep"
msgid_plural "poppy sleeps"
msgstr[0] "罂粟安眠药"

#. ~ Description for poppy sleep
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent sleep aid extracted from mutated poppy seeds.  Effective, but as an"
" opiate, it may be addictive."
msgstr "由变异的罂粟种子中提取的强力辅助睡眠药物。很有效，但作为鸦片制剂它仍然可令人上瘾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "poppy cough syrup"
msgid_plural "poppy cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "罂粟咳嗽糖浆"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'poppy cough syrup'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Cough syrup made from mutated poppy.  Will make you sleepy."
msgstr "变异罂粟制成的咳嗽糖浆。会让你困倦。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "sizzurp lean"
msgid_plural "sizzurp lean"
msgstr[0] "紫饮"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'sizzurp lean'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a sip of purple."
msgstr "你轻啜一口紫色迷幻。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sizzurp lean'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An extremely common polysubstance street-drug that almost anyone can make "
"out of soda, candy, cough syrup and opiates.  Many argue that it's not the "
"real thing if not made with a list of specific ingredients, however, most of"
" them are gone now.  Very euphoric but once you pick up the cup, it will be "
"hard to put it down."
msgstr ""
"这是一种极为常见的多种物质混合的街头毒品，几乎任何人都可以用汽水、糖果、止咳糖浆和鸦片类药物调制而成。许多人认为，只有使用特定的原材料才能算是“正宗”的配方，然而这些原料如今大多已难以获得。这种饮料带来的欣快感非常强烈，但一旦你开始喝，就很难停下来。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Prozac"
msgid_plural "Prozac"
msgstr[0] "百忧解"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Prozac'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A common and popular antidepressant.  It will elevate mood, and can "
"profoundly affect the action of other drugs.  It is only rarely habit-"
"forming, though adverse reactions are not uncommon.  Its generic name is "
"fluoxetine."
msgstr ""
"一种广泛使用的广谱抗抑郁药物。可以使心情愉快，并强烈的影响其他药物的效果。只有极低的成瘾性，即使如此，不良反应也是挺普遍的。学名叫做氟西汀。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Prussian blue tablet"
msgid_plural "Prussian blue tablets"
msgstr[0] "普鲁士蓝药片"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'Prussian blue tablet'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some Prussian blue."
msgstr "你服用了一些普鲁士蓝药片。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prussian blue tablet'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Tablets containing oxidized ferrous ferrocyanide salts.  Capable of purging "
"nuclear contaminants from the body if taken after radiation exposure."
msgstr "含有亚铁氰化铁盐的药片。能够清除体内的核辐射污染，接触辐射后服用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hemostatic powder"
msgid_plural "hemostatic powder"
msgstr[0] "止血粉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hemostatic powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered antihemorrhagic compound that reacts with blood to immediately "
"form a gel-like substance that stops bleeding."
msgstr "一些接触正在流血的伤口就立即形成一种能止血的凝胶状物质的止血粉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "saline solution"
msgid_plural "saline solutions"
msgstr[0] "生理盐水"

#. ~ Description for saline solution
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A solution of sterilized water and salt for intravenous infusion or washing "
"contaminants from one's eyes."
msgstr "一份生理盐水溶液，可以用于静脉注射，或者冲洗眼中的污物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Thorazine"
msgid_plural "Thorazine"
msgstr[0] "冬眠灵"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Thorazine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Anti-psychotic medication.  Used to stabilize brain chemistry, it can arrest"
" hallucinations and other symptoms of psychosis.  Carries a sedative effect."
"  Its generic name is chlorpromazine."
msgstr "抗精神病药物。用来稳定大脑内化学平衡，可以用于抑制幻觉和精神分裂。有镇静效果。学名叫做氯丙嗪。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "thyme oil"
msgid_plural "thyme oils"
msgstr[0] "百里香精油"

#. ~ Description for thyme oil
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Some essential oil made from thyme, which can act as a mildly irritating "
"antiseptic."
msgstr "从百里香中提取的精油，可以作为轻度刺激性的抗菌剂。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "rolling tobacco"
msgid_plural "rolling tobaccos"
msgstr[0] "卷烟烟草"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for rolling tobacco.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You smoke some tobacco."
msgstr "你抽了几口烟。"

#. ~ Description for rolling tobacco
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Loose, fine-cut tobacco leaves.  Popular in Europe and among hipsters.  Highly addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"Can either be rolled into a cigarette with some rolling papers or smoked through a pipe."
msgstr "松散，细切的烟叶。在欧洲和嬉皮士人群中流行。令人上瘾，对身体有害。可以卷成香烟或者找个大烟管直接开吸。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "tramadol"
msgid_plural "tramadols"
msgstr[0] "曲马朵"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for tramadol.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some tramadol."
msgstr "你服用了一剂曲马朵。"

#. ~ Description for tramadol
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A painkiller used to manage moderate pain.  The effects last for several "
"hours, but are relatively subdued for an opioid."
msgstr "一种管制的中度止痛药。效果持续几个小时，效果不及鸦片类药物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "gamma globulin shot"
msgid_plural "gamma globulin shots"
msgstr[0] "丙种球蛋白注射剂"

#. ~ Description for gamma globulin shot
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"This immunoglobulin booster contains concentrated antibodies prepared for "
"intravenous injection to temporarily strengthen the immune system.  It is "
"still in its original packaging."
msgstr "这是一针免疫球蛋白注射剂，含有用于静脉注射的抗体，能暂时增强你的免疫系统。它还是原装的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "multivitamin"
msgid_plural "multivitamins"
msgstr[0] "复合维生素"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for multivitamin.
#. ~ Use action activation_message for calcium tablet.
#. ~ Use action activation_message for bone meal tablet.
#. ~ Use action activation_message for flavored bone meal tablet.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take the %s."
msgstr "你服用了 %s。"

#. ~ Description for multivitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in pill form.  An option "
"of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause "
"hypervitaminosis."
msgstr "身体必需的各种膳食营养成分被方便地包装成丸状。是无法平衡饮食时的最后手段。过量使用可引起维生素过多症。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "calcium tablet"
msgid_plural "calcium tablets"
msgstr[0] "钙片"

#. ~ Description for calcium tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"White calcium tablets.  Widely used by elderly people with osteoporosis as a"
" method to supplement calcium before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"一些白色的钙片。在大灾变之前广泛用于给骨质疏松的老人补充钙质\n"
"\"经过全新科技配方研制而成，一片顶过去五片儿，令人一口气上五楼不费劲。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "骨粉片"

#. ~ Description for bone meal tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Tastes horrible and is "
"hard to swallow but it does its job."
msgstr "一份用骨粉制成的自制钙补充剂。尝起来口感很糟糕，很难下咽，但它起码管点用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "flavored bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "flavored bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "风味骨粉片"

#. ~ Description for flavored bone meal tablet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Due to some sweetness "
"mixed in to counteract the powdery texture and the taste of ash, it's almost"
" as palatable as the pre-Cataclysm tablets."
msgstr "一份用骨粉制成的自制钙补充剂。由于添加了甜味剂来抵消原本粉状质地和骨灰味道，它现在几乎和大灾变前的药片一样可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "gummy vitamin"
msgid_plural "gummy vitamins"
msgstr[0] "维他命树脂糖"

#. ~ Description for gummy vitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in a fruit-flavored chewy "
"candy form.  An option of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible."
"  Excess use can cause hypervitaminosis."
msgstr "一些水果口味耐嚼软糖形式的基本膳食营养。当饮食营养不均衡时的最终解决方案，过多使用会导致维生素过多症。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "injectable vitamin B"
msgid_plural "injectable vitamin Bs"
msgstr[0] "注射用维生素B"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for injectable vitamin B.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You inject some vitamin B."
msgstr "你注射了一些维生素B。"

#. ~ Description for injectable vitamin B
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Small vials of pale yellow liquid containing soluble vitamin B for "
"injection."
msgstr "小瓶装的淡黄色液体，含有水溶性维生素B的注射液。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "injectable iron"
msgid_plural "injectable irons"
msgstr[0] "注射用铁补充剂"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for injectable iron.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You inject some iron."
msgstr "你注射了一些铁补充剂。"

#. ~ Description for injectable iron
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Small vials of dark yellow liquid containing soluble iron for injection."
msgstr "小瓶暗黄色的液体，含有可溶性铁元素的注射液。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "marijuana"
msgid_plural "marijuana"
msgstr[0] "大麻叶片"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'marijuana'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You smoke some weed.  Good stuff, man!"
msgstr "你吸了一口大麻。真是痛快！"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'marijuana'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"The dried flower buds and leaves harvested from a psychoactive variety of "
"hemp plant.  Used to reduce nausea, stimulate appetite and elevate mood.  It"
" can be habit-forming, and adverse reactions are possible."
msgstr "干燥后的花蕾、叶子，采集自各种大麻植物。用来减轻恶心，刺激食欲，提升心情值。它可以致瘾，并可能有不良反应。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Xanax'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Anti-anxiety agent with a powerful sedative effect.  May cause dissociation "
"and loss of memory.  It is dangerously addictive, and withdrawal from "
"regular use should be gradual.  Its generic name is alprazolam."
msgstr "具有强烈镇静作用的抗焦虑剂。可能造成注意力不集中和失忆。极易成瘾，而且需要多疗程的渐进式戒断。学名叫做阿普唑仑。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiseptic soaked rag"
msgid_plural "antiseptic soaked rags"
msgstr[0] "抗菌布条"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'antiseptic soaked rag'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A rag soaked in antiseptic.  Useful for light wounds, probably won't help "
"with deep bites."
msgstr "浸过抗菌剂的布条。对于轻微的伤口很有用，但对于严重的咬伤可能就没用了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiseptic soaked cotton balls"
msgid_plural "antiseptic soaked cotton balls"
msgstr[0] "抗菌棉花球"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'antiseptic soaked cotton balls'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy balls of clean white cotton.  Now soaked with antiseptic, they are "
"somewhat useful to disinfect a wound."
msgstr "干净的白色棉球。这个浸泡了抗菌剂，对伤口的消毒有一定作用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "weak antibiotics"
msgid_plural "weak antibiotics"
msgstr[0] "弱效抗生素"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'weak antibiotics'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum antibiotic used to suppress infections and prevent them "
"from setting in.  It isn't strong enough to purge infections outright, but "
"it boosts the body's resistance against them.  One dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr "一种广谱抗生素，用于预防和抑制感染。功效还不足以彻底治愈感染，但可增强体内免疫力。一剂药持续十二小时。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "heartburn medicine"
msgid_plural "heartburn medicines"
msgstr[0] "胃药"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for heartburn medicine.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some heartburn medicine."
msgstr "你服用了一些胃药。"

#. ~ Description for heartburn medicine
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Creamy pink heartburn syrup that soothes upset stomachs and quells vomitous "
"urges; with a twist off cap that doubles as a dosage cup."
msgstr "一罐粘稠的粉红色胃药糖浆，能缓解胃部不适，平息呕吐冲动；带着一个能够拧下的盖子，能当作测量剂量的量杯使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid "Panaceus"
msgid_plural "Panaceii"
msgstr[0] "万能药"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'Panaceus', 'str_pl':
#. 'Panaceii'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid "You feel AMAZING!"
msgstr "你感觉棒～极～了！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Panaceus', 'str_pl': 'Panaceii'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An apple-red gel capsule the size of your thumbnail, filled with a thick "
"oily liquid that shifts from black to purple at unpredictable intervals, "
"flecked with tiny gray dots.  Given the place you got it from, it's either "
"very potent, or highly experimental.  Holding it, all the little aches and "
"pains seem to fade, just for a moment…"
msgstr ""
"一颗红如苹果的胶囊，和你拇指甲差不多大小，内部充满了一种厚厚的油状液体，这种液体毫无规律地从黑色变成紫色，上面布满了灰色小点。从你获得它的地方看来，它要么有特别的药效，要么就是实验用品。那怕只是将它握在手中一瞬间，你都觉得一切痛苦仿佛消失了一般……"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cattail jelly"
msgid_plural "cattail jellies"
msgstr[0] "香蒲胶"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cattail jelly', 'str_pl': 'cattail jellies'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Clear jelly harvested from cattail, has antiseptic properties and works as a"
" painkiller."
msgstr "从香蒲秆中获得的透明凝胶，具有抗菌作用且能当作止痛剂使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "strong antibiotics"
msgid_plural "strong antibiotics"
msgstr[0] "强效抗生素"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'strong antibiotics'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A prescription-strength antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop"
" the spread of infection.  It contains nearly toxic levels of antibiotics, "
"but can treat any bacterial infections you may encounter.  One dose lasts "
"twelve hours."
msgstr "一份强效处方抗生素，用于预防和治疗感染。带有一定毒性，但是能够治疗你能遇到的任何感染。一剂药持续十二小时。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE"
msgid_plural "MREs"
msgstr[0] "MRE 口粮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "A generic MRE box, you shouldn't see this."
msgstr "一份抽象化的MRE军用口粮包装盒，你不该在游戏里看到它。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "MRE small box"
msgid_plural "MRE small boxes"
msgstr[0] "MRE 小包装盒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE small box', 'str_pl': 'MRE small boxes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A generic small MRE box, you shouldn't see this"
msgstr "一份抽象化的小型MRE军用口粮包装盒，你不该在游戏里看到它。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE entree"
msgid_plural "MRE entrees"
msgstr[0] "MRE 主菜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE entree'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "A generic MRE entree, you shouldn't see this."
msgstr "一份抽象化的MRE主菜，你不该在游戏里看到它。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - Accessory Pack"
msgid_plural "MREs - Accessory Packs"
msgstr[0] "MRE（配件包）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - Accessory Pack', 'str_pl': 'MREs -
#. Accessory Packs'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"An MRE accessory pack containing a variety of utensils and drinks.  Activate"
" or disassemble it to get to its contents."
msgstr "一份包含各种餐具和饮料包的 MRE 军用口粮配件包。激活或拆解它以获得其内容物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - Dessert Pack"
msgid_plural "MREs - Dessert Packs"
msgstr[0] "MRE（糖果包）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - Dessert Pack', 'str_pl': 'MREs - Dessert
#. Packs'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"A sealed plastic bag containing an array of desserts.  Activate or "
"disassemble it to get to its contents."
msgstr "一份包含各种小吃点心的密封塑料包。激活或拆解它以获得其内容物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - Chili & Beans"
msgid_plural "MREs - Chili & Beans"
msgstr[0] "MRE（辣椒炒豆）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - Chili & Beans', 'str_pl': 'MREs - Chili &
#. Beans'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"A 'Meal Ready to Eat' with a chili & beans entree and everything a hungry "
"soldier needs.  The contents are individually packed and will remain sealed "
"after you open this box.  Activate or disassemble it to get to its contents."
"  This one tastes good."
msgstr ""
"一份 MRE "
"军用口粮包，包括一份辣椒炒豆风味的主菜和饥饿士兵所需要的其他一切东西。内容物是单独包装的，打开外盒后仍会保持密封。激活或拆解它以获得其内容物。这一款味道不错。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - BBQ Beef"
msgid_plural "MREs - BBQ Beef"
msgstr[0] "MRE（烤牛肉）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - BBQ Beef', 'str_pl': 'MREs - BBQ Beef'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"A 'Meal Ready to Eat' with a BBQ beef entree and everything a hungry soldier"
" needs.  The contents are individually packed and will remain sealed after "
"you open this box.  Activate or disassemble it to get to its contents.  This"
" one tastes delicious."
msgstr ""
"一份 MRE "
"军用口粮包，包括一份烤牛肉风味的主菜和饥饿士兵所需要的其他一切东西。内容物是单独包装的，打开外盒后仍会保持密封。激活或拆解它以获得其内容物。这一款非常美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - Chicken & Noodles"
msgid_plural "MREs - Chicken & Noodles"
msgstr[0] "MRE（鸡肉面）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - Chicken & Noodles', 'str_pl': 'MREs -
#. Chicken & Noodles'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"A 'Meal Ready to Eat' with a chicken & noodles entree and everything a "
"hungry soldier needs.  The contents are individually packed and will remain "
"sealed after you open this box.  Activate or disassemble it to get to its "
"contents.  This one tastes bland and gross, even after all the flavoring "
"added."
msgstr ""
"一份 MRE "
"军用口粮包，包括一份鸡肉面风味的主菜和饥饿士兵所需要的其他一切东西。内容物是单独包装的，打开外盒后仍会保持密封。激活或拆解它以获得其内容物。即使加了各种调味料，这一款味道依然寡淡难吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - Spaghetti"
msgid_plural "MREs - Spaghetti"
msgstr[0] "MRE（意大利面）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - Spaghetti', 'str_pl': 'MREs - Spaghetti'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"A 'Meal Ready to Eat' with a spaghetti entree and everything a hungry "
"soldier needs.  The contents are individually packed and will remain sealed "
"after you open this box.  Activate or disassemble it to get to its contents."
"  This one tastes good."
msgstr ""
"一份 MRE "
"军用口粮包，包括一份意大利面风味的主菜和饥饿士兵所需要的其他一切东西。内容物是单独包装的，打开外盒后仍会保持密封。激活或拆解它以获得其内容物。这一款味道不错。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - Chicken Chunks"
msgid_plural "MREs - Chicken Chunks"
msgstr[0] "MRE（炸鸡块）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - Chicken Chunks', 'str_pl': 'MREs - Chicken
#. Chunks'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"A 'Meal Ready to Eat' with a chicken chunk entree and everything a hungry "
"soldier needs.  The contents are individually packed and will remain sealed "
"after you open this box.  Activate or disassemble it to get to its contents."
"  This one tastes good, if not a bit bland."
msgstr ""
"一份 MRE "
"军用口粮包，包括一份炸鸡块风味的主菜和饥饿士兵所需要的其他一切东西。内容物是单独包装的，打开外盒后仍会保持密封。激活或拆解它以获得其内容物。这一款味道不错，虽然稍微有点寡淡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "MRE - Beef Taco"
msgid_plural "MREs - Beef Taco"
msgstr[0] "MRE（墨西哥牛肉卷）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MRE - Beef Taco', 'str_pl': 'MREs - Beef Taco'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"A 'Meal Ready to Eat' with a beef taco entree and everything a hungry "
"soldier needs.  The contents are individually packed and will remain sealed "
"after you open this box.  Activate or disassemble it to get to its contents."
"  This one tastes good, but the flavors are a bit off."
