msgstr "一份将火腿切片夹在面包之中的三明治，不是特别好吃但分量很足。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "peanut butter sandwich"
msgid_plural "peanut butter sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "花生酱三明治"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'peanut butter sandwich', 'str_pl': 'peanut
#. butter sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"Some peanut butter smothered between two pieces of bread.  Not very filling "
"and will stick to the roof of your mouth like glue."
msgstr "一份将花生酱夹在两片面包之中的三明治，分量不大，花生酱让口感变得很粘。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "PB&J sandwich"
msgid_plural "PB&J sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "花生酱果酱三明治"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PB&J sandwich', 'str_pl': 'PB&J sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"A delicious peanut butter and jelly sandwich.  It reminds you of the times "
"your mother would make you lunch."
msgstr "一个美味的花生酱果酱三明治，它让你会想起母亲为你准备午餐的时光。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "PB&H sandwich"
msgid_plural "PB&H sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "花生酱蜂蜜三明治"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PB&H sandwich', 'str_pl': 'PB&H sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"Some damned fool put honey on this peanut butter sandwich, who in their "
"right mind- oh wait this is pretty good."
msgstr ""
"一份将蜂蜜涂抹在花生酱三明治，简单的加工却让本身单调的花生酱变得美味起来。\n"
"\"哪个傻瓜把蜂蜜抹在花生酱三明治上面……等等，尝起来还不错。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "PB&M sandwich"
msgid_plural "PB&M sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "花生酱枫糖三明治"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PB&M sandwich', 'str_pl': 'PB&M sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"Who knew you could mix maple syrup and peanut butter to create yet another "
"different sandwich?"
msgstr "一个将枫糖浆和花生黄油混合创造出的全新口味三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
