msgid "cream pie"
msgid_plural "cream pies"
msgstr[0] "奶油派"

#. ~ Description for cream pie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A delicious baked pie filled with a white, thick cream."
msgstr ""
"一款美味的烘焙派，内馅是白色、浓稠的奶油。\n"
"\"讨厌～你在想色色的事情对吧？\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "cheese pizza"
msgid_plural "cheese pizzas"
msgstr[0] "奶酪披萨"

#. ~ Description for cheese pizza
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A delicious pizza with molten cheese on top."
msgstr ""
"一份铺满融化奶酪的美味披萨。\n"
"\"纯粹浓郁的幸福滋味。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "granola"
msgid_plural "granola"
msgstr[0] "格兰诺拉燕麦卷"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'granola'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A tasty and nutritious mixture of oats, honey, and other ingredients that "
"has been baked until crisp."
msgstr "一份由燕麦片、蜂蜜和其他原料制成的燕麦卷，烘烤至香脆可口，美味且营养丰富。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "maple pie"
msgid_plural "maple pies"
msgstr[0] "枫糖馅饼"

#. ~ Description for maple pie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A sweet and delicious baked pie with pure maple syrup."
msgstr "一块香甜可口的馅饼派，加了纯净的枫树糖浆烘烤制成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "fast noodles"
msgid_plural "fast noodles"
msgstr[0] "方便面"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fast noodles'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "So-called ramen noodles.  Can be eaten raw."
msgstr "一份方便面，是种可在短时间之内用热水泡熟食用的面制食物，亦可直接食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "cloutie dumpling"
msgid_plural "cloutie dumplings"
msgstr[0] "魔鬼布丁"

#. ~ Description for cloutie dumpling
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"This traditional Scottish treat is a sweet and filling little boiled cake "
"studded with dried fruit."
msgstr "一个传统苏格兰甜点，嵌入很多干果的大蛋糕。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "brioche"
msgid_plural "brioches"
msgstr[0] "法式奶油面包卷"

#. ~ Description for brioche
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Filling bread buns, taste good with tea on a Sunday morning breakfast."
msgstr ""
"一个介于甜点和面包之间的法式面点，用大量鸡蛋和黄油制成，外皮金黄酥脆，内部超级柔软，口感极佳，入口即化。\n"
"\"吃不起面包，就吃蛋糕呗！——玛丽·安东尼特 皇后\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "sponge cake"
msgid_plural "sponge cakes"
msgstr[0] "松蛋糕"

#. ~ Description for sponge cake
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Plain, fluffy cake for the proletariat."
msgstr "为无产阶级准备的普通松软的蛋糕。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "space cake"
msgid_plural "space cakes"
msgstr[0] "太空蛋糕"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for space cake.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"You start scarfing down the delicious cake.  It tastes a little funny "
"though…"
msgstr "你开始大口吞咽这美味的蛋糕。不过尝起来有点奇怪……"

#. ~ Description for space cake
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "This cake's destiny is to take you on a gnarly trip."
msgstr "这块\"叶子\"味的蛋糕会伴随你渡过艰苦的旅途。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "brownie"
msgid_plural "brownies"
msgstr[0] "布朗尼蛋糕"

#. ~ Description for brownie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A rich chocolate brownie, just like how grandma used to bake them."
msgstr ""
"一份包括坚果、霜状白糖、生奶油、巧克力的蛋糕，发源于19世纪末的美国。\n"
"\"这个和外婆做的完全一样。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "'special' brownie"
msgid_plural "'special' brownies"
msgstr[0] "特制布朗尼蛋糕"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': "'special' brownie"}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"You start scarfing down the delicious brownie.  It tastes a little funny "
"though…"
msgstr "你开始大口吞咽这美味的布朗尼蛋糕。不过尝起来有点奇怪……"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "'special' brownie"}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "This is definitely not how grandma used to bake them."
msgstr ""
"一份包括坚果、霜状白糖、生奶油、巧克力的蛋糕，发源于19世纪末的美国。\n"
"\"这个和外婆做的完全不一样。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "kimchimari guksu"
msgid_plural "kimchimari guksu"
msgstr[0] "韩式泡菜冷面"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'kimchimari guksu'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Noodles served chilled with kimchi.  The cold but spicy flavor brings a "
"unique refreshment."
msgstr "配有泡菜的冷面，冰凉中带有辛辣风味，带来独特的清爽体验。"

