msgid ""
"A long wooden pole with electric chainsaws impractically attached to both "
"ends.  The product of either genius or insanity, but not both; the weight "
"ensures that only someone both strong and very skilled could possibly hope "
"to use it."
msgstr "一根长棍两端各绑着一把电动链锯。发明这武器的人不是天才就是疯子；它的重量决定了只有身强力壮且技艺精湛的战士才能把它玩转。"

