msgstr[0] "燃气涡轮发动机（1900马力）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '1900 hp gas turbine engine'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engine.json
msgid ""
"A large gas turbine engine, usually used for military helicopters.  Known "
"for its high rate of fuel consumption, but installing multiple turbines will"
" not affect vehicle power."
msgstr "一种大型燃气涡轮发动机，通常用于军用直升机。以耗油率高而闻名，但安装多个涡轮不会影响车辆的动力。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engine.json
msgid "6000 hp gas turbine engine"
msgid_plural "6000 hp gas turbine engines"
msgstr[0] "燃气涡轮发动机（6000马力）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '6000 hp gas turbine engine'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engine.json
msgid ""
"A massive gas turbine engine, used to power the V-22 Osprey.  Known for its "
"high rate of fuel consumption, but installing multiple turbines will not "
"affect vehicle power."
msgstr "一种大型的燃气涡轮发动机，用于为V-22鱼鹰提供动力。以耗油率高而闻名，但安装多个涡轮不会影响车辆的动力。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid "steel boom crane"
msgid_plural "steel boom cranes"
msgstr[0] "钢制吊臂起重机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steel boom crane'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A large rigid steel boom.  If attached to a frame it could be used to lift "
"up to 20 metric tonnes (or a bit over 44,000 pounds)."
msgstr "一个巨大而坚固的钢吊杆。如果安装在框架上，可用于举起重达20公吨（略超44000磅）的物体。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid "telescopic cantilever crane"
msgid_plural "telescopic cantilever cranes"
msgstr[0] "可伸缩吊臂起重机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'telescopic cantilever crane'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A small steel telescoping cantilever.  If attached to a frame it could be "
"used to lift up to 3.5 metric tonnes (or a bit over 7,700 pounds)."
msgstr "一根小型钢制伸缩悬臂。如果安装在框架上，可用于举起重达3.5公吨（略超7700磅）的物体。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "pallet lifter"
msgid_plural "pallet lifters"
msgstr[0] "托盘升降机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet lifter'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift pallet lifter.  If attached to a frame it could be used to lift "
"up to 0.5 metric tonnes (or a bit over 1,100 pounds)."
msgstr "一個粗製的托盤升降機。如果安装在框架上，可用于举起重达0.5公吨（略超1100磅）的物体。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "rockwheel"
msgid_plural "rockwheels"
msgstr[0] "铣挖机"

