#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid "A large and heavy jagged metal disc to dig trenches."
msgstr "一个用于挖掘壕沟的巨大而沉重的锯齿状金属盘。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid "airjack"
msgid_plural "airjacks"
msgstr[0] "充气千斤顶"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'airjack'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid ""
"An extendable metal pylon used to replace a portable jack.  If mounted to a "
"vehicle, it could be used to lift it up, supporting vehicles up to 8.5 "
"metric tonnes (or a bit over 18,700 pounds)."
msgstr "一种用于替代便携式千斤顶的可伸缩金属支柱。若安装在车辆上，可用于将车辆顶起，最大承重可达 8.5 公吨（约 18,700 磅）。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "motorcycle kickstand"
msgid_plural "motorcycle kickstands"
msgstr[0] "摩托车支架"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'motorcycle kickstand'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A kickstand to keep the bike from falling over.  You could use this to lean "
"it forward or backward to change a tire, supporting vehicles up to 0.5 "
"metric tonnes (or a bit over 1,100 pounds)."
msgstr "一种防止自行车翻倒的脚撑。你可以用它将车辆前倾或后倾以便更换轮胎，最大承重可达 0.5 公吨（约 1,100 磅）。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid "rope and pulley crane"
msgid_plural "rope and pulley cranes"
msgstr[0] "绳索滑轮起重机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rope and pulley crane'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift crane made from rope and pulleys.  If attached to a frame it "
"could be used to lift up to 2 metric tonnes (or a bit over 4,400 pounds)."
msgstr "一个由绳索和滑轮制成的简易起重机。如果安装在框架上，可用于举起重达2公吨（略超4400磅）的物体。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
msgid "vehicle scoop"
msgid_plural "vehicle scoops"
msgstr[0] "车铲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vehicle scoop'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
msgid ""
"An assembly of motors and sheet metal that allows a vehicle to clean the "
"road surface by removing debris and contaminants."
msgstr "由引擎和大块金属组装而成，能够允许车辆清除道路上的废墟及各类污染物。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "seed drill"
msgid_plural "seed drills"
msgstr[0] "播种机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'seed drill'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
msgid ""
"An assembly of tubes, spikes, and wheels, that when dragged along the "
"ground, allows a vehicle to plant seeds automatically in suitably tilled "
"land."
msgstr "由各类管道，尖刺，和轮胎组装而成。当被拖行时，能够允许车辆自动在已经耕种的土壤上播种。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/farming.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "reaper"
msgid_plural "reapers"
msgstr[0] "收割机"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reaper'}
