#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "signal tree emission"
msgstr "信标树发射"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'signal tree emission'}
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid ""
"Line attack that deals no damage but leaves behind lingering dazzler fields."
"  Side effect heals any leech blossoms or leech stalks near the target."
msgstr "一种攻击行动，不造成伤害，但会留下持续的迷眩领域。副作用是治愈目标附近的任何寄生花或寄生茎。"

#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "signal tree emission healing"
msgstr "信标树治愈发射"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'signal tree emission healing'}
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "This effect heals appropriate leech plants currently near the target."
msgstr "该效果会治愈目标附近的适当寄生植物。"

