msgstr "正在孵化的寄生蜂幼虫逃离宿主。"

#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Summon Centipede"
msgstr "召唤蜈蚣"

#. ~ Description for Summon Centipede
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Summons a small, pissed off centipede."
msgstr "召唤一个愤怒的小蜈蚣。"

