#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'green sunfish'}
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A green sunfish.  A small fish related to bass or bluegill."
msgstr "一条蓝太阳鱼。一种跟鲈鱼或者蓝鳃太阳鱼关系较近的小鱼。"

#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
