#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Whew… smells like skunk!"
msgstr "哇哦……闻起来像臭鼬！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Man, that smells like some good shit!"
msgstr "伙计，那玩意闻起来真棒！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Is that marijuana you're smoking?"
msgstr "你那抽的是大麻吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hey, don't bogart the joint!"
msgstr "嘿，大麻！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "C'mon, <name_g>, I can smell it, pass it over."
msgstr "快点，<name_g>，我能闻到，递点过来。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Wow, that smell takes me back."
msgstr "哇，这味道让我回忆起过去。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Ah, man.  Good times, good times.  Love that scent."
msgstr "啊，伙计。这让我想起了往日的好时光，我喜欢那香味。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "What do I smell?  Well, I guess it's legal now."
msgstr "我闻到什么味道？嗯，我想如今这是合法的了。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Mmm, that weed smells good."
msgstr "嗯，那叶子闻起来很香。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Man, I can smell the weed, can I have some?"
msgstr "老铁，我能闻到叶子的味道。能给我一些吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Are you sure it's a good idea to smoke that now?"
msgstr "你确定现在是抽那玩意的时候吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Is that the devil's lettuce I smell?"
msgstr "那不是叶子的味道吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I don't know… should you really be smoking that stuff?"
msgstr "我不知道……你真的应该抽那玩意么？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "<name_g>, that's going to ruin your nose."
msgstr "<name_g>，那东西会毁了你的鼻子。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Man, that stinks.  Put it out!"
msgstr "兄弟，难闻死了，赶紧灭了！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "You're going to kill yourself smoking that stuff, <name_g>."
msgstr "你吸那玩意就是自杀，<name_g>。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Oh, wow, that smell…  Can I have some?"
msgstr "啊，天啊，这味道……能给我一些吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I smell heresy."
msgstr "我闻到了异端的味道。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Seriously?  You're smoking that?"
msgstr "讲真？你抽那玩意儿？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Well that's one way to guarantee the zombies don't kill you."
msgstr "好吧，这也算是确保自己不被丧尸杀死的一种方式。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Come on <name_g>, you're better than this."
msgstr "我说<name_g>，你可以不用这样的。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Ew, smells like burning rubber!"
msgstr "呃，闻着就像是橡胶烧着了。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Ugh, that smells rancid!"
msgstr "啊，闻着一股子霉味。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Why are you smoking crack cocaine?"
msgstr "你为什么要抽快客可卡因？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "<meth_smoke>"
msgstr "<meth_smoke>"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I need some batteries to power my CBMs."
msgstr "我需要一些电池来驱动我的生化插件。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I can't recharge my CBMs without some batteries."
msgstr "没有电池我就不能给我的生化插件充电。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>, can I get some batteries here?  I need to recharge."
msgstr "嘿，<name_g>，能给我拿些电池吗？我需要给自己充电。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Internal batteries running low.  How many batteries can you spare right now?"
msgstr "我的生化能量快耗尽了。你现在还有多少能用的电池？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I can do a lot more for you if you pass me a couple batteries to recharge."
msgstr "如果给我些电池充能的话，我能帮更多的忙。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"All these implants I got are going to turn to useless scrap real soon if I "
"don't get some batteries to recharge."
msgstr "如果我不能尽快拿到些电池充能的话，这些生化插件很快就要变成一堆没用的金属垃圾了。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Pass some ethanol, I need to power my ethanol burner."
msgstr "来点酒精 ，我需要为我的酒精锅炉充电。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Waiter!  I need a refill, my ethanol burner is running out of charge!"
msgstr "服务员！我需要续杯，我的酒精锅炉快空了！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I require ethanol for my internal power supply.  Anything on you?"
msgstr "我需要一些酒精来给我的生化插件供能。你身上有吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Got any alcohol to spare?  Need to recharge my drives.  Methanol, would do."
msgstr "你有多余的酒吗？我需要给我的生化插件充能。实在不行甲醇也行。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I need some junk to power my internal furnace."
msgstr "给我些没用的东西，我要用来给我的内燃锅炉发电。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I can't recharge my CBMs without some firewood for my internal furnace."
msgstr "没有燃料我就不能给我的生化插件充电，因为我的内燃锅炉需要燃料。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I need something to use as fuel for my furnace."
msgstr "我需要一些东西作为我的炉子的燃料。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Hey, <name_g>, can I get some waste paper or withered plants?  I need to "
"recharge."
msgstr "嘿，<name_g>，能给我拿些废纸或者枯萎植物吗？我需要充能。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I need some fuel to power my bionics."
msgstr "我需要一些燃料来驱动我的生化插件。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I can't recharge my CBMs without some fuel."
msgstr "没有燃料我无法给我的生化插件充能。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>, can I get some fuel?  I need to recharge."
msgstr "嘿，<name_g>，能给我些燃料吗？我需要充能。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I can't believe I'm saying this, but I need radioactive plutonium slurry for"
" my internal reactor."
msgstr "我不敢相信我会这么说，但我需要放射性钚浆用于我的内置反应堆。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I can't use my internal reactor to recharge my CBMs without some plutonium "
"slurry."
msgstr "如果没有钚浆，我就不能用我的内置反应堆给我的CBM充电。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Hey, <name_g>, pass me some plutonium slurry if you have any, I need to "
"refuel my internal reactor."
msgstr "嘿，<name_g>，如果你有钚浆，请给我一些，我需要补充反应堆。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Beta radiation can be blocked by clothing, but is really dangerous if you "
"ingest it.  So can I have some plutonium slurry to power my reactor and give"
" me cancer?"
msgstr "β射线可以被衣服阻挡，但如果进入消化系统，则相当危险。好了，现在我能要些给反应堆供能且让我得癌症的钚浆吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I need some radioactive slurry to power my reactor.  Or a less dangerous "
"power source, that would be even better!"
msgstr "我需要一些放射性钚浆来给我的反应堆供电。或者给我换个不那么危险的供能方式，那就更好了！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Please, <name_g>, get me some radioactive slurry to fuel my internal "
"reactor.  Or get me another way to recharge my CBMs!"
msgstr "<name_g>，请给我一些用来补充反应堆的放射性液体，或者给我换种CBM充能方式就行！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I can't use my internal reactor to recharge my CBMs without some plutonium "
"slurry.  Which wouldn't be a problem if I had anything else that would "
"recharge my CBMs!"
msgstr "没有钚浆，就不能用我的内部反应堆给我的CBM充电。如果我还有其他东西可以给我的CBM充电，那就不成问题了！"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I sure could use a highly radioactive slurry shake for my power supply right"
" now."
msgstr "我现在需要一些高放射性的钚浆来给我补充生化能量。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Tell me about how you survived the Cataclysm."
msgstr "和我说说你是怎么在大灾变中幸存下来的。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "How did you survive the Cataclysm?"
msgstr "你是如何在大灾变中幸存下来的？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "What was the Cataclysm like for you?"
msgstr "对你来说大灾变是什么样的？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "How did you make it through the initial chaos?"
msgstr "你是怎么度过最初的混乱的？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Tell me how you survived the initial wave of the Cataclysm."
msgstr "和我说说你是如何在大灾难的最初阶段幸存下来的。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Was it rough surviving thus far?"
msgstr "活到现在是不是非常艰难？"

