#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/json/obsoletion/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "quantum solar panel"
msgid_plural "quantum solar panels"
msgstr[0] "太阳能板（超能）"

#. ~ Description for quantum solar panel
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"This solar panel is obviously cutting-edge technology and given where you "
"found it, should probably provide a LOT of power.  It's covered in strange-"
"looking material, but the covering looks rather fragile; it doesn't look "
"like it could support a reinforcing sheet, either."
msgstr "这种太阳能电池板是尖端技术的产物，拥有极高的光电转换效能。但是它表面覆盖特殊材料让它非常脆弱，同时也无法进行强化加固。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "quantum solar backpack (folded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (folded)"
msgstr[0] "超能太阳能背包（折叠）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'quantum solar backpack (folded)', 'str_pl':
#. 'quantum solar backpacks (folded)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Personal portable charging system consisting of an array of quantum solar "
"panels neatly folded in a form of a large backpack.  It can be worn as one, "
"and has an integrated cable to plug it into a cable charger system.  Cutting"
" edge technology."
msgstr ""
"一套个人便携式充能系统，由一系列超能太阳能电池板组成，都被整齐地折叠并装入一个大背包。它可以一体式穿着在身上，并且集成了一条可插入电缆充电器的电缆。最新尖端科技。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "quantum solar backpack (unfolded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (unfolded)"
msgstr[0] "超能太阳能背包（展开）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'quantum solar backpack (unfolded)', 'str_pl':
#. 'quantum solar backpacks (unfolded)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Unfolded array of portable quantum solar panels ready to push some power "
"into an active cable charger system."
msgstr "一套已经展开的便携式超能太阳能电池板阵列，准备好为电缆充电器提供能量。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "fitness band"
msgid_plural "fitness bands"
msgstr[0] "健身手环"

#. ~ Description for fitness band
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A fitness band that can track your heartbeat, exercise level and also has a "
"clock.  Activate to see your metrics."
msgstr "一个健身手环，可以记录你的心跳，运动水平，内置一个时钟。激活以查看自身的健康运动指标。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "recurve bow"
msgid_plural "recurve bows"
msgstr[0] "现代反曲弓"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A modern bow that curves away from the archer at the tips for increased "
"power, which can be used effectively by those of somewhat above-average "
"strength.  Good and easy to use, but nothing special."
msgstr "一把现代反曲弓，弓身末端反向弯曲远离射手以增加威力，在较为强壮的射手手中十分好用。使用起来方便简单，但也没啥特殊功能。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "reflex bow"
msgid_plural "reflex bows"
msgstr[0] "反曲弓"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A bow with limbs that curve away from the archer near the riser for power.  "
"Smaller than some bows, but decently powerful and quick."
msgstr "一把弓，弓身中段反向弯曲远离射手以增加威力。体型比一般的弓要小，但威力和射速都很棒。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "hybrid longbow"
msgid_plural "hybrid longbows"
msgstr[0] "混合型长弓"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A modernized, six-foot longbow that curves away from the archer at the tips "
"for increased power.  It can be used effectively by those of somewhat above-"
"average strength.  Designed for archers that appreciate the smoothness of a "
"traditional longbow, but desire the superior power of a modern recurve."
msgstr ""
"一把六英尺长的现代弓，弓身末端反向弯曲远离射手以增加威力，在较为强壮的人的手上十分好用。这把弓是为那些欣赏传统长弓射击流畅度却又渴望现代反曲弓的射击威力的射手们设计的。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "reflex recurve bow"
msgid_plural "reflex recurve bows"
msgstr[0] "硬反曲弓"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A modernized bow that combines the traits from both the reflex and the "
"recurve bows, with both limbs and tips curving away from the archer, and "
"reinforced with composite materials.  This dramatically increases the power "
"and requires significant strength to draw the bow effectively, but can still"
" be fired quickly."
msgstr ""
"一把现代弓，同时结合了古典反曲弓和现代反曲弓特点，弓身中段及两端反向弯曲远离射手，并采用复合材料增强弓身。这极大提高了弓箭的威力，但需要十分高的力量才能够拉开弓，同时射速并无任何损失。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "glass plate"
msgid_plural "glass plates"
msgstr[0] "玻璃餐碟"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glass plate'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A glass dinner plate, for people who don't have clumsy children."
msgstr "玻璃餐盘，适合没有笨拙孩子的人。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic plate"
msgid_plural "plastic plates"
msgstr[0] "塑料盘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic plate'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A durable plastic plate, the sort you might use as patio dishware."
msgstr "耐用的塑料盘，你可以用这类东西作庭院餐具。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "fork"
msgid_plural "forks"
msgstr[0] "叉子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fork'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A fork, if you stab something with it, you eat it right away.  Wait… "
"nevermind."
msgstr "一把叉子，叉了东西之后就可以送进嘴里。等等……现在这么说好像不太对。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "spoon"
msgid_plural "spoons"
msgstr[0] "勺子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spoon'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Do not try to bend the spoon.  That is impossible."
msgstr ""
"一个喝汤盛饭所用的用餐工具。\n"
"\"试图用念力折弯它是不可能的。\""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "butter knife"
msgid_plural "butter knives"
msgstr[0] "黄油刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'butter knife', 'str_pl': 'butter knives'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A dull knife, absolutely worthless in combat.  Excellent for spreading soft "
"things on bread."
msgstr "一把钝刀，在战斗中绝对毫无价值。非常适合在面包上涂抹柔软的东西。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "corkscrew"
msgid_plural "corkscrews"
msgstr[0] "开瓶钻"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'corkscrew'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Many a pleasant date has been ruined by forgetting this important tool."
msgstr "很多愉快的约会败兴而归，只因为忘了这个重要工具。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "bottle opener"
msgid_plural "bottle openers"
msgstr[0] "开瓶器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bottle opener'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A simple lever for popping open bottles."
msgstr "一个简单的杠杆，用来撬开瓶子。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This bottle opener is shaped like a zombie head, the mouth pops open the "
"bottle."
msgstr "这支开瓶起子被塑得像个丧尸头，嘴巴用来起瓶盖。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This bottle opener is shaped like a lightsaber."
msgstr "这个开瓶器的形状像一把光剑。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This bottle opener is shaped like a revolver."
msgstr "这个开瓶器的形状像一把左轮手枪。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This bottle opener is engraved with the words 'I'll die before I give you my"
" beer'."
msgstr "这个开瓶器刻有“我会在给你啤酒之前就死了”的字样。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This bottle opener is emblazoned with a logo for an HVAC contracting "
"company."
msgstr "这个开瓶器上印有HVAC承包公司的标识。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This bottle opener reads 'Corporate Team Building Exercise 1999'."
msgstr "这个开瓶器写着“1999年公司团建活动留念”。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This bottle opener reads 'I'd rather be drinking whiskey'."
msgstr "这个开瓶器上写着“我宁愿喝威士忌”。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This bottle opener is shaped like a phaser."
msgstr "这个开瓶器的形状像相位枪。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This novelty bottle opener is designed to look like a hobo clown."
msgstr "这把新奇的开瓶器设计得像个流浪汉小丑。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "vegetable peeler"
msgid_plural "vegetable peelers"
msgstr[0] "蔬果削皮器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vegetable peeler'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple tool for peeling the outer skin off fruit and veggies "
"without stabbing yourself."
msgstr "这是个简单的工具，可以削掉蔬果外皮而不刺伤自己。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "spork"
msgid_plural "sporks"
msgstr[0] "叉勺"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spork'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"The bastardized hybrid of a spoon and fork, with all the power and "
"capabilities of both in a more annoying to use package."
msgstr "勺子和叉子的怪异混合体，同时有着两者的功能，但是用起来更加烦人。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "foon"
msgid_plural "foons"
msgstr[0] "餐叉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'foon'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Clearly the superior instrument.  Sporks are just imitators."
msgstr ""
"一个西方国家之中常见的餐具，叉子一端可手握，另一端有二至四条分支，用来插入或盛住食物。\n"
"\"贵人用餐叉，穷蛋用叉勺。\""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "chopsticks"
msgid_plural "pairs of chopsticks"
msgstr[0] "筷子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chopsticks', 'str_pl': 'pairs of chopsticks'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"One of the most popular eating utensils in the world.  Does double duty as a"
" way of dealing with especially fragile vampires."
msgstr "世界上最受欢迎的餐具之一。另一个功能是用来对付特别脆弱的吸血鬼。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "ladle"
msgid_plural "ladles"
msgstr[0] "长柄勺"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ladle'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "When you need to scoop some soup, this is the utensil for you."
msgstr "当你需要舀一些汤时，用这个就行了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "whisk"
msgid_plural "whisks"
msgstr[0] "打蛋器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'whisk'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Also known as a 'wire whip', this is a less effective weapon than it sounds."
msgstr "也被称为\"钢丝鞭\"，当武器用起来可不想听上去那么有效。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "potato masher"
msgid_plural "potato mashers"
msgstr[0] "马铃薯搅碎器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'potato masher'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This tool can mash potatoes and soft root vegetables; it cannot do the "
"twist."
msgstr "这个工具可以捣碎土豆和软根蔬菜；它不能用来搅拌。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "garlic press"
msgid_plural "garlic presses"
msgstr[0] "压蒜器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'garlic press', 'str_pl': 'garlic presses'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This tool can squash a clove or two of garlic into a fine paste."
msgstr "这个工具可以将一两瓣大蒜压成细小的糊状物。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "can opener"
msgid_plural "can openers"
msgstr[0] "开罐器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'can opener'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "It's not hard to open cans without this, but it's way messier."
msgstr "没有这个也不是说就打不开罐头了，但是会弄得一团糟。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "carving fork"
msgid_plural "carving forks"
msgstr[0] "肉叉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carving fork'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"It's like a tiny pitchfork, or a very large dinner fork.  You use it to hold"
" meat still while you slice it."
msgstr "它就像一个小干草叉，或一个非常大的餐叉。你切肉片时用它来固定住盘子里的肉。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "spatula"
msgid_plural "spatulas"
msgstr[0] "抹刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spatula'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A rubber scraper for making sure you get every last scrap of cookie dough."
msgstr "一把橡胶刮刀，保证你能刮下来每一点面团。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "mesh colander"
msgid_plural "mesh colanders"
msgstr[0] "滤网"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mesh colander'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel mesh colander, for washing rice, vegetables or straining "
"liquid off from noodles or other foods."
msgstr "一个不锈钢滤网，可以用来淘米，洗菜，或者滤掉面条之类东西里的水。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "splatter guard"
msgid_plural "splatter guards"
msgstr[0] "防油溅网"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'splatter guard'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel mesh screen for preventing flying oil from getting all "
"over your nice counters (or you) when frying."
msgstr "一个用来在炒菜时防止溅油的不锈钢网，你再也不用担心你的崭新柜台（或者你自己）被油溅到了！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "cutting board"
msgid_plural "cutting boards"
msgstr[0] "砧板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cutting board'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A large flat piece of wood for chopping vegetables on without ruining your "
"knife or your countertop."
msgstr "一块大块扁平的木头，用于切碎蔬菜而不会毁坏你的刀子或台面。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "meal tray"
msgid_plural "meal trays"
msgstr[0] "供餐托盘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'meal tray'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel tray used for serving food in cafeterias, mess halls, or "
"similar places."
msgstr "不锈钢托盘，用于在自助餐厅，食堂或类似场所中提供食物。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic fork"
msgid_plural "plastic forks"
msgstr[0] "塑料叉子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic fork'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A plastic disposable fork.  Great for picnic lunches in the post apocalyptic"
" wasteland."
msgstr "塑料一次性叉子。非常适合后世界末日荒地的野餐午餐。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic spoon"
msgid_plural "plastic spoons"
msgstr[0] "塑料勺子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic spoon'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A plastic disposable spoon.  Easier to bend than the metal variety."
msgstr "塑料一次性勺子。比金属品更容易弯曲。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "kiddie spoon"
msgid_plural "kiddie spoons"
msgstr[0] "儿童勺子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kiddie spoon'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A plastic spoon designed for use by children."
msgstr "专为儿童使用的塑料勺子。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This spoon is striped in bright primary colors."
msgstr "这款勺子采用明亮的原色条纹。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This spoon is styled to look like a bulldozer."
msgstr "这把勺子的样式看起来像推土机。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This spoon is covered in cartoon dogs and a logo that reads 'Paw Patrol'."
msgstr "这把勺子上覆盖着卡通狗和标有“Paw Patrol”的标志。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "There is a cute cartoon bear on the handle of this spoon."
msgstr "这把勺子的手柄上有一个可爱的卡通熊。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "There are cartoon cats all over this spoon."
msgstr "这个勺子到处都是卡通猫的图案。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This spoon has a silhouette of a giraffe going down the handle."
msgstr "这把勺子的柄上有长颈鹿的轮廓。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic knife"
msgid_plural "plastic knives"
msgstr[0] "塑料小刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic knife', 'str_pl': 'plastic knives'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A plastic butter knife.  It's actually a bit sharper than its metal "
"counterpart, but that doesn't make it any more effective as a weapon."
msgstr "塑料黄油刀。它实际上比它的金属对应物更锐利，但这并不能使它作为武器更有效。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic straw"
msgid_plural "plastic straws"
msgstr[0] "塑料吸管"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic straw'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A plastic straw, for drinking things and making litter"
msgstr ""
"塑料吸管，用于喝饮料以及变成干垃圾。\n"
"\"也许还是可回收垃圾？\""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "rolling pin"
msgid_plural "rolling pins"
msgstr[0] "擀面杖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rolling pin'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A stout piece of hardwood, turned and sanded smooth, with rounded handles at"
" the ends.  This timeless kitchen tool also doubles as a very effective "
"club."
msgstr "坚硬的硬木，转动和打磨光滑，两端带圆形手柄。这款永不过时的厨房工具也是一款非常有效的棍棒。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "badminton shuttlecock"
msgid_plural "shuttlecocks"
msgstr[0] "羽毛球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'badminton shuttlecock', 'str_pl':
#. 'shuttlecocks'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A high-drag projectile used in the sport of badminton."
msgstr "一个羽毛球比赛中使用的高阻力羽毛球。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "golf tee"
msgid_plural "golf tees"
msgstr[0] "高尔夫球座"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'golf tee'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A pin shaped piece of wood meant for holding a golf ball slightly off the "
"ground."
msgstr "一根木头制成的大头针形状的杆子，用于将高尔夫球固定托起得略高于地面。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "golf ball"
msgid_plural "golf balls"
msgstr[0] "高尔夫球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'golf ball'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A small ball with round indentations on it."
msgstr "一个表面上有很多圆形凹痕的小球。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "pool ball"
msgid_plural "pool balls"
msgstr[0] "台球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pool ball'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A colorful, hard ball.  Essentially a rock."
msgstr ""
"一颗色彩缤纷的英式斯诺克台球。\n"
"\"投出一记漂亮的Break Shot（台球术语）。\""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "bowling ball"
msgid_plural "bowling balls"
msgstr[0] "保龄球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bowling ball'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy ball.  Before the apocalypse, its main purpose was to be "
"rolled along waxed floors."
msgstr "一个又大又重球。大灾变之前，它的主要目的是给地板上砸坑。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "baseball"
msgid_plural "baseballs"
msgstr[0] "棒球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'baseball'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A baseball, good for throwing at enemies.  Getting hit with one of these "
"hurts a lot more than you might think."
msgstr "一个普通的棒球，可以将其掷出，如果击中的话威力超乎你的想象。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "football"
msgid_plural "footballs"
msgstr[0] "美式橄榄球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'football'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"An oval made of leather and string, it's easily thrown but does little "
"damage.  You could take it apart into leather if you wanted."
msgstr "用皮革和线制成的球，很容易扔出去，但伤害不大。需要的话，能拆出一块块的皮革。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "basketball"
msgid_plural "basketballs"
msgstr[0] "篮球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'basketball'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A high-quality indoor basketball.  You may throw it at zombies."
msgstr "一只高品质室内用篮球。用来送丧尸们球饼。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "volleyball"
msgid_plural "volleyballs"
msgstr[0] "排球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'volleyball'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A standard regulation volleyball."
msgstr "一个符合标准规则的排球。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "beach volleyball"
msgid_plural "volleyballs"
msgstr[0] "排球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'beach volleyball', 'str_pl': 'volleyballs'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A brightly colored beach volleyball.  It is slightly larger than a regular "
"white one."
msgstr "一个色彩鲜艳的沙滩排球。它比标准规则所使用的白色排球稍微大一些。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "hockey puck"
msgid_plural "hockey pucks"
msgstr[0] "曲棍球"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hockey puck'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy circular block of solid rubber, normally used for playing hockey.  "
"You can throw it to cause some serious harm."
msgstr "用固体橡胶制成的沉重的球状物，通常用于玩曲棍球。投掷它能造成严重的伤害。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "score card"
msgid_plural "score cards"
msgstr[0] "记分卡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'score card'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A colorfully printed score card."
msgstr "彩色印刷的记分卡。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic stopcock"
msgid_plural "plastic stopcocks"
msgstr[0] "塑料阀门"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic stopcock'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Stop giggling.  This is a tiny plastic valve, get your mind out of the "
"gutter."
msgstr ""
"这是一个很小的塑料阀门，能排空你脑子里的水。\n"
"\"别傻笑了。\""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "empty ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "empty ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "防弹背心（空）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'empty ballistic vest'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Ballistic armor without any armor inserts.  The soft armor plate carrier is "
"still protective but it won't stop high energy projectiles."
msgstr "没有插入装甲板的防弹背心。软质装甲板袋依旧能够提供少许防护，但它无法阻挡高速子弹。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "ESAPI ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "ESAPI ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "防弹背心（ESAPI）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ESAPI ballistic vest'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Ballistic armor with ESAPI ceramic armor plates."
msgstr "带有ESAPI陶瓷装甲板的防弹衣。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "ESAPI ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "ESAPI ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "ESAPI 防弹板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ESAPI ballistic plate'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A polygonal ceramic ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Its "
"inner surface is coated with Ultra High Molecular Weight Polyethylene, and "
"is labelled \"TOP\", while its outer surface is labelled \"STRIKE FACE\".  "
"This is intended to be worn in a ballistic vest and can withstand several "
"high energy rifle rounds before breaking."
msgstr ""
"一块有轻微凹面的多边形陶瓷防弹板。其内表面涂有超高分子量聚乙烯，并标记为“顶部”，而其外表面则标记为“打击面”。它需要放进防弹背心后穿着使用，在完全破碎之前可以承受几次高能步枪子弹打击。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "ESBI ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "ESBI ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "ESBI 防弹板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ESBI ballistic plate'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A polygonal ceramic ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  "
"\"STRIKE FACE\" is printed on its outer surface.  This is designed to be "
"worn in the sides of a plate carrier and can withstand several high energy "
"rifle rounds before breaking."
msgstr ""
"一块有轻微凹面的多边形陶瓷防弹板。外表面标记着“打击面”的字样。它需要放进防弹背心侧袋后穿着使用，在完全破碎之前可以承受几次高能步枪子弹打击。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "MBR vest (Kevlar plates)"
msgid_plural "MBR vests (Kevlar plates)"
msgstr[0] "MBR防弹背心（凯夫拉板）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MBR vest (Kevlar plates)', 'str_pl': 'MBR vests
#. (Kevlar plates)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A Modular Bullet Resistant Vest.  Kevlar plates have been inserted to "
"improve its protection.  It has four pouches capable of carrying magazines."
msgstr "一件模块化防弹背心，插入了凯夫拉板来进一步增强防护性能。它有着四个能装下弹匣的口袋。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "used heat pack"
msgid_plural "used heat packs"
msgstr[0] "加热贴（已使用）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'used heat pack'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a chemical heat pack.  It's used to treat sports injuries and heat "
"food.  This one has been used and is chemically inert, rendering it useless."
msgstr "一次性加热贴，可以被用来处理伤口或者加热食物，但这个加热贴已经被用过了，现在没用了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "inactive autonomous M249 CROWS II"
msgid_plural "inactive autonomous M249 CROWS II turrets"
msgstr[0] "M249 CROWS II 炮塔（关）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inactive autonomous M249 CROWS II', 'str_pl':
#. 'inactive autonomous M249 CROWS II turrets'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with "
"the factory-loaded 5.56x45mm rounds in your inventory (if you wish to divide"
" your ammunition, set aside whatever 5.56x45mm rounds you do NOT want to "
"give the turret) turning it on, and placing it on the ground, where it will "
"attach itself.  If programmed successfully the turret will then identify you"
" as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its M249."
msgstr ""
"一座未激活的 5.56x45mm 口径机枪炮塔。使用它时将打开它然后放在地上，并装填你物品栏内的原装 5.56x45mm "
"弹药。成功编程放置后的炮塔会将你识别为友方，并采用内置 M249 机枪攻击附近的所有敌人。"

