"This is an inactive turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with "
"the factory-loaded .50 BMG rounds in your inventory (if you wish to divide "
"your ammunition, set aside whatever .50 BMG rounds you do NOT want to give "
"the turret) turning it on, and placing it on the ground, where it will "
