msgid ""
"A heavy hardback book explaining the process of essential oil making, with "
"schematics for the equipment to do it.  Good luck, and don't blow yourself "
"up!"
msgstr "一本沉重的精装书，详细描述了精油的制作过程，并附有设备原理图。祝你好运，别把自己炸了！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "MAS 223 magazine"
msgid_plural "MAS 223 magazines"
msgstr[0] "MAS 223 弹匣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MAS 223 magazine'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A 25-round magazine for the MAS 223.  It resembles a STANAG magazine but is "
"not compatible nor interchangeable."
msgstr "一个 MAS 223 步枪使用的25发弹匣。看上去和 STANAG 北约制式弹匣很像，但是两者互不兼容也无法相互替换。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cooked strawberry', 'str_pl': 'cooked
#. strawberries'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "It's like strawberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "这就像草莓果酱，只是不加糖。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cooked blueberry', 'str_pl': 'cooked
#. blueberries'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "It's like blueberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "这就像蓝莓果酱，只是不加糖。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'washing machine'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A very small washing machine designed for use in vehicles."
msgstr "一台非常小型的车载洗衣机。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dishwasher'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A very small dishwasher designed for use in vehicles."
msgstr "一台非常小型的车载洗碗机。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "multi cooker - cooking"
msgid_plural "multi cooker - cookings"
msgstr[0] "多功能炊具（烹饪中）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'multi cooker - cooking'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A professional-grade multi-cooker, with a battery slot for camping trips or "
"tailgating.  There is a dish in it."
msgstr "一款专业级多功能炊具，带有电池槽，可用于露营旅行或车尾派对。里面有一道菜。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "can of butane"
msgid_plural "cans of butane"
msgstr[0] "丁烷罐"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'can of butane', 'str_pl': 'cans of butane'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A typical can of butane that you would normally use to fill a lighter.  It "
"could be useful as a fuel, but also as a solvent or chemical reagent."
msgstr "一只装满丁烷的金属罐，通常用来填充打火机。它还可以用作燃料，溶剂或化学试剂。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "butane tank"
msgid_plural "tanks of butane"
msgstr[0] "压缩丁烷罐"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'butane tank', 'str_pl': 'tanks of butane'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a tank of liquid compressed butane.  It can be used to extract "
"essential oils from organic material."
msgstr "一大罐液态压缩丁烷。它可以用来从有机物质中提取精油。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "extended toolset"
msgid_plural "extended toolsets"
msgstr[0] "军手扩展"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'extended toolset'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Your toolset, protruding from your hands.  It can slice, dice, and make "
"everything nice."
msgstr "你的掌心工具箱，从你的手上伸出。它能帮助你切、剁，还能做其它的很多事情。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Find a Flu Shot"
msgstr "收集 1 支流感疫苗"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid ""
"The doctor has some ideas on how to recreate a vaccination program for the "
"common flu.  If you come across an unused flu shot please bring it to me.  "
"We haven't had any fatalities from the flu yet but it is only a matter of "
"time until one of the older or younger members of the outpost gets a bad "
"case."
msgstr ""
"这位医生有个制造流感疫苗的计划方案。如果你能够找到一只未使用过的流感疫苗，请带回来给我。虽然目前还没有人因为流感而死亡，但一旦哨站里某个老人或者小孩得了重病的话，流感的大规模爆发不过是时间问题。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have a few that haven't been used."
msgstr "医院和诊所里应该有一些未使用过的。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Do you have the flu shot?"
msgstr "弄到流感疫苗了吗？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "deer mouse"
msgid_plural "deer mouses"
msgstr[0] "田鼠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'deer mouse'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The white-footed mouse, a prolific rodent with a white underbelly and a long"
" fuzzy tail.  A common sight in fields, forests, and research centers."
msgstr "有着毛茸茸尾巴的实验室白老鼠，比普通老鼠长寿。常见于实验室、森林和田地。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "dragonfly"
msgid_plural "dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "蜻蜓"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragonfly', 'str_pl': 'dragonflies'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A thin-bodied insectoid predator with a large wingspan and big compound "
"eyes."
msgstr "昆虫捕食者，具有巨大的苍蝇翅膀和复眼。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "bull frog"
msgid_plural "bull frogs"
msgstr[0] "牛蛙"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bull frog'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The American bullfrog, in its natural habitat.  It feeds on insects, mice, "
"lizards and any other living thing it can stuff down its gullet."
msgstr "美国牛蛙，在自然栖息地生活，他捕食昆虫、老鼠、蜥蜴等，食道可以过滤掉残渣。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "mosquito"
msgid_plural "mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "蚊怪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mosquito'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A blood-sucking fly with a needle-like proboscis.  Its bite leaves behind "
"itchy welts and can easily spread disease."
msgstr "会吸血的怪物，带有针状喙，就像蜂鸟一样，非常容易被伤到，小心它带来的传染病。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "shrew"
msgid_plural "shrews"
msgstr[0] "鼩"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shrew'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The masked shrew, a mouse-like creature with a pointed, whiskery snout.  It "
"digs tunnels into the ground in search of bugs to eat."
msgstr "一种老鼠一样的生物，鼻子很尖，喜欢在地面上挖寻隧道来找虫子吃。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "slug"
msgid_plural "slugs"
msgstr[0] "蛞蝓"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'slug'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The leopard slug, an omnivorous gastropod.  It consumes decaying matter as "
"well as planted crops, and will attack and eat other slugs that cross its "
"path."
msgstr "杂食性的豹纹蛞蝓。它会消化腐烂的物质与农作物，并且会攻击吞食其他挡路的同类。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "jumping spider"
msgid_plural "jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "跳蛛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jumping spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A little spider with elongated forelegs.  It does not build extensive webs, "
"but leaps very quickly, appearing to move instantaneously from one spot to "
"another."
msgstr "拥有发达纤细的前肢的小蜘蛛，移动非常迅速且，可以瞬间从一个地方跳跃到另一个地方。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "螲蟷蛛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'trapdoor spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A midsized spider with a bulbous thorax.  It creates a subterranean nest and"
" lies in wait for prey to draw close enough for capture."
msgstr "一个有着球形胸部的大蜘蛛。它创造了一个地下的巢，并且等待猎物落网，并被困在其网中。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "black widow spider"
msgid_plural "black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "黑寡妇蜘蛛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'black widow spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An infamous spider with a characteristic red hourglass marking on its black "
"carapace, known for its highly toxic bite."
msgstr "一个声名狼藉蜘蛛，壳上有着特征性的红色沙漏。它因它的剧毒毒液而闻名。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "wolf spider"
msgid_plural "wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "狼蛛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wolf spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A fairly large spider which tracks and catches prey through agility and "
"stealth.  Its bite can be irritating even to large animals."
msgstr "相当大的蜘蛛，远远地跟踪着猎物，有着与体型不符的敏捷度，其毒素甚至可以杀死一些大型动物。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wasp'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A slender-bodied flying insect, with a painful sting.  They can be somewhat "
"aggressive if disturbed."
msgstr "一只身体修长的飞行昆虫，尾部有着让人疼痛的刺。如果被打扰了可能变得有攻击性。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M249 autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "M249 CROWS II 炮塔"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M249 autonomous CROWS II'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M249."
msgstr ""
"这是一台M153 CROWS II "
"自主武器系统的升级型号，安装了自主操作软件。在大灾难发生前，美国军方已经部署了数千架辆这种炮塔，它们的价值在于能够在不暴露驾驶员的情况下，在远距离与任何步兵交战。这一台配备了一支"
" M249 机枪。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M240 autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "M240 CROWS II 炮塔"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M240 autonomous CROWS II'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M240."
msgstr ""
"这是一台M153 CROWS II "
"自主武器系统的升级型号，安装了自主操作软件。在大灾难发生前，美国军方已经部署了数千架辆这种炮塔，它们的价值在于能够在不暴露驾驶员的情况下，在远距离与任何步兵交战。这一台配备了一支"
" M240 机枪。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M2HB autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "M2HB CROWS II 炮塔"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M2HB autonomous CROWS II'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" anything up to light vehicles at long range without exposing the operator."
"  This one is fitted with a M2HB."
msgstr ""
"这是一台M153 CROWS II "
"自主武器系统的升级型号，安装了自主操作软件。在大灾难发生前，美国军方已经部署了数千架辆这种炮塔，它们的价值在于能够在不暴露驾驶员的情况下，在远距离与任何轻型车辆交战。这一台配备了一支"
" M2HB 重机枪。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "improvised MP5 turret"
msgid_plural "improvised MP5 turrets"
msgstr[0] "自制 MP5 炮塔"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised MP5 turret'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An MP5 attached to a motorized chassis with basic autonomous software "
"control.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when its magazine is "
"empty and the fire control system is only designed for semi automatic fire."
msgstr ""
"一把MP5冲锋枪被连接在安装了自动瞄准软件的机动式底盘上。但是由于缺少重新上弹的机械装置，所以没法自动重新装填，并且火控系统只能半自动射击。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "replaceable furniture kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable furniture kits"
msgstr[0] "可更换枪具套装"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit consisting of various steel and plastic parts; when installed,"
" it would permanently modify and partially replace some of the weapon's "
"furniture so that it could be easily changed if needed.  This allows "
"installing any kind of more advanced grips or other furniture."
msgstr ""
"这是一个由各种钢和塑料部件组成的套件；安装后，它将永久性地修改和部分替换枪具握把的一些组件，以便在需要时可以很容易地进行更改。这样可以安装任何更高级的握把组件。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "grip mount"
msgstr "握把底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "side mount"
msgid_plural "side mounts"
msgstr[0] "导轨底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a rail accessory, designed to be "
"permanently installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners.  "
"Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr "这是一个塑料支架，用于连接导轨模组，设计能永久安装在几乎任何枪械上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的老式枪械满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "rail mount"
msgstr "导轨底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "sights mount"
msgid_plural "sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "瞄具底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any weapon other than launchers and pistols, along "
"with some fasteners.  Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older "
"guns."
msgstr ""
"这是一个塑料支架，用于安装各种瞄具模组，设计能永久安装在除发射器和手枪以外几乎任何枪械上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的老式枪械满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "launcher sights mount"
msgid_plural "launcher sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "发射器瞄具底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any launcher, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for "
"bringing out your inner tacticool on rocket launchers."
msgstr "这是一个塑料支架，用于安装各种瞄具模组，设计能永久安装在几乎任何发射器上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的火箭发射器满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "pistol sights mount"
msgid_plural "pistol sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "手枪瞄具底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any pistol, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for "
"bringing out your inner tacticool on pocket pistols."
msgstr "这是一个塑料支架，用于安装各种瞄具模组，设计能永久安装在几乎任何手枪上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的手枪满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "replaceable stock kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable stock kits"
msgstr[0] "可更换枪托套装"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit consisting of various steel parts; when installed, it would "
"remove the weapon's original fixed stock, install a new stock mount on its "
"place, modify original stock to fit it and then reattach it to the gun, or "
"simply attach a stock mount if gun had no stock to start with.  This allows "
"easy installation of any kind of more advanced stocks."
msgstr ""
"这套改装件包含几个钢制部件；安装在枪支上后，它会先移除掉枪支原有的固定枪托，在原枪托处安装一个枪托安装底座，调整原枪托以适应安装底座，最后将原枪托安装在底座上；如果枪本来没有枪托，它只会安装一个安装底座。安装底座允许将各种高级枪托简单的安装在枪上。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "stock mount"
msgstr "枪托底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "bottom mount"
msgid_plural "bottom mounts"
msgstr[0] "管下底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching an underbarrel accessory, designed to "
"be permanently installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners."
"  Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr "这是一个塑料支架，用于连接管下枪械模组，设计能永久安装在几乎任何枪械上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的老式枪械满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "underbarrel mount"
msgstr "管下底座"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Truth Teller"
msgstr "说不出谎"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Truth Teller'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "I'd lie if I said this trait was worth a whole point."
msgstr "如果我说这种特质值一点，那么我就在撒谎。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Quick Pain Recovery"
msgstr "快速疼痛恢复"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Quick Pain Recovery'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You recover from pain faster than normal.  DUMMIED OUT because it wasn't "
"actually functional…"
msgstr "你可以比正常人更快地从疼痛中恢复。不过它实际上不起作用…"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Very Quick Pain Recovery"
msgstr "急速疼痛恢复"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Quick Pain Recovery'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You recover from pain much faster than normal.  DUMMIED OUT because it "
"wasn't actually functional…"
msgstr "你从疼痛中恢复得比正常人快得多。不过它实际上不起作用…"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Rigid Table Manners"
msgstr "餐桌礼仪强迫症"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rigid Table Manners'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've been taught proper table manners from your early childhood on.  Now "
"you can't even think about eating without a table.  Eating without it "
"frustrates you, but eating like a civilized person gives you a bigger morale"
" bonus."
msgstr "你从小被教导着使用正确的餐桌礼仪。现在你甚至不敢想象你不用桌椅吃饭的样子。不用桌椅吃饭会让你沮丧，像文明人一样吃饭会带给你好心情。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Hates Books"
msgstr "讨厌读书"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hates Books'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  Boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun "
"by reading books."
msgstr "读书是书呆子才会做的事！枯燥的书籍将更枯燥，而且无法从书中获得乐趣。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Trigger Happy"
msgstr "连射快感"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Trigger Happy'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Unimplemented.  To be removed after 0.F. to preserve save compatibility."
msgstr "未实装。在0.F之后删除，以保证存档兼容性。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Forgetful"
msgstr "健忘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Forgetful'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a hard time remembering things.  Your skills will erode slightly "
"faster than usual, and you can remember less terrain."
msgstr "你的记忆力很差，记住学到的东西很困难，你的技能遗忘速度的要比别人快，你只能记住少数你曾经走过的地方。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Extended Claws"
msgstr "伸缩利爪（伸出）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extended Claws'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Sharp claws are extended from the end of your fingers."
msgstr "锋利的爪子从你的手指末端伸出来。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Helicopter Pilot"
msgstr "直升机驾驶员"

#. ~ Description for Helicopter Pilot
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Everyone can pilot a helicopter nowadays, you don't need this trait."
msgstr "现在每个人都是王牌飞行员了，你再也不需要这种特质。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Intestinal Fortitude"
msgstr "肠道坚韧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Intestinal Fortitude'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your guts have developed the ability to handle poisonous food.  Mostly."
msgstr "你的肠道已经强化到可以处理大部分有毒食物。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Infection Immune'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your bloodstream has developed antibiotic properties.  Your wounds will "
"never become infected."
msgstr "你的血液里充斥着抗体。你的伤口再也不会被感染了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Disease Resistant"
msgstr "抗病体质"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Disease Resistant'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It's very unlikely that you will catch ambient diseases like a cold or the "
"flu."
msgstr "你的机体免疫力更强，对感冒等环境疾病有一定的特殊抵抗能力。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Disease Immune"
msgstr "疾病免疫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Disease Immune'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is simply immune to diseases.  You will never catch an ambient "
"disease."
msgstr "你的身体产生了疾病免疫。你将永远不会生病。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Good Memory"
msgstr "出色记忆"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Good Memory'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have an exceptional memory, and find it easy to remember things.  Your "
"skills will erode slightly slower than usual."
msgstr "你的大脑掌管记忆的部分非常出色，你更容易记住你所学到的事情，你的技能遗忘速度较常人更慢。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Antsy"
msgstr "流浪癖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Antsy'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't bear to stay still for long.  Your morale will suffer unless you "
"constantly explore new territory."
msgstr "你不能在同一个地方待太久。去探索未知的地方，不然你就会感到难受。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Restless"
msgstr "流浪狂"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Restless'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Spending any amount of time in familiar places makes you miserable.  Must.  "
"Keep.  Moving."
msgstr "在熟悉的地方待一秒钟都让你感到痛苦不堪。必须！保持！移动！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Fey Vision"
msgstr "精灵视觉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "The shadows don't seem as dark now."
msgstr "阴影现在似乎没那么黑了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Fey Nightsight"
msgstr "精灵夜视"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey Nightsight'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have great low-light vision now, though that doesn't allow you to "
"perform fine tasks such as crafting and reading in darkness."
msgstr "你的眼睛发生了变异，有着很好的夜视能力，但这不能让你在黑暗中执行精细的任务，如阅读和制造物品。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Feline Vision"
msgstr "猫之视觉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feline Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your optic nerves and brain caught up with your eyes.  Now you can see "
"pretty well at night."
msgstr "你的视觉系统发生了变异，视觉神经和大脑终于适应了你的新眼睛。现在你能像猫一样看穿黑夜了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Cephalopod Vision"
msgstr "章鱼视觉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cephalopod Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has caught up with your eyes.  You can see much better in the "
"dark, but sunlight seems much brighter now."
msgstr "你的视觉系统发生了变异，你的大脑神经跟上了你眼睛的速度，在黑暗中你看得更清楚了。不过阳光对你来说却更加刺眼。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Ursine Vision"
msgstr "熊之视觉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ursine Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your visual processing has shifted: though you can see better in the dark, "
"you're nearsighted in the light.  Maybe glasses would help.  Activate to "
"toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr "你的视觉系统发生了变异，尽管黑暗里你看得更清楚，亮光底下你却看不了多远了。可能带副眼镜会有帮助。激活来切换显示夜视可见范围。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Tough Feet"
msgstr "坚硬脚掌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tough Feet'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"This mutation has been obsoleted due to the hidden movement speed penalty "
"being removed.  If you see this on a profession or mutate this trait, this "
"is a bug."
msgstr "由于隐藏的移动速度惩罚被移除，这种变异已经被废弃。如果你在职业上看到了这一点，或者变异了这一特性，这就是一个bug。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stylish'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Obsoleted due to becoming default behavior."
msgstr "已废弃，因为此行为已成为默认状态。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Self-Aware"
msgstr "自我认知"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Self-Aware'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "This mutation is now just an option in the settings."
msgstr "此变异现在只是设置中的一个选项。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "Head of Security"
msgstr "安全主管"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "U. Rourke"
msgstr "尤利西斯·洛克"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "Head of security"
msgstr "安全主管"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "Alonso Lautrec"
msgstr "阿隆索·劳特雷克"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "You seem a little forward…"
msgstr "你看起来有点无礼……"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"[PERCEPTION 10] What is up with you?  What's with the fake accent, and "
"speaking in the third person?"
msgstr "[感知10]你怎么了？为什么要用假口音和第三人称说话？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hello again, gorgeous"
msgstr "你好啊，又见面了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Oh my, it's good to see such a strong and handsome fellow around here.  They"
" call me Alonso."
msgstr "哦，天哪，很高兴看到这里有这么一个强壮英俊的家伙。他们叫我阿隆索。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Oh my, you're a beautiful lady, so nice to see you.  They call me Alonso."
msgstr "哦，天哪，您可真是位漂亮的女士，很高兴见到您。他们叫我阿隆索。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Alonso."
msgstr "很高兴见到你，阿隆索。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hi, Alonso.  What's up?"
msgstr "嗨，阿隆索。怎么了？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hi Alonso, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr "嗨，阿隆索，很高兴见到你，不过我得走了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hi Alonso.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "阿隆索，我不能留下来陪你聊天。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you too.  Very nice.  It gets so lonely here in the center."
msgstr "我也很高兴认识你。您真好，在这个中心呆久了会很孤独。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Well, it's a lot better now that you're here.  Nice to see a familiar face."
msgstr "好吧，有你在这里就好受多了。很高兴能看到一张熟悉的脸。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Now that you are here, everything.  Is there anything Alonso can… *do for "
"you*?"
msgstr "既然您来了，一切都好。阿隆索能如何……*为您效劳*呢？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "You know me, I gotta be me, right?"
msgstr "你了解我的，我必须做我自己，对吧？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Alonso cannot help himself, in the face of someone so fine as you."
msgstr "阿隆索无法自拔，在如此优秀之人面前。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Aw man, why you gotta be like that?  I'm just tryin' to get an air of "
"mystery okay?  Nobody wants to be with a slutty guy from Brooklyn, but "
"Alonso the mysterious is another story."
msgstr "伙计，你为什么要这样？我只是想弄点神秘感，好吗？没人愿意和一个来自布鲁克林的淫荡的家伙在一起，但神秘的阿隆索那就另当别论了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Aw come on, why you gotta be like that?  I'm just tryin' to get an air of "
"mystery okay?  Nobody wants to be with a slutty guy from Brooklyn, but "
"Alonso the mysterious is another story."
msgstr "小妞，你为什么要这样？我只是想弄点神秘感，好吗？没人愿意和一个来自布鲁克林的淫荡的家伙在一起，但神秘的阿隆索那就另当别论了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "And how is that working out for you?"
msgstr "但是结果怎么样呢？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Better'n you'd maybe think, okay?  Can we drop it?"
msgstr "比你想象的好多了，好吗？我们不谈这事了，好吗？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Just stop talking like that around me, maybe?  It's really obnoxious."
msgstr "别这样跟我说话了，真的令人讨厌。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "I'll leave you to it then."
msgstr "那我就不打扰你了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Fine.  As a favor to you, I'll be a guy from Brooklyn."
msgstr "好吧。帮你个忙，我会试着成为那个布鲁克林的小子的。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "谢谢。我得走了。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I'm tryin' ta forget, y'know?  Don't like thinkin' about the past.  Better "
"to plan for the future, even if the future looks grim."
msgstr "你知道吗？我在试着忘记过去。我不喜欢回忆，最好为将来绸缪，即使未来渺无希望。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Alonso does not wish to talk about the past, only the future.  There are "
"dark days ahead, but perhaps together we can bring a little light?"
msgstr "阿隆索不愿谈论过去，只想讨论未来。前方的日子会非常黑暗，但是我们在一起或许可以带来一些光明。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Could be better.  I don't really got any friends here in the center, but "
"seeing travelers like you always brightens my day."
msgstr "本可更好。我在这个中心并无几个好友，但是看到像你这样的旅行者总能照亮我的心房。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Here in the center, Alonso is a bit lonely.  We get a few brave, strong "
"travelers like yourself, though, and seeing them brightens Alonso's day."
msgstr "在这个中心，阿隆索有点孤单。不过，我们有几个像你一样勇敢、坚强的旅行者，看到他们会让阿隆索的生活变得更加光明。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Internal Storage"
msgstr "体腔存储"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Storage'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"Space inside your chest cavity has been surgically converted into a storage "
"area.  You may carry an extra 2 liters of volume."
msgstr "你的胸部经过手术将内部空腔转换成储存区域。你可以额外携带2升的物品。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "racing slick (steerable)"
msgstr "竞赛车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "armored wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "装甲车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "bicycle wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "自行车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "off-road bicycle wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "越野自行车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "motorbike wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "摩托车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "off-road motorbike wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "越野摩托车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "small wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "小型轮胎（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "wide wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "宽车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "off-road wide wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "宽越野车轮（可转向）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Inconspicuous"
msgstr "不显眼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Inconspicuous'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"While sleeping or staying still, it is less likely that monsters will wander"
" close to you."
msgstr "当你睡觉或站立不动时，你丝毫没有存在感，怪物不太可能会被你所吸引。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Savings"
msgstr "略有积蓄"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Savings'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"You had some money stashed at the bank for a rainy day.  Now that the storm "
"is raging, it's a last call to use it maybe?"
msgstr "你在银行里存了一些钱以备不时之需。现在暴风雨正在肆虐，这可能是最后一次使用它了？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Debt"
msgstr "负债"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debt'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"You needed money and had a big loan in a bank.  Good thing nobody will come "
"to collect it now, right?  Right?"
msgstr "你需要钱，在银行里有一笔大贷款。幸好现在没人来收，也许？应该吧？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Millionaire"
msgstr "百万富翁"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Millionaire'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"At the time of Cataclysm you were an owner of a fortune stashed in a bank.  "
"Does that have any meaning now?"
msgstr "在大灾变发生时，你是一家银行里的一大笔财富的所有者。那现在有什么意义吗？"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal wheel'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'roller drum'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A strong metal wheel."
msgstr "一个坚固的车轮，金属圆筒。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "washcloth"
msgid_plural "washcloths"
msgstr[0] "抹布"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'washcloth'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "A piece of cloth that can be used for cleaning impervious surfaces."
msgstr "一块可以用来清洁不透水表面的抹布。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Dusty"
msgstr "进灰"

#. ~ Description for fault '{'str': 'Dusty'}'
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "It's dusty.  Has no effect - obsolete fault."
msgstr "它进灰了，但是没有其他实际效果：已废弃的故障。"

#. ~ Name of mending method for fault '{'str': 'Dusty'}'
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Wipe clean"
msgstr "擦净"

#. ~ Success message for mending method 'Wipe clean' of fault '{'str':
#. 'Dusty'}'
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
#, c-format
msgid "You clean you %s."
msgstr "你清理了 %s。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "reactor core expansion device"
msgid_plural "reactor core expansion devices"
msgstr[0] "反应堆核芯扩展设备"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reactor core expansion device'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"This is an expansion device for use on plutonium-powered equipment.  With "
"enough electronics skill, you could attach this to an atomic tool to double "
"the amount of plutonium it can hold.  Note that this device is incompatible "
"with the atomic battery mod."
msgstr ""
"这是一个用于钚原子供能设备的外接扩容模块。在电子学技能足够的前提下，你可以把它装到一个原子能工具上，让钚电池容量翻倍。注意，这一模块不能堆叠兼容外接钚电池改装模组。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Scent Vision"
msgstr "形象化嗅觉系统"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scent Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, you're able to visually sense your own scent, "
"making it possible for you to recognize your surroundings even in complete "
"darkness."
msgstr "当该系统激活时，你可以使你的嗅觉形象化，使你即使在完全的黑暗当中也能识别出周围的环境。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "broken centrifuge"
msgstr "损坏的离心机"

#. ~ Description for broken centrifuge
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated "
"analyzer unit.  If it was still functional, it could have been used to "
"analyze a medical fluid sample."
msgstr "这曾经是一台离心机，一种带有自动分析仪的液体分离装置。如果它还能用的话，它可以用来分析医用液体样本。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "broken autoclave"
msgstr "损坏的高压釜"

#. ~ Description for broken autoclave
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"This thing is basically an extremely high tech laundry machine or "
"dishwasher.  It seems to not do anything useful anymore."
msgstr "这东西基本上可以当成是一台非常高科技的洗衣机或洗碗机。但现在它似乎没法做任何有用的事情。"

#. ~ Description for water dispenser
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "A machine with several taps that dispenses clean water."
msgstr "一台有几个能流出净水的水龙头的机器。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "half-empty shotgun trap"
msgstr "半空的霰弹枪陷阱"

#. ~ Description for wind turbine rotor assembly
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"A large, bladed turbine meant for generating power from wind.  Spinning idly"
" in the breeze trying to power a grid that's since gone dark, the turbine "
"could be salvaged for local power generation instead."
msgstr "用于风力发电的大型叶片式涡轮机。 涡轮机在微风中闲散地旋转着，试图为已经停电的电网供电。"

#. ~ weapon category name
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Hand Axes"
msgstr "手斧"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "%1$s starts burning your hands!"
msgstr "%s 烧伤了你的手！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "%1$s feels freezing cold!"
msgstr "%1$s 像冰块一样寒冷！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "An electric shock shoots into your hand from %1$s!"
msgstr "一道闪电从 %1$s 射入你的手中！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "%1$s lied to you."
msgstr "%1$s 骗了你。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "%1$s was working for… THEM"
msgstr "%1$s 是……他们一伙的。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "%1$s said something stupid."
msgstr "%1$s 说了一些蠢话。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "%1$s is running away!"
msgstr "%1$s 正在逃跑！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "%1$s finds you filthy."
msgstr "%1$s 觉得你很肮脏。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Single glazed glass window"
msgstr "单片玻璃窗"

#. ~ Description for Single glazed glass window
#. ~ Description for Single glazed glass window open
#. ~ Description for Reinforced single glazed glass window open
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "A giant sheet of glass inserted into a window frame."
msgstr "一块镶在窗框里的巨大的玻璃。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Single glazed glass window open"
msgstr "单片玻璃窗（开）"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Single glazed glass window with a curtain"
msgstr "有窗帘的单片玻璃窗"

#. ~ Description for Single glazed glass window with a curtain
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"A glazed window with fancy curtains on the inside that is closed to block "
"visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr "一扇在室内挂着花哨窗帘的窗户。窗帘可以挡住阳光和视线。"

#. ~ Description for Single glazed glass window with a curtain
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"A glazed window with fancy curtains on the inside that can be drawn closed "
"to block visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr "一扇在室内挂着花哨窗帘的窗户。窗帘可以拉上，挡住阳光和视线。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Reinforced single glazed glass window"
