msgid ""
"You were one of the chief executives of the Megacorporation Wraitheon "
"Robotics ltd.  and consistently ranked among the most powerful and "
"influential persons of the world.  Still, the apocalypse has caught you "
"unprepared, and now after the dissolution of your company and the crumbling "
"of your network of influence, your were left powerless and destitute, and "
"must rely on your two robotic bodyguards to survive."
msgstr ""
