#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kevlar-lined ostrich-sized peto'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy mattress-like armor of cloth, leather, and thick linings of Kevlar, "
"originally used as horse protection for bullfighting, but adapted for the "
"noblest of beasts.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套由棉布、皮革和厚厚的凯夫拉内衬制成的沉重的床垫状盔甲，最初用于斗牛时的保护，但也适用于最高贵的野兽种群。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "biosilicified chitin ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "硅化甲壳鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biosilicified chitin ostrich armor'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral, and croupiere made from "
"biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a "
"friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一套自制的鸵鸟铠，包含鸡颈、当胸和搭后，上面的生物硅化甲壳片被按照网状细细贴合在一起。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一匹友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "chitin ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "chitin ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "甲壳鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chitin ostrich armor'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral, and croupiere made from chitin "
"fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一套自制的鸵鸟铠，包含鸡颈、当胸和搭后，上面的甲壳片被按照网状细细贴合在一起。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "chainmail ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "锁环鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainmail ostrich armor'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of chainmail, customized for large two legged birds as "
"protection.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich.  This caparison "
"depicts four men in heavy metal armor riddled with bullet marks."
msgstr "一套厚厚的铁环链甲，专门为保护大型双足鸟打造。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather ostrich barding with caparison"
msgid_plural "boiled leather ostrich bardings with caparison"
msgstr[0] "华丽皮革鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boiled leather ostrich barding with caparison',
#. 'str_pl': 'boiled leather ostrich bardings with caparison'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for ostriches, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts four men in heavy metal armor riddled "
"with bullet marks.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套全身鸵鸟铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。鸵鸟铠上的装饰描绘了四名身穿重金属盔甲的男子，盔甲上布满了弹痕。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for ostriches, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a crown floating above an armored tank "
"in profile above the word AUSTRALIA.  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套全身鸵鸟铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。鸵鸟铠上的装饰描绘了一顶漂浮在装甲坦克上方的皇冠，铭文上写着“AUSTRALIA”。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for ostriches, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts several charging emus trampling enemy "
"machine gunners and a field of wheat.  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套全身鸵鸟铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。鸵鸟铠上的装饰描绘了几头冲锋的鸵鸟正在践踏敌人的机枪手和一片麦田。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for ostriches, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a man wearing a crown of ostrich "
"feathers and fields with many ostriches.  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套全身鸵鸟铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。鸵鸟铠上的装饰描绘了一个戴着鸵鸟羽毛王冠的人，以及一片有许多鸵鸟的旷野。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for ostriches, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a woman in rich blue velvet garments "
"with white ostrich feathers flaring dramatically from her pouf hairstyle.  "
"You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套全身鸵鸟铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。鸵鸟铠上的装饰描绘了一位身穿有着白色鸵鸟羽毛装饰的深蓝色天鹅绒服装的女子，以某种戏剧性地动作从她蓬松的发型中钻出来。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for ostriches, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a fierce tyrannosaurus rex bursting out "
"the side of a 1970s-era van.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套全身鸵鸟铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。鸵鸟铠上的装饰描绘了一只凶猛的霸王龙从一辆1970年代的面包车侧面冲出来。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "boiled leather ostrich barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather ostrich bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "骨钉皮革鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boiled leather ostrich barding with bones',
#. 'str_pl': 'boiled leather ostrich bardings with bones'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"Leather ostrich barding with decorative bones affixed, meant to invoke fear "
"in bandits and raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套鞣制皮革制成的鸵鸟铠，上面附加了许多装饰性的骨钉，足以使强盗、掠夺者和商人们感到恐惧！你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "ostrich rain sheet"
msgid_plural "ostrich rain sheets"
msgstr[0] "鸵鸟用雨衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ostrich rain sheet'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering, adapted to protect an ostrich from acid zombie "
"splashes and similar caustic substances.  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr "一层薄薄的能覆盖鸵鸟全身的塑料布，能够防护酸雨和其他腐蚀性物质。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "ostrich-sized holiday sweater"
msgid_plural "ostrich-sized holiday sweaters"
msgstr[0] "鸵鸟大小的节日毛衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ostrich-sized holiday sweater'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A very large warm wool sweater with a festive holiday pattern.  You could "
"put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一件印着有节日图案的非常大的保暖羊毛衫。你可以将它穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "iron ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "iron ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "铁鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'iron ostrich armor'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically placed iron plates and leather, suitably "
"made for ostriches as protection.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的铁甲，专门为保护鸵鸟打造。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一匹友好的鸵鸟身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "steel ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "steel ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "钢鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steel ostrich armor'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of steel plate and leather, suitably made for ostriches as "
"protection.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的钢板，专门为保护鸵鸟打造。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一匹友好的鸵鸟身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "bronze ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "bronze ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "青铜鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bronze ostrich armor'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically placed bronze plates and leather, suitably"
" made for ostriches as protection.  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的青铜甲，专门为保护鸵鸟打造。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一匹友好的鸵鸟身上。"

#. ~ Computer name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mapgen/DinoLabFinale.json
msgid "DinoLab Operating Theater Access Control"
msgstr "恐龙实验室手术中心控制台"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dinosaur"
msgid_plural "dinosaurs"
msgstr[0] "恐龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dinosaur'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "a dinosaur"
msgstr "恐龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "a heavy thud."
msgstr "一声沉重的闷响。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "the crash of weight on the ground."
msgstr "重物砸在地上的碰撞声。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "a booming stomp."
msgstr "一声轰鸣的跺脚。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "a low tremor in the earth."
msgstr "大地传来的一阵低沉震颤。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "the pounding of massive feet."
msgstr "巨足的重踏声。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "a ground-shaking step."
msgstr "撼动地面的一步。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "coelophysis"
msgid_plural "coelophysis"
msgstr[0] "腔骨龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'coelophysis'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Small, thin predatory bipedal dinosaur with a long head and sharp teeth and "
"long grasping claws."
msgstr "一只又小又瘦的双足食肉恐龙，头很长，长着锋利的牙齿和长长的爪子。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dilophosaurus"
msgid_plural "dilophosaurus"
msgstr[0] "双脊龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dilophosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A medium dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony crests on its "
"head."
msgstr "一只中等体型的恐龙，牙齿很锋利，头部有两个突出的骨冠。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "ceratosaurus"
msgid_plural "ceratosaurus"
msgstr[0] "角鼻龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'ceratosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large, fast predatory bipedal dinosaur, decorated with three colorful "
"horns on its head and dotted with bright skin bones with long sharp teeth "
"and a long flexible tail."
msgstr "一种动作迅速的大型食肉两足恐龙，头上有三个彩色的角，身上点缀着鲜艳的条纹皮肤，长有锋利的牙齿和一条柔软的长尾巴。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "spinosaurus"
msgid_plural "spinosaurus"
msgstr[0] "棘龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'spinosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge dinosaur about the size of a small house, with a ferocious crocodile-"
"like head and a sail on its back."
msgstr "一种巨型恐龙，有一栋小房子那么高，有着凶猛的像鳄鱼一样的头，背上有一个帆一样的东西。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "torvosaurus"
msgid_plural "torvosaurus"
msgstr[0] "蛮龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'torvosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large bipedal predator dinosaur with a large head, long sharp teeth, short"
" strong arms, and long tail."
msgstr "一种大型两足食肉恐龙，头部很大，牙齿长而锋利，手臂短而有力，尾巴长。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "allosaurus"
msgid_plural "allosaurus"
msgstr[0] "异特龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'allosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "A large bipedal dinosaur with a mouth full of sharp serrated teeth."
msgstr "一种大型两足恐龙，嘴上长满了锋利的锯齿状牙齿。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "acrocanthosaurus"
msgid_plural "acrocanthosaurus"
msgstr[0] "高棘龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'acrocanthosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Huge predatory bipedal dinosaur with a tall ridge running the length of its "
"back covered with heavy muscles.  Its teeth are curved and serrated like "
"sawblades."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的双足食肉恐龙，背上长着一条长长的脊梁，覆盖着厚重的肌肉。它的牙齿是弯的，呈锯齿状。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "siats"
msgid_plural "siats"
msgstr[0] "西雅茨龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'siats'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Huge predatory bipedal dinosaur with long claws and strong arms for "
"grappling."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的双足食肉恐龙，长着长长的爪子和强壮的手臂，可以轻松抓住你。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dryptosaurus"
msgid_plural "dryptosaurus"
msgstr[0] "伤龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dryptosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Large sharp teeth and a lean frame, with long wicked claws and a feathered "
"mullet and tail."
msgstr "大而锋利的牙齿和瘦削的身躯，长着邪恶的爪子，背部和尾部长着羽毛。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "appalachiosaurus"
msgid_plural "appalachiosaurus"
msgstr[0] "阿巴拉契亚龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'appalachiosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive it forward, with "
"two small arms and a feathered mullet and tail.  The snout is long with six "
"ridges."
msgstr "它长着巨大的牙齿，凶猛的眼睛，两个短小的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。鼻子很长，上面长着六个脊。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "gorgosaurus"
msgid_plural "gorgosaurus"
msgstr[0] "戈尔冈龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gorgosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive it forward, with "
"two small arms and a feathered mullet and tail."
msgstr "它长着巨大的牙齿，凶猛的眼睛，两个短小的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "albertosaurus"
msgid_plural "albertosaurus"
msgstr[0] "阿尔伯塔龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'albertosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive it forward, with "
"short arms and a feathered mullet and tail."
msgstr "它长着巨大的牙齿，凶猛的眼睛，短小的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "qianzhousaurus"
msgid_plural "qianzhousaurus"
msgstr[0] "虔州龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'qianzhousaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This large, bipedal, feather-covered dinosaur has a long, gator-like mouth "
"with sharp teeth."
msgstr "这只长满羽毛的巨型双足恐龙长着一张长长的、像鳄鱼一样的嘴和许多锋利的牙齿。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "nanuqsaurus"
msgid_plural "nanuqsaurus"
msgstr[0] "白熊龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'nanuqsaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Bipedal dinosaur with long sharp teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes, and a "
"powerful frame to drive it forward, short arms, with a feathered white "
"mullet and tail."
msgstr "一只两足恐龙，巨大的下颌里长满了锋利的牙齿，它长着一双凶猛的眼睛和短短的手臂，背部和尾部长着白色羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "daspletosaurus"
msgid_plural "daspletosaurus"
msgstr[0] "惧龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'daspletosaurus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Bipedal dinosaur with long sharp teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes, and a "
"powerful frame to drive it forward, short arms, with a feathered mullet and "
"tail."
msgstr "一只两足恐龙，巨大的下颌里长满了锋利的牙齿，它长着一双凶猛的眼睛和短短的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "tyrannosaurus rex"
msgid_plural "tyrannosaurus rex"
msgstr[0] "雷克斯霸王龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tyrannosaurus rex'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive "
"it forward, short arms with large claws, with a feathered mullet and tail."
msgstr "巨大的下颌里长满了巨大的牙齿，它有一双凶猛的眼睛，短短的手臂上是一对巨大的爪子，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "compsognathus"
msgid_plural "compsognathus"
msgstr[0] "美颌龙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'compsognathus'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A fast moving bipedal dinosaur about the size of a turkey.  Its teeth and "
"claws are small but sharp."
msgstr "火鸡大小的小型的双足肉食性兽脚亚目恐龙，能够快速移动。牙齿和爪子看起来很小但是很锋利。"

