msgid ""
"A heavily-burned, four-legged zombie dinosaur with a bony crest and two "
"wicked-looking horns; it still reeks of charred meat.  Its flesh has mended "
"into a leathery shell."
msgstr "一头严重烧伤的四足丧尸恐龙，长着高高的骨冠，上面有两根波浪状的侧角，烧焦的血肉散发着恶臭。它的肉已经碳化为一层皮甲似的壳。"

