msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around "
"its form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisted "
"pointed teeth suggest some kind of predator dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"这只丑陋的巨型怪兽浑身布满了骨板，畸形的血肉拖拽着其沉重而尖锐的四肢。本就强大且危险的躯体长出了许多保护的骨甲。而这骨甲还在增长、增长、不断增长。它的外形和扭曲的尖牙表明它曾经是某种食肉恐龙。"

