msgstr[0] "黑龙皮盔（XL）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'XL black dragonhide helmet'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A massive helmet made from black dragonhide.  It protects your head well, "
"and doesn't cover your face, but is large enough to fit even the strangest "
"of heads."
msgstr "黑龙皮制成的巨型头盔，提供出色的头部防护，又不会遮挡面部，能容下各种变异肢体。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
