"This magical pebble has an insignia of clockwork and gears on it.  It is "
"necessary for Technomancers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "这块注魔的小石块上面有一个像齿轮和发条装置的符号，对于将魔力导入制品的科技法师来说必不可少。"

