#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "mana-fueled vibrator"
msgid_plural "mana-fueled vibrators"
msgstr[0] "法力驱动的按摩棒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mana-fueled vibrator'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"This mana-devouring device is just the thing to knead the tension out and "
"help you relax.  Wizards have needs too, after all."
msgstr "这个吞噬法力的装置正是帮你舒缓紧张、放松身心的好东西。毕竟，法师也是有需求的。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_ranged.json
msgid "M47A1 Techno-Medusa"
msgid_plural "M47A1 Techno-Medusae"
msgstr[0] "M47A1 科技魔法\"美杜莎\"左轮手枪"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A magically-enhanced update to the Phillips & Rodgers' M47 Medusa, a  multi-"
"caliber revolver aimed at survivalists.  While Technomancy improves the "
"reliability with smaller cartridges, it is not as accurate as dedicated "
"caliber revolvers due to freebore."
msgstr ""
"一把经过魔法增强的菲利普斯和罗杰斯公司出品的 M47 "
"\"美杜莎\"左轮手枪，这把手枪是一把多口径左轮手枪，专为生存主义者定制。虽然科技魔法提高了手枪发射小口径子弹时的可靠性，但由于是滑膛发射，和对应口径的左轮手枪相比命中率还是略低。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_ranged.json
msgid "gunblade"
msgid_plural "gunblades"
msgstr[0] "枪刃"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_ranged.json
msgid ""
"Constructed similarly to a falcata, this forward-sloping blade has a short-"
"barrel pump shotgun attached to the blade's spine for finishing blows or a "
"first strike."
msgstr "它的结构类似于一把伊比利亚短剑，这把向前倾斜的短刀上有一把短筒泵动式霰弹枪，连接在刀背上，以终结对手或先发打击。"

