#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel the most intense craving for carrots you've ever had..."
msgstr "你感受到了前所未有的对胡萝卜的强烈渴望……"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid "Lamia"
msgstr "拉米亚"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about foxes."
msgstr "你做了一个关于狐狸的怪梦。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a mischievous furry feeling."
msgstr "你的梦境让你感到一种淘气又毛茸茸的感觉。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about bunnies."
msgstr "你做了一个关于兔子的怪梦。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a joyful bouncy feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种愉快又活蹦乱跳的感觉。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a dream of moving across a field, yet you don't hear your "
"footsteps…"
msgstr "你梦见自己穿过一片田野，却没有听到自己的脚步声……"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "While dreaming, you see a strangely serpentine reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦中，你看到了自己奇异的蛇形倒影。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "In a dream, you see a curiously harpy-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己奇异的、像鹰身女妖一样的身影。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-reflection seems to have a pair of bear ears on its head."
msgstr "在梦中的倒影中，你的头上似乎长着一对熊耳。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"As you dream, your reflection appears to have some cat ears on its head."
msgstr "随着梦境的展开，你的倒影头上似乎出现了一对猫耳。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self appears to have dog ears on its head."
msgstr "你的梦中形象似乎长出了狗耳朵。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In a dream you catch a glimpse of a strangely cattle-like tail on yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你瞥见自己身上竟然长出了一条奇怪的牛尾巴。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of sneaking up to a chicken coop."
msgstr "你清晰地梦到自己悄悄靠近鸡舍。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Whilst dreaming, you see yourself… but with a pair of fox ears on your head?"
msgstr "在梦中，你看到了自己……但是你的头上多了一对狐狸耳朵？"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have an vivid dream of yourself with a long, serpentine tail instead of "
"legs."
msgstr "你做了一个生动的梦，梦见自己没有腿，而是拖着一条长长的蛇尾。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream-self seems so graceful, slithering along in their dexterous scaly"
" form."
msgstr "梦中的你似乎如此优雅，用那灵巧的、布满鳞片的身躯滑行着。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of returning to your cozy warren."
msgstr "你做了一个回到了自己舒适兔窝的生动的梦。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a vivid dream of eating a nice, big, orange carrot.  It looks "
"bigger than you!"
msgstr "你生动地梦见自己正在吃一根又大又好的橙色胡萝卜。它看起来比你还大！"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Whilst dreaming, you see yourself… but with a pair of large bunny ears on "
"your head?"
msgstr "在梦中，你看到了自己……但是你的头上多了一对大大的兔耳朵？"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are disturbed when your harpy-like dreams are more lifelike than "
"reality."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成鹰身女妖，梦境中的场景变得比现实世界还要真实了，这让你心烦意乱。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream of raiding a giant beehive has you licking your lips in "
"anticipation."
msgstr "你梦见自己疯狂的舔食着一个蜂巢，舔着嘴唇充满期待。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into a fresh steak."
msgstr "你梦到自己在撕咬一块新鲜的牛排。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You terrifyingly dream of being led to a milking machine by a farmer."
msgstr "你做了一个很糟糕的梦，梦见自己正被农夫领着走向挤奶机。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams of turning into a half-spider frighten you."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成了半人半蜘蛛的模样，这让你感到害怕。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You vividly dream of running away from a chicken coop, your prey held by the"
" neck between your teeth."
msgstr "你清晰地梦到自己叼着猎物的脖子，从鸡舍里跑出来。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of… a wedding altar?!?"
msgstr "你清晰地梦到……一个婚礼祭坛？！"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of skipping away from a big, scary predator."
msgstr "你很生动地梦见自己蹦蹦跳跳地逃离一个巨大又吓人的捕食者。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"It's like your stamina never ends, you wish you had this much energy outside"
" of the dream world!"
msgstr "你的体力仿佛无穷无尽，真希望在梦境之外也能有这么充沛的精力！"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a nostalgic dream of stumbling around clumsily on two legs instead "
"of an elegant snake tail."
msgstr "你怀旧地梦见自己用两条腿笨拙地蹒跚而行，而不是用优雅的蛇尾滑行。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of coiling around a loved one, keeping them wrapped up close for "
"warmth."
msgstr "你梦见自己盘绕着心爱的人，将他们紧紧裹住以取暖。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"A rather attractive triffid offers you a bouquet of zombie heads.  How "
"thoughtful!"
msgstr "一个富有魅力的三尖树送了你一束由丧尸头组成的花束，太体贴了！"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of committing tax fraud: the ultimate trick!"
msgstr "你清晰地梦到自己犯下了偷税漏税的\"终极恶作剧\"！"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You find yourself subconsciously moving your head from your normal pillow to"
" your tail as you sleep."
msgstr "你发现自己在睡觉时，不自觉地把头从普通的枕头移到了自己的尾巴上。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of sharing your love of mischief with a partner."
msgstr "你梦到与一个伴侣分享你对恶作剧的热爱。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of sticking your finger down the barrel of that mean ol' farmer's "
"shotgun, just like a certain cartoon character."
msgstr "你梦见自己像某个卡通人物一样，把手指塞进了那个坏老农的猎枪枪管里。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Look at all those cute babies!  If their dreams are anything like yours, "
"it's no wonder your wild cousins are so fecund."
msgstr "瞧这些可爱的小宝宝！如果它们的梦也跟你的一样，那也难怪你那些野生的表亲们如此多产了。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream about farming your very own near-limitless supply of carrots."
msgstr "你梦见自己在耕种一片几乎可以无限供应的胡萝卜田。"

#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/modinfo.json
msgid "Monster Girls Mutations"
msgstr "魔物娘变异"

#. ~ Description for Monster Girls Mutations
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Ever thought that base-game mutations are way too body-horror and ugly for "
"you?  Ever wished your character could become an anime catgirl?  This is the"
" mod for you!  This mod replaces the vanilla mutation categories with anime-"
"inspired ones that ought to be far cuter.  Note: currently not 1:1 on new to"
" old mutation categories."
msgstr ""
"是否觉得游戏本体的突变过于恐怖和丑陋？是否曾希望你的角色能变成动漫猫娘？这个模组就是为你准备的！这个模组用动漫风格的突变类别替换了原版的突变类别，应该会可爱得多。注意：目前新旧突变类别还没有一一对应。"

