msgid "Core content for Cataclysm-BN"
msgstr "CBN核心内容"

#: data/mods/callback_lua_test/modinfo.json
msgid "Callback Lua Test"
msgstr "Lua 回调测试"

#. ~ Description for Callback Lua Test
#: data/mods/callback_lua_test/modinfo.json
msgid "Mod for testing callbacks for items, bionics, and mutations."
msgstr "用于测试物品、仿生插件和变异的回调函数的模组。"

#: data/mods/cbm_slots/modinfo.json
msgid "Bionic Slots"
msgstr "生化插件槽位"

#. ~ Description for Bionic Slots
#: data/mods/cbm_slots/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Enables the bionic slots system, which limits the number of CBMs you can "
"install in each bodypart."
msgstr "启用生化插件插槽系统，这限制了你可以在每个身体部位中安装的CBM数量。"

#: data/mods/change_hairstyle/iuse.json
msgid "Change hairstyle"
msgstr "改变发型"

#: data/mods/change_hairstyle/modinfo.json
msgid "Change Hairstyle"
msgstr "改变发型"

#. ~ Description for Change Hairstyle
#: data/mods/change_hairstyle/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Hairdressing tools can now actually change your hairstyle! Change your "
"hairstyle and your mood in the Cataclysm!"
msgstr "理发工具现在真的可以改变您的发型了！在大灾变里换个发型，换种心情吧！"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid "Dark Days of the Dead"
msgstr "亡者暗日"

#. ~ Description for Dark Days of the Dead
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"(Formerly Classic Zombies): Only spawn classic zombies (normal zombies and "
"zombie animals) and natural wildlife.  Zombies do not revive and do not need"
" pulping.  This disables certain buildings and map extras.  The long term "
"plan is to make this a classic zombie movie simulator set in the present "
"day.  If you have this mod enabled in experimental, some items may "
"disappear."
msgstr ""
"（原经典丧尸模式）：只会生成经典丧尸（普通丧尸和丧尸化动物）和自然界的动物。丧尸不会复活也不需要砸碎尸体。该选项会使得某些建筑和地图事件无法生成。最终目标是使它成为当今经典的丧尸电影模拟器。如果在日更版中开启使用，可能会导致部分物品消失。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_insect_spider.json
msgid "giant scorpion"
msgid_plural "giant scorpions"
msgstr[0] "巨型蝎子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'giant scorpion'}
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A menacing arachnid with a second set of pedipalps, clacking rabidly as an "
"engorged stinger looms over its body."
msgstr "一只外形可怕的蛛形纲动物，长着两套须肢。它正狂暴地发出咯咯声，一根充血的毒刺在它的身背若隐若现。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_mammal.json
msgid "bush elephant"
msgid_plural "bush elephants"
msgstr[0] "灌木象"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bush elephant'}
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_mammal.json
msgid ""
"The African Bush Elephant is a massive terrestrial animal with two long "
"tusks protruding from its mouth.  Elephantry is on the rise since the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "非洲草原象，一种巨大的陆地动物，嘴里伸出两条长长的象牙。大灾变发生以来，这种动物种群数量正在崛起。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid "hook kangaroo"
msgid_plural "hook kangaroos"
msgstr[0] "勾爪袋鼠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hook kangaroo'}
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Grotesque and deformed kangaroo body that has black goo seeping from its "
"orifices.  The most unnerving is its forearms have reformed into a raptorial"
" shape, like that of a praying mantis."
msgstr "一头外形恐怖而畸形袋鼠，身上的孔中不断有黑色的黏液渗出，最令人不安的是它的前肢已经变成了凶残的勾爪形状，就像螳螂一样。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid "fungal elephant"
msgid_plural "fungal elephants"
msgstr[0] "真菌象"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fungal elephant'}
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A horrifying image with tendrils seeping out of many oozing wounds, this "
"elephant's form appears more eldritch than animal."
msgstr "这是一幅可怕的画面，许多泛脓的伤口出都伸出了卷须状的菌丝，这头大象的外形看起来与其说是动物不如说是怪物。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid "zandcrawler"
msgid_plural "zandcrawlers"
msgstr[0] "沙漠爬行者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zandcrawler'}
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A calloused and misshapened form that seems to have adapted to the harsh, "
"dry environment."
msgstr "这只畸形的丧尸有着硬化的皮肤，似乎已经适应了这里严酷干燥的环境。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_overmap_terrain.json
msgid "desert"
msgstr "沙漠"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "Gila monster"
msgid_plural "Gila monsters"
msgstr[0] "希拉毒蜥"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gila monster'}
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A reptile with aposematic coloration of black and orange that is renowned "
"for an extremely painful venom when it bites."
msgstr "这种蜥蜴有橘黑相间的警告色，因为它咬人时引起极度疼痛的毒液而出名。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid "singing sand"
msgstr "鸣沙"

#. ~ Description for singing sand
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A formation of sand containing special minerals to produce whistling noises "
"when stepped on and from the wind."
msgstr "一种含有特殊矿物的沙子的形成，当踩在风上或从风中发出口哨声。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid "splosh!"
msgstr "啪叽！"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid "fweet!"
msgstr "哗啦！"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid "outcrop"
msgstr "露岩"

#. ~ Description for outcrop
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"An assortment of various large, sharp rocks that jut out from the "
"surrounding terrain.  Could be as a surface for a number of things or "
"climbed on if worn with proper footwear."
msgstr "从周围地形中突出来的各种大而尖的岩石。可以作为很多东西的表面，如果穿着合适的鞋子，也可以爬上去。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid "dune"
msgstr "沙丘"

#. ~ Description for dune
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A huge sand dune that is continually reshaped by the wind.  Climbing it will"
" be troublesome."
msgstr "一个巨大的沙丘，被风不断地重塑。很难爬上去。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid "desert pavement"
msgstr "岩漠"

#. ~ Description for desert pavement
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Not that kind of pavement!  Naturally occurring pockets of densely packed "
"rock fragments that is easier to traverse than sand, with the right "
"footwear."
msgstr "它不是一种人工路面！由密集的天然空腔碎岩石组成，比沙漠更容易穿行，只要穿着合适的鞋子。"

#. ~ Description for scorched earth
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Cracked and dry soil that doesn't look like it will be capable of supporting"
" anything in your lifetime."
msgstr "龟裂的土地，看起来不像是可以支撑什么东西。"

#. ~ Description for cactus
#: data/mods/desert_region/desert_terrain.json
msgid "A tall cactus."
msgstr "一个高大的仙人掌。"

#: data/mods/desert_region/modinfo.json
msgid "Desert Region"
msgstr "沙漠地区"

#. ~ Description for Desert Region
#: data/mods/desert_region/modinfo.json
msgid "A testbed/WIP mod to showcase regional_map_settings JSON changes."
msgstr "测试性未完工模组，用于展示regional_map_settings的变化"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/item_action.json
msgid "Scan/Load a book"
msgstr "扫描/加载一本书"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "Your e-copy is degrading!"
msgstr "你的电子副本正在降解！"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "%d books are found. Do you want to scan them all?\n"
msgstr "发现了 %d 本书。是否全部扫描？\n"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"...And more! (%d)"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"……以及更多！(%d)"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "Scan all"
msgstr "扫描全部"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "Scan all the books until charges going off."
msgstr "扫描所有书籍直到电量耗尽。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua data/raw/keybindings/keybindings.json
#: src/character.cpp src/inventory_ui.cpp src/monexamine.cpp
#: src/npctalk_funcs.cpp src/pickup.cpp
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "Discard the book list and go back."
msgstr "丢弃书籍列表并返回。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "You scanned %d book(s)."
msgstr "你扫描了 %d 本书。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid ""
"WARNING: Not enough battery to scan all books.\n"
"Proceed anyway?"
msgstr "警告：电量不足以扫描所有书籍。仍要继续吗？"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "You have no book to be scanned."
msgstr "你没有可供扫描的书籍。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "Choose the book you want to get."
msgstr "选择你想要获取的书籍。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "How long time do you need?(Digits only)"
msgstr "你需要多长时间？（仅限数字）"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "Input the minute( up to %d ): "
msgstr "输入分钟数（最多 %d）："

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid "[e-copy] %s"
msgstr "[电子副本] %s"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You printed a physical copy of %s.\n"
"It’s virtually weightless and will degrade naturally in about \n"
"[%d minutes.]\n"
"You can return it to the device to recover some energy."
msgstr ""
"你打印了一本 %s 的实体副本。\n"
"它几乎没有重量，并将在大约 [%d 分钟] 后自然降解。\n"
"你可以将其归还给设备以恢复部分能量。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid ""
"Input value is over than available charges.\n"
"Please check your input."
msgstr "输入数值超过了可用电量。请检查你的输入。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "There is no book to return."
msgstr "没有可归还的书籍。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "There is no book in the device."
msgstr "设备中没有书籍。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid ""
"UID:%s\n"
"\n"
"This device has book data as below:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"UID：%s \n"
"\n"
"此设备包含以下书籍数据：\n"
"%s"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
msgid "You don't have any empty memory card."
msgstr "你没有任何空的存储卡。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid ""
"UID: %s\n"
"\n"
"Select a memory card."
msgstr ""
"UID：%s \n"
"\n"
"选择一张存储卡。"

#: data/mods/ebook_lua/main.lua
#, c-format
msgid ""
