"spectrum as a whole, the white represents the importance of non-romantic "
"relationships, and the black and grey represent the sexuality spectrum that "
"ranges from aro-ace to aro-allosexual."
msgstr ""
"一根老旧的金属旗杆，现在悬挂着无浪漫倾向骄傲旗帜，上面有绿色、白色、黑色和灰色。绿色代表无性恋和整个无性恋光谱，白色代表非浪漫关系的重要性，黑色和灰色代表从无性恋到非无性恋的性取向光谱。"

#: data/mods/pride_flags/furniture.json
msgid "wooden flagpole with Aromantic pride flag"
msgstr "无浪漫倾向骄傲旗帜木制旗杆"

#. ~ Description for wooden flagpole with Aromantic pride flag
#: data/mods/pride_flags/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift flagpole is currently flying an aromantic pride flag "
"displaying greens, white, black and grey.  The greens represent aromanticism"
" and the aro-spectrum as a whole, the white represents the importance of "
"non-romantic relationships, and the black and grey represent the sexuality "
