msgstr ""
"一根老旧的金属旗杆，现在悬挂着黑、灰、白、紫四色的无性恋骄傲旗帜。黑色代表完全无性恋，灰色代表半性恋和灰色无性恋者，白色代表盟友，紫色代表社群。"

#: data/mods/pride_flags/furniture.json
msgid "wooden flagpole with Asexual pride flag"
msgstr "无性恋骄傲旗帜木制旗杆"

#. ~ Description for wooden flagpole with Asexual pride flag
#: data/mods/pride_flags/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift flagpole is currently flying the black, grey, white and "
"purple tones of an asexual pride flag.  The black represents total "
