msgstr "自闭症骄傲旗帜旗杆"

#. ~ Description for flagpole with Autism pride flag
#: data/mods/pride_flags/furniture.json
msgid ""
"An old metal flagpole, now flying the infinity symbol upon an autism pride "
"flag.  Gold middle band refers to the elemental symbol of gold (AU) which is"
" used in the autistic community.  The gradient refers to the Pride Movement."
"  Red originated as a protest to the `light it up blue` campaign, which was "
"denounced by the autistic community.  The infinity sign is a symbol long "
"used in the wider autistic and wider neurodiverse community."
msgstr ""
"一根老旧的金属旗杆，现在悬挂着印有无限符号的自闭症骄傲旗帜。中间的金色条带指的是金元素符号（AU），在自闭症社区中使用。渐变色代表骄傲运动。红色起源于对“点亮蓝色”活动的抗议，这个活动曾受到自闭症社区的谴责。无限符号是长期以来在更广泛的自闭症和更广泛的神经多样性社区中使用的符号。"

