#: data/mods/underground_dynamic_temperature/modinfo.json
msgid "Underground Dynamic Temperature"
msgstr "地下动态温度"

#. ~ Description for Underground Dynamic Temperature
#: data/mods/underground_dynamic_temperature/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Enables underground dynamic temperature that is influenced by surface "
"weather conditions. Underground temperatures will gradually transition from "
"surface temperature (z=-1: 50% influence, z=-2: 25%, z<=-3: 0% - annual "
"average only)."
msgstr ""
"启用受地表天气影响的地下动态温度。地下温度将基于地表温度呈现梯度变化（Z=-1层：50%影响，Z=-2层：25%影响，Z<=-3层：0%影响 - "
"仅受年平均气温影响）。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with abundance of fuel."
msgstr "火焰很容易四处蔓延，特别是在可燃物很多的情况下。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can automatically learn every recipe for which you meet skill "
"requirements for, by reading the book with them."
msgstr "你可以通过阅读带有配方的书籍，自动学习每个符合技能要求的配方。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Even if you don't get the power running again, ovens can be useful fire "
"containers."
msgstr "即使没有电源，烤箱也能作为可靠的火焰容器使用。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's sight, noise or smell."
msgstr "亮光本身并不吸引丧尸，它需要看到你、听见噪音或闻到气味。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "驼鹿可能并不是你的朋友。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr "消防服能够抵御火焰，但是不能抵御高温。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Peek around corners.  You may see your enemy before it sees you."
msgstr "记得使用拐角窥探。你可以在敌人看到你之前先看到它。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr "冰冷的食物保质期更长。找个凉快的地下室或者建个储藏地窖。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr "死亡也是游戏体验的一部分。利用所学到的经验再试一次。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Power may be out, but by constructing solar panels or other furniture, you "
"can generate your own electricity."
msgstr "电力可能会被切断，但通过建造太阳能电池板或其他家俱，你可以自己发电。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr "洞穴或地下室之类的地下空间一年到头都很凉爽，但从不结冰。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes "
"instead."
msgstr "害怕野生动物？大喊大叫直到它离开你。但要小心被声音引来的怪物。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr "野生动物和丧尸不是朋友。你可以利用这点。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr "门不是唯一的入口，或出口，如果用词很重要的话。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr "不要以寡敌众。为了活命而逃跑没什么丢人的。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "You don't have to sit next to fire to use it."
msgstr "你不用紧挨着火堆来使用它。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr "许多物品都有特殊的功能。试着找出它们的用途。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr "仅仅因为一个地方很危险并不意味着值得去那里搜刮。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr "如果你准备破门而入，一定要知道怎么出去。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr "通常有不止一种方式来达成目标。试着跳出框框思考。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Survival order: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr "生存优先级：住所，水，食物，然后才是其他。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Balance armor versus encumbrance.  Even dropping a backpack can help in "
"melee."
msgstr "平衡好护甲和累赘度。在近战中只是丢下背包也能帮上忙。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like "
"spears."
msgstr "害怕近战？向敌人投掷物品，并使用像长矛这样的远距攻击武器。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made "
"again."
msgstr "简易武器很容易坏，但它们依旧是武器，而且可以再次制造出来。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Not much survives a car at 120mph.  Can you?"
msgstr "没什么能在120mph的汽车前活下来。你能吗？"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Drugs are great for quick stat boosts, but be careful of addictions or "
"overdose."
msgstr "毒品能够暂时提升你的属性，但要小心上瘾或过量。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you "
"need."
msgstr "合理地使用地图。优先去那些能让你得到所需物品的地点。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speeds that up."
msgstr "伤口会随着时间的推移而愈合。包扎和消毒可以加快这一过程。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Don't get grabbed by zombies.  Their bites can be infectious."
msgstr "别被丧尸抓住。被它们咬伤会让你感染。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling odd after waking up?  Try eating healthier and your health may "
"improve."
msgstr "醒来后感觉怪怪的？尝试更健康的饮食，你的健康会有所改善。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr "合理饮食，否则你的健康会受损。垃圾食品只在紧要关头才有用。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Nature can provide.  You can live off the land if you learn how."
msgstr "大自然能提供一切。如果你知道方法，你能够完全依靠土地生存。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Raw food and water from unsafe sources can't be healthy.  Right?"
msgstr "从不安全的地方获得的生肉和生水也不会安全，不是吗？"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutated wildlife is still edible, but not without risk.  After all, you are "
"what you eat."
msgstr "变异的野生动物仍然可以食用，但并非没有风险。 毕竟，吃啥补啥。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or an APC?"
msgstr "当你可以使用汽车时，为什么要步行？ 或者一辆APC？"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Not all helicopters are useless wrecks.  Some can still be flown, or fixed "
"up to fly again."
msgstr "并非所有的直升机都是无用的残骸。 有些仍然可以飞行，或修复后可以再次飞行。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr "大灾难之前的食物不会永远保持新鲜。记住这一点。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if "
"needed."
msgstr "用寻常的材料可以做出不寻常的物件。如有必要，尽情发挥你的想象力。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know "
"the difference."
msgstr "有些蘑菇是能吃的，有些是只能烧掉的。你会慢慢知道怎么区分它们的。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Having a backup weapon is wise.  So is having a backup plan."
msgstr "有一把备用武器是明智之选。有一个备用方案也一样。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Windows can't stop zombies but they can stop gas, bile, and smoke.  And your"
" smell."
msgstr "玻璃窗无法阻挡丧尸，但能够阻挡毒气、胆汁和烟雾以及你的体味。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr "因为潮湿而心情不爽？一条干毛巾会让你重新微笑起来。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr "喜欢赌一把吗？试试诱变剂，它或许会让你成为人生赢家！"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Smoking and napping is asking for more than a hole in your shirt."
msgstr "抽烟时打盹的危险程度可不是仅仅在你衬衫上烧几个洞这么简单。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out."
msgstr "你身上着火了？停在原地尝试扑灭火焰吧。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr "枯燥的日常操作会最终害死你。保持警惕！不要放松。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of "
"pills."
msgstr "绝大部分药物不会立即生效，不要因为药物没起作用就尝试吞下整瓶药。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal stick."
msgstr "著名遗言：让我们用金属棍子戳一戳这个放电丧尸。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat "
"regularly."
msgstr "饱餐一顿并不能立刻解决营养不良的问题。规律饮食，假以时日。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Be mindful of environmental protection of your gear.  It can take you "
"places."
msgstr "注意你装备的环境防护属性，它们可以让你去到许多本来无法去的地方。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't overlook protective gear, like gas masks or turnout gear.  You never "
"know."
msgstr "不要忘记防护装备，比如防毒面具或者消防服。你永远不知道会发生什么。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting "
"components."
msgstr "材料用光了？破坏或者拆解其它物品，说不定可以得到有趣的部件。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Temperature affects the shelf life of foods.  The colder, the better."
msgstr "温度影响食物的保质期。越低越久。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr "“不过是点擦伤”？还是包扎消毒一下，这样可以加速伤口的恢复。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Broken limb pinned you down?  Hospitals might have next-gen tech to get you "
"going."
msgstr "四肢断掉，行动困难？医院里面可能有下一代科技，能让你重获新生。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't be afraid to make the game easier on yourself.  Worlds can be made to "
"spawn with more resources."
msgstr "不要害怕让游戏变得更容易。调整世界设置能让游戏生成更多物品。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr "减慢你速度的地形也会减慢你的敌人的速度。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Trying out different characters, professions, and scenarios can spice up "
"your game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr "多多尝试不同的角色、职业和场景可以为你的游戏增添乐趣。角色扮演！"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr "多救下一名幸存者就多赢得一个朋友。当然大多数时候……"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr "想知道怎么玩游戏？查看快捷键绑定菜单并了解各种按键诀窍。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Expect the unexpected, even if it's the Spanish Inquisition."
msgstr "为不可预料的事情做好准备，即便会是西班牙异端裁判所。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can throw things while peeking around corners.  Perfect for taking down "
"gun turrets."
msgstr "你可以在窥查拐角的时候扔东西。最适合用来干掉炮塔。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash "
"cards!"
msgstr "没有人告诉过自动售货机世界末日来了。记得多存点现金卡！"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, "
"right?"
msgstr "在那些绝密的地下实验室里肯定有一些很酷的东西，对吧？"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Deep within a gigantic lab lies a secret.  Bring the best firepower you can "
"muster."
msgstr "在一个巨大的实验室深处存在着一个秘密。 带上你能调动的最佳火力。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr "在水壶或水桶上放一个集雨器，以便随着时间的推移收集雨水。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) "
"kill them all."
msgstr "一个城市的丧尸虽然很多，但数量有限。你可以（最终）把它们全部杀光。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr "你*只*拿走了那些没有被钉牢的物品吗？回去拿钉子！"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "You can make your own Safe Mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr "你可以在暂停菜单中制定自定义安全模式规则。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr "世界上最好的枪如果没有弹药也不过是根烧火棍。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running "
"away."
msgstr "大多数丧尸都只会穿过载具而不会绕着走。逃跑的时候要记住这一点。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr "如果你因为断腿被困在室内，可以读一些书来打发时间。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Certain corpses can give you bionics if you dissect them."
msgstr "解剖某些特殊尸体可以获得生化插件。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr "别太贪心了。如果你死了，再多的战利品也没有用。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid "The floor is too hard to sleep on?  Try gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr "地板太硬，无法入睡？试着垫些一堆树叶干草。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Designating a firewood source will make maintaining a fire much simpler."
msgstr "指定一个柴火来源会使维持火变得简单得多。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"With enough parts, your mobile home could be a rolling mobile command "
"center."
msgstr "有了足够的零件，你的移动房屋可以成为一个滚动的移动指挥中心。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Having trouble finding pants that fit after hulking out?  Some outfits can "
"be given that special touch with a tailor's kit."
msgstr "在变得庞大后找到合适的裤子有困难吗？一些服装可以通过裁缝工具包来进行特殊处理，以满足您的需求。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Take cover!  Standing next to sandbags or other obstacles will let you shoot"
" past them unimpeded, while blocking some return fire."
msgstr "找掩护！ 站在沙袋或其他障碍物旁边，可以让你不受阻碍地射击过去，同时阻挡一些还击。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Ballistic windows can take the bite out of bullets flying your way.  "
"Boulders or other hard obstacles can also block shots, or be shot over if "
"you're next to them."
msgstr "防弹窗户可以减轻子弹的威力。大石头或其他硬障碍物也可以挡住子弹，如果你站在旁边的话，也可以越过它们射击。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Many types of furniture have a chance to intercept bullets, reducing some of"
" the damage taken.  The bigger and harder the obstacle, the better."
msgstr "许多类型的家具都有几率拦截子弹，减少部分伤害。 障碍物越大越坚硬越好。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you prefer a more subtle approach to breaking and entering, crouching "
"will make you automatically prioritize lockpicking over prying tools."
msgstr "如果你更喜欢用一种更隐蔽的方式进行破门而入，蹲下时会自动优先选择撬锁而不是撬棍。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crouching slows you down, but allows you to hide behind obstacles and makes "
"you a smaller target when bullets start flying."
msgstr "蹲下会减慢你的速度，但能让你躲在障碍物后，并在枪林弹雨中成为更小的目标。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Make every shot count.  Take time to steady your aim, or crouch for more "
"accurate fire."
msgstr "弹无虚发。花些时间稳定瞄准，或蹲下以提高射击精度。"

#: data/raw/tips.json
msgid ""
"Running, swimming, and other physical activity will increase your Athletics "
