#, c-format
msgid "You think that you can load about %s %s in it."
msgstr "你只能朝烟熏架里装 %s %s 的食物。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "There is not enough charcoal in the rack to smoke this much food."
msgstr "烟熏架内缺少足够的木炭熏制这么多食物。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You need at least %1$s pieces of charcoal, and the smoking rack has %2$s "
"inside."
msgstr "你需要至少 %1$s 木炭，而现在里面只有 %2$s 木炭。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "This smoking rack is ready to be fired, but you have no fire source."
msgstr "这个烟熏架已经可以点燃了，但你没有火源。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Fire the smoking rack?"
msgstr "给烟熏架点火？"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You light a small fire under the rack and it starts to smoke."
msgstr "你在架子下方点了把火，它开始冒出烟来。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp src/iuse_actor.cpp
msgid "ding!"
msgstr "叮！"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You can't place more food while it's smoking."
msgstr "你无法在烟熏架熏制时添加更多的食物。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Remove it before loading the smoking rack again."
msgstr "再次装填熏肉架前，请先将其取出。"

