msgid ""
"Fill the smoking rack with raw meat, fish or sausages for smoking or fruit "
"or vegetable or smoked meat for drying."
msgstr "将生肉、生鱼、生香肠放入熏制。或将水果、蔬菜、熏制食品放入脱水。"

