msgid "Distance units"
msgstr "距离单位"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Metric or Imperial"
msgstr "公制/英制"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Imperial"
msgstr "英制"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Metric"
msgstr "公制"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap coordinates format"
msgstr "大地图坐标格式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Are overmap coordinates displayed using absolute format like 338, 416 or "
"subdivided into two components like 1'158, 2'56?"
msgstr "大地图坐标是使用绝对格式显示，如338、416，还是细分为两个部分，如1'158、2'56？"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Absolute"
msgstr "绝对"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Subdivided"
msgstr "细分"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Time format"
msgstr "时间格式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"12h: AM/PM, e.g. 7:31 AM - Military: 24h Military, e.g. 0731 - 24h: Normal "
"24h, e.g. 7:31"
msgstr ""
"12小时制： AM/PM（默认），例：7:31 AM 。军用制：24小时军用时间格式，例：0731。24小时制：24小时标准时间显示，例：7:31\""

#. ~ 12h time, e.g.  11:59pm
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "12h"
msgstr "12小时制"

#. ~ 24h time, e.g.  23:59
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "24h"
msgstr "24小时制"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Force Y/N in prompts"
msgstr "仅用大写Y/N确认"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, Y/N prompts are case-sensitive and y and n are not accepted."
msgstr "开启后，只能使用大写Y/N选择确认，小写y/n不会被系统接受。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Snap to target"
msgstr "自动锁定目标"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, automatically follow the crosshair when firing/throwing."
msgstr "开启后，射击/投掷时将会自动锁定目标。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Reaim after firing"
msgstr "开火后重新瞄准"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, after firing automatically aim again if targets are available."
msgstr "开启后，当开火时，如果有目标可瞄准，将自动再次瞄准。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Query on disassembly while butchering"
msgstr "屠宰拆解前确认"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will query before disassembling items while butchering."
msgstr "开启后，通过屠宰按键拆解物品时需要确认。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Query on keybinding removal"
msgstr "移除绑定按键前询问"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will query before removing a keybinding from a hotkey."
msgstr "开启后，解除绑定按键时需要确认。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Close advanced inventory on move all"
msgstr "移动所有物品后关闭高级物品管理菜单"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, will close the advanced inventory when the move all items command "
"is used."
msgstr "开启后，使用\"移动所有物品\"指令后自动关闭高级物品管理菜单。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Open default advanced inventory layout"
msgstr "打开高级物品管理默认布局"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Open default advanced inventory layout instead of last opened layout"
msgstr "采用默认布局打开高级物品管理页面"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Display actions in Use Item menu"
msgstr "在使用物品菜单中显示可用操作"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, actions ( like \"Read\", \"Smoke\", \"Wrap tighter\" ) will be "
"displayed next to the corresponding items."
msgstr "开启后，可执行的操作（如阅读、消耗、系紧等）会在物品信息栏一旁列出。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Autoselect if exactly one valid target"
msgstr "自动选择唯一目标"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, directional actions ( like \"Examine\", \"Open\", \"Pickup\" ) will"
" autoselect an adjacent tile if there is exactly one valid target."
msgstr "开启后，需要指定方向的行动（如查看、开启、拾取等）会在只有唯一有效目标时自动选择方向。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Diagonal movement with cursor keys and modifiers"
msgstr "斜向移动组合键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Allows diagonal movement with cursor keys using CTRL and SHIFT modifiers.  "
"Diagonal movement action keys are taken from keybindings, so you need these "
"to be configured."
msgstr "方向键与CTRL和SHIFT组合按下时可以斜向移动，斜向移动将使用按键设置中对应的斜向移动案件，因此需要在按键设置中提前配置完成。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Mode 1: Numpad Emulation"
msgstr "模式1：小键盘仿真（Ctrl长按设置偏移方向，松开Ctrl+移动键）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Mode 2: CW/CCW"
msgstr "模式2：Shift右旋/Ctrl左旋"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Mode 3: L/R Tilt"
msgstr "模式3：左/右键斜向（Shift向上偏移/Ctrl向下偏移）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Suggest autowalk to staircases"
msgstr "建议自动寻路至楼梯"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, upon pressing Ascend Stairs or Descend Stairs, the player will be "
"prompted with an option to walk to the nearest visible staircase."
msgstr "开启后，当按下“上楼梯”或“下楼梯”时，系统将提示玩家是否自动走到最近的可见楼梯处。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vehicle plating changes part color"
msgstr "载具颜色随装甲改变"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, vehicle parts will change color if they are armor plated"
msgstr "开启时，车载部件在安装装甲之后会改变颜色。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Auto-shift the view while driving"
msgstr "自动调整驾驶视野"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, view will automatically shift towards the driving direction"
msgstr "开启后，驾驶视野会根据驾驶方向自动调整。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Draw vehicle facing indicator"
msgstr "绘制车辆方向指示器"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, when controlling a vehicle, a white 'X' ( in curses version ) or a "
"crosshair ( in tiles version ) at distance 10 from the center will display "
"its current facing."
msgstr "开启后，在玩家控制车辆时，当前车辆的车头朝向会以一个白色的\"X\"（图像版中为十字）标识于离车辆中心的距离10格的位置。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Reverse steering direction in reverse"
msgstr "真实倒车转向"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, when driving a vehicle in reverse, steering should also reverse "
"like real life."
msgstr "开启后，当倒车时，转向也会像现实中一样颠倒过来。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sidebar position"
msgstr "侧边栏位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Switch between sidebar on the left or on the right side.  Requires restart."
msgstr "切换侧边栏为左侧或右侧。需要重启。"

#. ~ sidebar position
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Draw sidebar spacers"
msgstr "侧边栏间隔"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, adds an extra space between sidebar panels."
msgstr "开启后，将在侧边栏不同面板之间添加额外空行。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Message log flow"
msgstr "信息记录出现位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Where new log messages should show."
msgstr "设置新的信息记录在哪里出现。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

#. ~ sidebar/message log flow direction
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Top"
msgstr "顶部"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sidebar log message display duration"
msgstr "侧边栏日志信息显示时间"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Number of turns after which a message will be removed from the sidebar log."
"  '0' disables this option."
msgstr "侧边栏日志信息在删除前保留的回合数。设为\"0\"将禁用该选项。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Message cooldown"
msgstr "消息冷却时间"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Number of turns during which similar messages are hidden.  '0' disables this"
" option."
msgstr "侧边栏日志中隐藏同类型消息的回合数。设置为0时禁用该选项。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Limit message history"
msgstr "限制信息记录"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Number of messages to preserve in the history, and when saving."
msgstr "查看历史以及保存存档时保存的信息数目。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Suppress \"unknown command\" messages"
msgstr "阻止\"未知指令\"消息"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, pressing a key with no set function will not display a notice in "
"the chat log."
msgstr "开启时，按下未绑定功能的按键将不会在消息栏中显示未知指令的通知。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Look around position"
msgstr "观察面板位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Switch between look around panel being left or right."
msgstr "切换观察面板至左侧或右侧。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pickup position"
msgstr "拾取菜单位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Switch between pickup panel being left, right, or overlapping the sidebar."
msgstr "选择拾取菜单的位置：左方，右方，或者覆盖边栏。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overlapping"
msgstr "覆盖"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Aim window display style"
msgstr "瞄准窗口显示模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "How should confidence and steadiness be communicated to the player."
msgstr "调整射击窗口内命中率及稳定度数值的显示模式。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Bars"
msgstr "棒形"

#. ~ aim bar style - bars or numbers
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Numbers"
msgstr "数字"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Morale style"
msgstr "心情显示"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Morale display style in sidebar."
msgstr "心情图标在侧边栏处的显示形式。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "横向"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "纵向"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Full screen Advanced Inventory Manager"
msgstr "全屏高级物品管理菜单"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, Advanced Inventory Manager menu will fit full screen, otherwise it "
"will leave sidebar visible."
msgstr "开启后，高级物品管理菜单将全屏显示，否则将保持侧边栏可见。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Advanced Inventory Manager Filter Resets"
msgstr "高级物品管理器筛选器重置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, Advanced Inventory Manager filters will be reset when leaving the "
"menu"
msgstr "开启后，在退出菜单时，高级物品管理器的筛选器将会被重置。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Move view offset"
msgstr "视角画面移动步长"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Move view by how many squares per keypress."
msgstr "在移动当前视角画面时每次按键所移动的方格数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap fast scroll offset"
msgstr "大地图快速滚动偏移量"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"With Fast Scroll option enabled, shift view on the overmap and while looking"
" around by this many squares per keypress."
msgstr "在启用快速滚动选项的情况下，在大地图上移动视图，每次按键移动多少格。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Centered menu scrolling"
msgstr "菜单滚动条居中"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, menus will start scrolling in the center of the list, and keep the "
"list centered."
msgstr "开启后，滚动条将在列表的中间位置开始滚动，并一直保持列表居中。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shift list item view"
msgstr "查看物品时画面移动方式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Centered or to edge, shift the view toward the selected item if it is "
"outside of your current viewport."
msgstr "当所选物品超出当前画面范围时，将会移动视角画面使得所选物品居中或位于画面边缘。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "居中"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "To edge"
msgstr "边缘"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Auto inventory letters"
msgstr "自动分配物品快捷字符"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Enabled: automatically assign letters to any carried items that lack them.  "
"Disabled: do not auto-assign letters.  Favorites: only auto-assign letters "
"to favorited items."
msgstr "启用：自动分配字母。禁用：不自动分配字母。收藏：仅为收藏的物品自动分配字母。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "收藏"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show item health bars"
msgstr "显示物品耐久条"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, show item health bars instead of reinforced, scratched etc. text."
msgstr "开启时，将使用棒状显示条替代物品耐久度的文字描述。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show item symbols"
msgstr "显示物品符号"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, show item symbols in inventory and pick up menu."
msgstr "开启后，物品的符号将显示在物品菜单和拾取菜单中"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Highlight unread recipes"
msgstr "高亮未读配方"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Highlight unread recipes to allow tracking of newly learned recipes."
msgstr "高亮显示未读配方，以便追踪新学会的配方。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Highlight unread items"
msgstr "高亮未读物品"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Highlight unread items to allow tracking of newly discovered items."
msgstr "高亮显示未读物品，以便追踪新发现的物品。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Add ammo to weapon/magazine names"
msgstr "在武器/弹匣名称中添加弹药名"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, the default ammo is added to weapon and magazine names.  For "
"example \"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5)\" becomes \"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5 "
"7.62x54mm)\"."
msgstr ""
"开启后，武器/弹匣所使用的默认弹药将添加到其显示名称之中。例如，\"莫辛纳甘 M44 骑枪（4/5）\"莫辛纳甘 M44 骑枪（4/5 "
"7.62x54mm 弹）\"。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enable joystick"
msgstr "启用游戏手柄"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enable input from joystick."
msgstr "启用对手柄、摇杆输入的支持。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Hide mouse cursor"
msgstr "隐藏鼠标光标"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Show: Cursor is always shown.  Hide: Cursor is hidden.  HideKB: Cursor is "
"hidden on keyboard input and unhidden on mouse movement."
msgstr "显示：鼠标总是显示。隐藏：鼠标总是隐藏。按键时隐藏：使用键盘时鼠标隐藏。"

#. ~ show mouse cursor
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

#. ~ hide mouse cursor
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

#. ~ hide mouse cursor when keyboard is used
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "HideKB"
msgstr "按键时隐藏"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Edge scrolling"
msgstr "边缘滚动"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Edge scrolling with the mouse."
msgstr "鼠标移动至窗口边缘时滚动屏幕。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display enabled animations."
msgstr "开启后，将显示下列被启用的动画。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Rain animation"
msgstr "下雨动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display weather animations."
msgstr "开启后，将显示天气动画。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Projectile animation"
msgstr "抛射动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, will display animations for projectiles like bullets, arrows, and "
"thrown items."
msgstr "开启后，将会显示抛射体的动画，如子弹、弓箭和投掷物。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "SCT animation"
msgstr "战斗气泡动画"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display scrolling combat text animations."
msgstr "开启后，将显示战斗气泡动画。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "SCT with Unicode font"
msgstr "战斗气泡动画使用Unicode"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will display scrolling combat text with Unicode font."
msgstr "开启后，战斗气泡动画将使用Unicode字符而非贴图包。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Animation delay"
msgstr "动画延时"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The amount of time to pause between animation frames in ms."
msgstr "每帧动画之间的延迟时间。以毫秒为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Maximum rendered explosions per turn"
msgstr "每回合最大渲染爆炸数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Skip rendering explosions after this many count per turn to prevent "
"softlocks from chain reactions. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "每回合爆炸数量超过此数值后将跳过渲染，以防止连锁反应导致游戏假死。设为 0 以禁用此功能。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Draw bullets as lines"
msgstr "将子弹点绘制为线条"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, bullets are drawn as lines of images, and the animation lasts only "
"one frame."
msgstr "开启时，子弹将绘制为图像的线条，并且动画仅持续一帧。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Blinking effects speed"
msgstr "闪烁效果速度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The speed of every blinking effects in ms."
msgstr "每一次闪烁效果的周期，单位为ms。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Force redraw"
msgstr "强制重新渲染"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, forces the game to redraw at least once per turn."
msgstr "开启时，则游戏会在每个回合强制重新渲染。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Terminal width"
msgstr "终端宽度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the size of the terminal along the X axis."
msgstr "设置窗口的宽度（X方向）。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Terminal height"
msgstr "终端高度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the size of the terminal along the Y axis."
msgstr "设置窗口的高度（Y方向）。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Font settings"
msgstr "字体设置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Font display settings.  To change font type or source file, edit fonts.json "
"in config directory."
msgstr "字体显示设置。要更改字体类型或源文件，请编辑fonts.json。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "SDL ASCII lines"
msgstr "图形ASCII绘线"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Use SDL ASCII line drawing routine instead of Unicode Line Drawing "
"characters.  Use this option when your selected font doesn't contain "
"necessary glyphs."
msgstr "使用SDL绘制线条而不是Unicode字符绘制线条。如果所选字体不包含绘制线条所必要的字符，请使用此选项。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Font blending"
msgstr "字体混合"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, fonts will look better."
msgstr "开启后，字体显示效果会更好。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Font width"
msgstr "字体宽度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the font width.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置字体宽度，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Font height"
msgstr "字体高度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the font height.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置字体高度，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Font size"
msgstr "字体大小"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the font size.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置字体大小，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Map font width"
msgstr "地图字体宽度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the map font width.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置地图字体宽度，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Map font height"
msgstr "地图字体高度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the map font height.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置地图字体高度，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Map font size"
msgstr "地图字体大小"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the map font size.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置地图字体大小，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap font width"
msgstr "大地图字体宽度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the overmap font width.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置大地图字体宽度，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap font height"
msgstr "大地图字体高度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the overmap font height.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置大地图字体高度，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap font size"
msgstr "大地图字体大小"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set the overmap font size.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置大地图字体大小，需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enable ASCII art in item descriptions"
msgstr "开启物品描述ASCII艺术画支持"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"When available item description will show a picture of the item in ascii "
"art."
msgstr "开启后，当物品描述中有ASCII艺术画时能够正常显示。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Use tiles"
msgstr "使用贴图包"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, replaces some TTF rendered text with tiles."
msgstr "开启时，将使用贴图包替换游戏地图中的TTF文本。需要重启游戏。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Choose tileset"
msgstr "选择贴图包："

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Choose the tileset you want to use."
msgstr "选择你想要的贴图包。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Use tiles to display overmap"
msgstr "使用大地图贴图包"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, replaces some TTF-rendered text with tiles for overmap display."
msgstr "开启时，将使用贴图包替换游戏大地图中的TTF文本。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Choose overmap tileset"
msgstr "选择大地图贴图包"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Choose the overmap tileset you want to use."
msgstr "请选择你想要使用的大地图贴图包。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Graphical vehicle display"
msgstr "图形化载具显示"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, the vehicle interaction screen will display vehicle parts using "
"graphical tiles instead of ASCII symbols."
msgstr "开启时，载具交互界面将使用图像素材而非ASCII字符来显示载具部件。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enable character preview window"
msgstr "启用角色预览窗口"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, shows character preview window in traits tab on character creation."
"  While having a window press 'z'/'Z' to perform zoom-in/zoom-out.  Press "
"'C' to toggle clothes preview"
msgstr "开启时，在角色创建时在特质选项卡中显示角色预览窗口。在有窗口时，按 'z'/'Z' 进行放大/缩小。按 'C' 切换服装预览。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Memory map drawing mode"
msgstr "地图记忆绘制模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Specified the mode in which the memory map is drawn."
msgstr "指定记忆中地图区块的绘制模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Darkened"
msgstr "变暗"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sepia"
msgstr "旧照片"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Static z level effect"
msgstr "静态Z轴渲染"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, lower z levels will look the same no matter how far down they are."
"  Increases rendering performance."
msgstr "如果打开，较低的 Z 轴区域会以统一的样式绘制。提高了渲染性能。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap air transparent"
msgstr "大地图空气透明化"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, overmap z levels with air are transparent, lower layers are "
"rendered. Decreases rendering perfomance."
msgstr "如果打开，具有空气的覆盖地图 Z 轴将是透明的，较低的层级将被渲染。这会降低渲染性能。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pixel minimap"
msgstr "小地图"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, shows the pixel-detail minimap in game after the save is loaded.  "
"Use the 'Toggle Pixel Minimap' action key to change its visibility during "
"gameplay."
msgstr "开启时，载入游戏后将在侧边栏显示像素小地图。使用\"切换小地图\"键来在游戏里开启或者关闭小地图。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pixel minimap drawing mode"
msgstr "小地图绘制模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Specified the mode in which the minimap drawn."
msgstr "选择小地图的绘制模式。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Solid"
msgstr "实心"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Squares"
msgstr "方块"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Dots"
msgstr "点阵"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pixel minimap brightness"
msgstr "小地图亮度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overall brightness of pixel-detail minimap."
msgstr "选择小地图的绘制亮度。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pixel minimap height"
msgstr "小地图高度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Height of pixel-detail minimap, measured in terminal rows.  Set to 0 for "
"default spacing."
msgstr "像素小地图的高度，以行数为单位。设置为 0 代表默认值。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Scale pixel minimap"
msgstr "缩放小地图"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Scale pixel minimap to fit its surroundings.  May produce crappy results, "
"especially in modes other than \"Solid\"."
msgstr "缩放小地图以适应四周。可能会产生糟糕的显示效果，尤其是当小地图绘制模式不是“实心”时。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Maintain pixel minimap aspect ratio"
msgstr "保持像素小地图长宽比"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Preserves the square shape of tiles shown on the pixel minimap."
msgstr "保持像素小地图中的小格子为方形。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Creature beacon size"
msgstr "生物标记大小"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Controls how big the creature beacons are.  Value is in minimap tiles."
msgstr "控制小地图上生物标记的大小。单位为小地图格子的大小。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Hostile creature beacon blink speed"
msgstr "敌人标记闪烁速度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Controls how fast the hostile creature beacons blink on the pixel minimap.  "
"Value is multiplied by 200 ms.  Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "控制小地图上敌人标记的闪烁速度。参数乘以200 毫秒。设置为 0 时禁用闪烁。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Zoom steps"
msgstr "缩放步数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Number of steps between zoom levels."
msgstr "缩放级别之间的步数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Display"
msgstr "切换显示"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Sets which video display will be used to show the game.  Requires restart."
msgstr "设置游戏使用的显示器。需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全屏模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Starts Cataclysm in one of the fullscreen modes.  Requires restart."
msgstr "在全屏模式下开始游戏。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Maximized"
msgstr "窗口最大化"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Windowed borderless"
msgstr "无边框模式"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Minimize on focus loss"
msgstr "最大限度地减少焦点丢失"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Minimize fullscreen window when it loses focus.  Requires restart."
msgstr "当全屏窗口失去焦点时将其最小化。需要重启游戏生效。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "渲染器"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Set which renderer to use.  Requires restart."
msgstr "选择所使用的渲染器。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Software rendering"
msgstr "软件渲染"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Use software renderer instead of graphics card acceleration.  Requires "
"restart."
msgstr "用软件渲染来替代硬件加速，需要重启。（安卓版采用软件渲染不稳定，可能导致闪退）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Allow render batching"
msgstr "启用批量渲染"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Use render batching for 2D render API to make it more efficient.  Requires "
"restart."
msgstr "启用2D渲染器API中的批量渲染功能加速渲染，需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Software framebuffer acceleration"
msgstr "软件渲染帧缓冲区加速"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Use hardware acceleration for the framebuffer when using software rendering."
"  Requires restart."
msgstr "软件渲染开启时用硬件加速帧缓冲区，需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Use VSync"
msgstr "使用垂直同步"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Enable vertical synchronization to prevent screen tearing.  VSync can slow "
"the game down a lot.  Requires restart."
msgstr "启用垂直同步以防止屏幕撕裂。垂直同步会大大降低游戏速度。需要重新启动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Use color modulated textures"
msgstr "使用彩色调制纹理"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, tries to use color modulated textures to speed-up ASCII drawing.  "
"Requires restart."
msgstr "开启后，尝试使用彩色调制纹理加速ASCII渲染。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Display scaling factor"
msgstr "显示比例系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Factor by which to scale the game display, 1x means no scaling.  Requires "
"restart."
msgstr "显示游戏的缩放比例，1x 表示无缩放。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "1x"
msgstr "1x"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "2x"
msgstr "2x"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "4x"
msgstr "4x"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Configure performance settings that can detract from the game."
msgstr "配置可能会影响游戏体验的性能设置。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sleep Boost: Skip Vehicle Movement"
msgstr "睡眠加速：跳过载具移动"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Turns off vehicle movement and autodrive while sleeping"
msgstr "睡眠时关闭载具移动和自动驾驶功能。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sleep Boost: Skip Sound Processing On Sleep"
msgstr "睡眠加速：睡眠时跳过声音处理"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sounds are not processed while sleeping"
msgstr "睡眠时不进行声音处理。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Sleep Boost: Skip Monster Movement"
msgstr "睡眠加速：跳过怪物移动"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Monsters do not move while sleeping"
msgstr "睡眠时怪物不会移动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "External Storage Saving"
msgstr "外部存储保存"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Save in data/catalcysm... instead of Documents/..."
msgstr "保存在 data/cataclysm... 而非 Documents/..."

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Strict JSON checks"
msgstr "严格的JSON检查"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, will show additional warnings for JSON data correctness."
msgstr "开启后，将对JSON数据的正确性显示额外的警告。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Force tileset reload"
msgstr "强制重新加载图块"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If false, the game will keep tileset in memory after first load to speed up "
"subsequent loadings of game data.  Enable this if you're working on a "
"tileset for the game or a mod."
msgstr "如果关闭，游戏在第一次加载后会在内存中保留图块数据，以加快后续游戏数据的加载速度。 如果你正在为游戏或MOD制作图块，请启用这个功能。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Display Mod Source"
msgstr "显示来源的 Mod"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Displays what content pack a piece of furniture, terrain, item or monster "
"comes from or is affected by.  Disable if it's annoying."
msgstr "显示一件家具、地形、物品或怪物来自于什么内容包或受什么影响。 如果它很烦人，请禁用。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Display Object IDs"
msgstr "显示对象ID"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Displays internal IDs of game objects and creatures.  Warning: IDs may "
"contain spoilers."
msgstr "显示游戏对象和生物的内部ID。警告：ID可能包含剧透。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Logging"
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Configure debug.log verbosity."
msgstr "配置 debug.log 文件。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Distance initial visibility"
msgstr "起始大地图可视范围"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Determines the scope, which is known in the beginning of the game."
msgstr "决定了游戏开始时大地图已被探索的范围。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial stat points"
msgstr "起始属性点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial points available to spend on stats on character generation."
msgstr "创建角色时可用属性点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial trait points"
msgstr "起始特性点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial points available to spend on traits on character generation."
msgstr "创建角色时可用特性点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial skill points"
msgstr "起始技能点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial points available to spend on skills on character generation."
msgstr "创建角色时可用技能点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Maximum trait points"
msgstr "最大特性点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Maximum trait points available for character generation."
msgstr "创建角色时最大特性点数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Skill training speed"
msgstr "技能训练速度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Scales experience gained from practicing skills and reading books.  0.5 is "
"half as fast as default, 2.0 is twice as fast, 0.0 disables skill training "
"except for NPC training."
msgstr "技能提升的速度倍率，包括阅读书籍及训练所得的经验。 0.5 代表默认值的一半速度，2.0 快两倍，0.0 时技能只会因NPC 训练提升。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Skill rust"
msgstr "技能遗忘"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Set the level of skill rust.  Vanilla: Vanilla Cataclysm - Capped: Capped at"
" skill levels 2 - Int: Intelligence dependent - IntCap: Intelligence "
"dependent, capped - Off: None at all."
msgstr ""
"设置技能遗忘等级。Vanilla：减少经验并降级；Capped：减少经验并降到2级；Int：依据智力水平减少经验并降级；IntCap：依据智力水平减少经验不降级；Off：经验不减少。"

#. ~ plain, default, normal
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vanilla"
msgstr "Vanilla"

#. ~ capped at a value
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Capped"
msgstr "Capped"

#. ~ based on intelligence
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Int"
msgstr "Int"

#. ~ based on intelligence and capped
#: src/options.cpp
msgid "IntCap"
msgstr "IntCap"

#: src/options.cpp src/panels.cpp
msgid "Off"
msgstr "关"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Crafting range"
msgstr "制造物品取用范围"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Maximum distance at which items are considered available for crafting (or "
"some other actions)."
msgstr "物品被认定为可用于制造（或某些其他行为）的最大距离。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "3D field of vision"
msgstr "3D 视野"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If false, vision is limited to current z-level.  If true and the world is in"
" z-level mode, the vision will extend beyond current z-level."
msgstr "若为否，视野仅限于当前的 Z 水平。 如果为 true，且世界处于 Z 水平模式，视野将超出当前的 Z 水平。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vertical range of 3D field of vision"
msgstr "3D视野垂直可见范围"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"How many levels up and down the experimental 3D field of vision reaches.  "
"(This many levels up, this many levels down.)  3D vision of the full height "
"of the world can slow the game down a lot.  Seeing fewer Z-levels is faster."
msgstr "在实验性的3D视野中能向上向下看多少层。（向上看这么多层，向下也看这么多层）过高的3D视野会严重拖慢游戏速度。能看到的层数越少速度越快。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Event bus system"
msgstr " 事件总线系统"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If false, achievements and some Magiclysm functionality won't work, but "
"performance will be better."
msgstr "若为 否，成就和一些大魔法mod里的功能无法生效，但是性能会更好。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Electric grid testing"
msgstr "实验性电网"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, enables somewhat unfinished electric grid system that may slow the "
"game down."
msgstr "如果打开，则启用尚未完全完成的电网系统，这可能会减慢游戏速度。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Made of explodium"
msgstr "爆炸性材料构造"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Explosive items and traps will detonate when hit by damage exceeding the "
"threshold.  A higher number means more damage is required to detonate.  Set "
"to 0 to disable."
msgstr "当受到超过阈值的伤害时，爆炸物品和陷阱将会引爆。较高的数字意味着需要更多的伤害来引爆。将其设置为0以禁用该功能。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Item damage on flying impact"
msgstr "物品飞行撞击伤害"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, items flung by explosions will deal (lethal) damage to whatever "
"they hit."
msgstr "开启后，被爆炸炸飞的物品将对击中的目标造成（致命）伤害。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Old explosions system"
msgstr "旧版爆炸系统"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, disables new raycasting based explosive system in favor of old "
"system.  With new system obstacles (impassable terrain, furniture or vehicle"
" parts) will block shrapnel, while blast will bash obstacles and throw "
"creatures outward.  If obstacles are destroyed, blast continues outward."
msgstr ""
"开启后，则禁用基于新射线投射的爆炸系统，而采用旧系统。在新系统中，障碍物（无法通过的地形、家具或车辆部件）会阻挡弹片，而爆炸会击碎障碍物并将生物抛出。如果障碍物被摧毁，爆炸会继续向外扩散。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Chronic pain"
msgstr "慢性疼痛"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, injuries cause persistent pain until they are healed."
msgstr "开启后，受伤将持续引发疼痛，直到伤口愈合为止。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Minimum auto-drive speed"
msgstr "最低自动驾驶速度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Set the minimum speed for the auto-drive feature.  In tiles/s.  Default is 1"
" (6 km/h or 4 mph)."
msgstr "设定自动驾驶功能的最低速度。单位为格/秒。默认值为1（6公里/小时或4英里/小时）。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Maximum auto-drive speed"
msgstr "最高自动驾驶速度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Set the maximum speed for the auto-drive feature.  In tiles/s.  Default is 9"
" (57 km/h or 36 mph)."
msgstr "设定自动驾驶功能的最高速度。单位为格/秒。默认值为9（57公里/小时或36英里/小时）。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "New bayonet system"
msgstr "新刺刀系统"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, bayonets replace weapon attack instead of adding to it.  WIP "
"feature, weakens bayonets heavily at the moment."
msgstr "开启后，刺刀将取代武器攻击，而不是增加攻击。目前这是一个正在开发的功能，这会显著削弱刺刀的效果。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Use legacy pathfinding"
msgstr "使用旧版路径寻找"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, opt out of new pathfinding in favor of legacy one. This makes "
"pathfinding mods not work."
msgstr "开启后，将放弃新版路径寻找，改用旧版路径寻找。这会导致路径寻找模组无法正常工作。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "World end handling"
msgstr "死后世界存档处理"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Handling of game world when last character dies."
msgstr "当该世界里最后一个角色死亡后如何处理世界存档。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Keep"
msgstr "保留"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Query"
msgstr "询问"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Size of cities"
msgstr "城市规模"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"A number determining how large cities are.  0 disables cities, roads and any"
" scenario requiring a city start."
msgstr "决定城市大小的数值。设置为 0 时将不会生成城市和道路，同时无法使用任何需要城市建筑作为起始位置的场景。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "City spacing"
msgstr "城市间距"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"A number determining how far apart cities are.  Warning, small numbers lead "
"to very slow mapgen."
msgstr "决定城市之间距离的数值。警告：过小的数值将导致地图生成非常慢！"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap specials density factor"
msgstr "大地图特殊地点密度系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "A scaling factor that determines density of overmap specials."
msgstr "设置大地图特殊地形的密度系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Overmap specials spacing"
msgstr "大地图特殊地形间隔"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"A number determing minimum distance between overmap specials.  -1 allows "
"intersections of specials."
msgstr "一个确定大地图特殊地形之间最小距离的数字。-1 允许大地图特殊地形的交汇。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vehicle damage scaling factor"
msgstr "载具伤害比例系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "A scaling factor that determines how damaged vehicles are."
msgstr "设置车辆损坏程度的系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vehicle door locks"
msgstr "载具门锁"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Determines if new vehicles can spawn with locked doors."
msgstr "决定新生成的载具是否自带已上锁的车门。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vehicle spawn rate scaling factor"
msgstr "载具生成系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "A scaling factor that determines density of vehicle spawns."
msgstr "设置载具生成的密度系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Spawn rate scaling factor"
msgstr "怪物生成比例系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "A scaling factor that determines density of monster spawns."
msgstr "设置怪物生成的密度系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Animal spawn rate scaling factor"
msgstr "动物生成系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "A scaling factor that determines density of animal spawns."
msgstr "设置动物生成的密度系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Carrion spawn rate scaling factor"
msgstr "食腐生物生成比例系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"A scaling factor that determines how often creatures spawn from rotting "
"material."
msgstr "设置从腐烂物品中生成食腐生物的密度系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "NPC spawn rate scaling factor"
msgstr "NPC生成系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "A scaling factor that determines density of dynamic NPC spawns."
msgstr "决定动态NPC生成密度的系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Monster evolution scaling factor"
msgstr "怪物进化时间比率"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"A scaling factor that determines the time between monster upgrades.  A "
"higher number means slower evolution.  Set to 0.00 to turn off monster "
"upgrades."
msgstr "决定怪物每次进化时间间隔的比率。数字越大代表进化越慢。设为 0.00 会停止怪物进化。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Merchant restock scaling factor"
msgstr "商人补货速率缩放系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "A scaling factor that determines restock rate of merchants."
msgstr "一个决定商人补货速率的缩放系数。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enabled Skill Buffs"
msgstr "已启用的技能增益"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Enable or disable major skill buffs"
msgstr "启用或禁用主要技能增益"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Item category scaling factors"
msgstr "物品类别比例系数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Spawn rate for item categories. Values ≤ 1.0 represent a chance to spawn. "
">1.0 means extra spawns. Set to 0.0 to disable spawning items from that "
"category."
msgstr "各物品类别的生成概率。数值 ≤ 1.0 表示生成的概率，>1.0 表示额外生成。设置为 0.0 可禁用该类别物品的生成。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Monster speed percentage"
msgstr "怪物速度百分比"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Determines the movement rate of monsters.  A higher value increases monster "
"speed and a lower reduces it.  Requires world reset."
msgstr "决定怪物速度。该值更高将会使怪物动作变得更快，该值较低会让怪物们变得慢吞吞。需要重置世界。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Monster resilience percentage"
msgstr "怪物耐性百分比"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Determines how much damage monsters can take.  A higher value makes monsters"
" more resilient and a lower makes them more flimsy.  Requires world reset."
msgstr "决定怪物血量。该值更高会让怪物们更抗揍，该值较低会让怪物们像瓷娃娃一样软弱。需要重置世界。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Default region type"
msgstr "默认区域类型"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "( WIP feature ) Determines terrain, shops, plants, and more."
msgstr "（WIP功能）确定地形，商店，工厂，等等。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial time"
msgstr "起始时间"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial starting time of day on character generation."
msgstr "创建角色时的开始时间。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Initial day"
msgstr "灾变起始日"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"How many days into the year the cataclysm occurred.  Day 0 is Spring 1.  Day"
" -1 randomizes the start date.  Can be overridden by scenarios.  This does "
"not advance food rot or monster evolution."
msgstr ""
"大灾变发生时的日历天数。设置为 0 时大灾变发生在春季第一天。设置为 -1 "
"则随机开始日期。会被场景所对应的设置值覆盖。增加该值并不会导致世界内生成的食物腐烂或怪物进化。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Spawn delay"
msgstr "开局延迟"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"How many days after the cataclysm the player spawns.  Day 0 is the day of "
"the cataclysm.  Can be overridden by scenarios.  Increasing this will cause "
"food rot and monster evolution to advance."
msgstr ""
"大灾变发生后多少天开始游戏。设置为 0 时将在大灾变当日开始游戏。会被场景所对应的设置值覆盖。增加该值将导致世界内生成的食物腐烂和怪物进化。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Season length"
msgstr "季节长度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Season length, in days."
msgstr "季节长度，以天为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Construction speed percentage"
msgstr "建造速度百分比"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Sets the time of construction in percents.  '50' is two times faster than "
"default, '200' is two times longer.  '0' makes construction instant."
msgstr "建造建筑速度的倍率。'50' 代表比默认的快两倍，'200' 代表比默认慢两倍，“0”则代表瞬间完成建筑。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Crafting speed percentage"
msgstr "制作速度百分比"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Sets default crafting speed in percents.  '50' is two times faster than "
"default, '200' is two times longer.  '0' makes crafting instant."
msgstr "以百分比形式设置默认制作速度。'50' 代表比默认的快两倍，'200' 代表比默认慢两倍，“0”则代表瞬间完成制作。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Growth scaling percentage"
msgstr "生长速度比例百分比"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Sets the time of crop growth in percents.  '50' is two times faster than "
"default, '200' is two times longer.  '0' automatically scales growth time to"
" match the world's season length."
msgstr "设置作物生长的时间百分比。'50' 意味着比默认快两倍，'200' 意味着比默认慢两倍。'0' 会自动调整生长时间以适应世界的季节长度。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Eternal season"
msgstr "锁定季节"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Keep the initial season for ever."
msgstr "锁定季节直到永远。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Wander spawns"
msgstr "游荡丧尸群生成"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Emulation of zombie hordes.  Zombie spawn points wander around cities and "
"may go to noise.  Must reset world directory after changing for it to take "
"effect."
msgstr "模拟丧尸群（尸潮）。丧尸刷新点在城镇周围移动，并且可能被噪声吸引。变更后必须重置世界才能生效。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Surrounded start"
msgstr "被围困开局"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, spawn zombies at shelters.  Makes the starting game a lot harder."
msgstr "开启时，则将在避难所内生成丧尸，使游戏起始时期更加困难。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Static NPCs"
msgstr "生成静态NPC"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, static NPCs will spawn at pre-defined locations.  Requires world "
"reset."
msgstr "开启后，会在创建游戏时会在地图上的一些固定地点生成NPC，需要重置世界才能生效。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Starting NPCs spawn"
msgstr "起始NPC生成"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Determines whether starting NPCs should spawn, and if they do, how exactly."
msgstr "决定是否生成起始NPC，以及如何生成他们。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Scenario-based"
msgstr "依据场景"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Random NPCs"
msgstr "生成随机NPC"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, the game will randomly spawn NPCs during gameplay."
msgstr "开启后，会在游戏中随机生成四处游荡的NPC。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Mutations by radiation"
msgstr "辐射诱发变异"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "If true, radiation causes the player to mutate."
msgstr "开启后，辐射将会导致玩家变异。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Character point pools"
msgstr "角色点数池"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Allowed point pools for character generation."
msgstr "在创建角色时所允许的加点方式。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Multi-pool only"
msgstr "仅独立点数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "No freeform"
msgstr "禁用无限制"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Disables lifting requirements for vehicle parts."
msgstr "禁用车辆零件的起重要求。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, strength checks and/or lifting qualities no longer need to be met "
"in order to change parts."
msgstr "如果打开，则更换载具零件时不再需要满足力量或起重要求（车轮除外）。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Quicksave on app lose focus"
msgstr "失焦后自动快速保存"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, quicksave whenever the app loses focus (screen locked, app moved "
"into background etc.) WARNING: Experimental. This may result in corrupt save"
" games."
msgstr "开启时，当程序失焦时（锁屏、切换程序等）将会快速保存。警告：该功能正处于实验阶段，可能导致游戏存储错误！"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Trap Back button"
msgstr "禁止返回按键退出APP"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, the back button will NOT back out of the app and will be passed to "
"the application as SDL_SCANCODE_AC_BACK.  Requires restart."
msgstr "开启后，按下手机的返回键不会退出游戏，而是将该按键指令解析为SDL_SCANCODE_AC_BACK发送给游戏程序。需要重启。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Auto-manage virtual keyboard"
msgstr "自动开关虚拟键盘"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, automatically show/hide the virtual keyboard when necessary based "
"on context. If false, virtual keyboard must be toggled manually."
msgstr "开启时，虚拟键盘将根据情况自动显示/隐藏；关闭时，虚拟键盘必须用返回键手动切换。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual keyboard screen scale"
msgstr "虚拟键盘屏幕缩放"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"When the virtual keyboard is visible, scale the screen to prevent "
"overlapping. Useful for text entry so you can see what you're typing."
msgstr "当显示虚拟键盘时，游戏窗口将自动缩放以避免被遮盖。便于在文本输入时看清你所输入的文字。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Vibration duration"
msgstr "振动时长"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If non-zero, vibrate the device for this long on input, in milliseconds. "
"Ignored if hardware keyboard connected."
msgstr "当该值不为0时，每次输入时将震动设备，以毫秒为单位；该设置在外接键盘时无效。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Show virtual joystick"
msgstr "显示虚拟手柄"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, show the virtual joystick when touching and holding the screen. "
"Gives a visual indicator of deadzone and stick deflection."
msgstr "开启时，当触摸或按住屏幕时将显示虚拟手柄。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick opacity"
msgstr "虚拟手柄透明度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The opacity of the on-screen virtual joystick, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整虚拟手柄的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick deadzone size"
msgstr "虚拟手柄盲区大小"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"While using the virtual joystick, deflecting the stick beyond this distance "
"will trigger directional input. Specified as a percentage of longest screen "
"edge."
msgstr "当使用虚拟手柄时，划动手柄偏离超过该距离时将触发方向键输入。单位为最大屏幕边缘的百分比。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick size"
msgstr "虚拟手柄大小"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"While using the virtual joystick, deflecting the stick by this much will "
"repeat input at the deflected rate (see below). Specified as a percentage of"
" longest screen edge."
msgstr "当使用虚拟手柄时，划动手柄偏离超过该距离是将按偏离时的频率触发方向键输入（偏离时的重复频率在下方设置）。单位为最大屏幕边缘的百分比。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick follows finger"
msgstr "虚拟手柄跟随手指"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, the virtual joystick will follow when sliding beyond its range."
msgstr "开启时，虚拟手柄在手指超出划动范围后还会跟随其移动。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick repeat rate (centered)"
msgstr "虚拟手柄重复频率（中心）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"When the virtual joystick is centered, how fast should input events repeat, "
"in milliseconds."
msgstr "当虚拟手柄在中心附近时的方向键重复输入频率，单位为毫秒。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick repeat rate (deflected)"
msgstr "虚拟手柄重复频率（偏离）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"When the virtual joystick is fully deflected, how fast should input events "
"repeat, in milliseconds."
msgstr "当虚拟手柄完全偏离时的方向键重复输入频率，单位为毫秒。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick repeat rate sensitivity"
msgstr "虚拟手柄重复频率灵敏度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"As the virtual joystick moves from centered to fully deflected, this value "
"is an exponent that controls the blend between the two repeat rates defined "
"above. 1.0 = linear."
msgstr "虚拟手柄在中心时至完全偏离时重复输入频率插值幂函数的幂值。1.0时为线性插值。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Input repeat delay"
msgstr "输入重复延时"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"While touching the screen, wait this long before showing the virtual "
"joystick and repeating input, in milliseconds. Also used to determine "
"tap/double-tap detection, flick detection and toggling quick shortcuts."
msgstr "从按住屏幕时至显示虚拟手柄并重复输入按键的时间间隔，单位为毫秒。该延时同时用于决定单击/双击事件检测，切换快捷键等。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Virtual joystick hides shortcuts"
msgstr "虚拟手柄时隐藏快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, hides on-screen keyboard shortcuts while using the virtual "
"joystick. Helps keep the view uncluttered while traveling long distances and"
" navigating menus."
msgstr "开启后，在使用虚拟手柄时隐藏屏幕上的快捷键栏。在长途旅行或者浏览菜单时保持屏幕整洁。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Default gameplay shortcuts"
msgstr "默认游戏快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"The default set of gameplay shortcuts to show. Used on starting a new game "
"and whenever all gameplay shortcuts are removed."
msgstr "每次游戏开始时显示的快捷键。用于开始新游戏时或当所有快捷键都被移除时自动显示的快捷键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Add shortcuts for action menu selections"
msgstr "自动添加行动菜单选项至快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, automatically add a shortcut for actions selected via the in-game "
"action menu."
msgstr "开启时，自动将所选择过的行动菜单内的选项添加至快捷键栏中。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Add shortcuts for inventory selections"
msgstr "自动添加物品菜单选项至快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, automatically add a shortcut for items selected via the inventory."
msgstr "开启时，自动添加物品栏的选项至快捷键栏中。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Tap key (in-game)"
msgstr "单指轻击按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when tapping during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时单指轻击屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Two-finger tap key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指轻击按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when tapping with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指轻击屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Two-finger swipe up key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指上扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when swiping up with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向上扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Two-finger swipe down key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指下扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when swiping down with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向下扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Two-finger swipe left key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指左扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when swiping left with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向左扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Two-finger swipe right key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指右扫按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when swiping right with two fingers during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指向右扫过屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pinch in key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指内缩按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when pinching in during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指内缩屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Pinch out key (in-game)"
msgstr "双指外张按键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The key to press when pinching out during gameplay."
msgstr "游戏时双指外张屏幕时触发的按键。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Auto-manage contextual gameplay shortcuts"
msgstr "自动根据场景调整快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, contextual in-game shortcuts are added and removed automatically as"
" needed: examine, close, butcher, move up/down, control vehicle, pickup, "
"toggle enemy + safe mode, sleep."
msgstr "开启时，根据需要自动添加/移除对应场景下的快捷键：查看，关闭，屠宰，上楼/下楼，控制载具，拾取，切换敌人/安全模式，睡觉等。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Move contextual gameplay shortcuts to front"
msgstr "场景快捷键移至最前"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If the above option is enabled, specifies whether contextual in-game "
"shortcuts will be added to the front or back of the shortcuts list. True "
"makes them easier to reach, False reduces shuffling of shortcut positions."
msgstr "开启时，将自动将场景快捷键移动至快捷键列表最前端。开启时更容易控制场景快捷键，关闭时减少对快捷键栏快捷键的调整。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Move used shortcuts to front"
msgstr "使用快捷键移至最前"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, using an existing shortcut will always move it to the front of the "
"shortcuts list. If false, only shortcuts typed via keyboard will move to the"
" front."
msgstr "开启时，每次使用已在列表内的快捷键都会将其移动至快捷键列表最前端。关闭时，只有通过键盘输入的快捷键会移动至列表最前端。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Separate shortcuts for No Auto Pickup zones"
msgstr "禁止自动拾取区使用不同快捷键"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, separate gameplay shortcuts will be used within No Auto Pickup "
"zones. Useful for keeping home base actions separate from exploring actions."
msgstr "开启时，进入禁止自动拾取区将会切换成另一套快捷键。便于玩家在基地时的行动按键与探索时的行动按键分开。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Turns to remove unused gameplay shortcuts"
msgstr "自动移除未使用快捷键回合数"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If non-zero, unused gameplay shortcuts will be removed after this many turns"
" (as in discrete player actions, not world calendar turns)."
msgstr "当不为0时，多个回合内未使用的快捷键将自动从快捷键列表中移除（以玩家回合为单位，而非世界时间）。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcuts persistence"
msgstr "快捷键保存"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, shortcuts are saved/restored with each save game. If false, "
"shortcuts reset between sessions."
msgstr "开启时，快捷键将在每个存档间均被保存/读取。关闭时，快捷键在每次会话时重置。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcuts position"
msgstr "快捷键位置"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Switch between shortcuts on the left or on the right side of the screen."
msgstr "切换快捷键栏按屏幕左侧或右侧对齐。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcuts screen percentage"
msgstr "快捷键屏幕百分比"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the screen can shortcuts occupy, as a percentage of total screen"
" width."
msgstr "快捷键栏占屏幕的大小，以总屏幕宽度百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcuts overlap screen"
msgstr "快捷键覆盖屏幕"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"If true, shortcuts will be drawn transparently overlapping the game screen. "
"If false, the game screen size will be reduced to fit the shortcuts below."
msgstr "开启时，快捷键会以透明的方式叠加在游戏屏幕上。关闭时，游戏屏幕会缩小以显示快捷键栏。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut opacity (background)"
msgstr "快捷键透明度（背景）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"The background opacity of on-screen keyboard shortcuts, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整快捷键栏背景的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut opacity (shadow)"
msgstr "快捷键透明度（阴影）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The shadow opacity of on-screen keyboard shortcuts, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整快捷键栏阴影的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut opacity (text)"
msgstr "快捷键透明度（字符）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"The foreground opacity of on-screen keyboard shortcuts, as a percentage."
msgstr "调整快捷键栏字符的透明度，以百分比为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut color"
msgstr "快捷键颜色"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The color of on-screen keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "调整快捷键的颜色。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut border"
msgstr "快捷键边框"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The border of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels. ."
msgstr "调整快捷键的边框大小，以像素为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut width (min)"
msgstr "快捷键最小宽度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"The minimum width of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels. Only "
"relevant when lots of shortcuts are visible at once."
msgstr "调整快捷键的最小宽度，以像素为单位。仅在有许多快捷键同时显示时有意义。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut width (max)"
msgstr "快捷键最大宽度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The maximum width of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels."
msgstr "调整快捷键的最大宽度，以像素为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Shortcut height"
msgstr "快捷键高度"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "The height of each on-screen keyboard shortcut in pixels."
msgstr "调整快捷键的高度，以像素为单位。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid " OPTIONS "
msgstr "选项"

#: src/options.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The window will be %d pixel wide with the selected value."
msgid_plural "The window will be %d pixels wide with the selected value."
msgstr[0] "在当前设置下游戏窗口宽度为 %d 像素。"

#: src/options.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The window will be %d pixel tall with the selected value."
msgid_plural "The window will be %d pixels tall with the selected value."
msgstr[0] "在当前设置下游戏窗口高度为 %d 像素。"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Current world"
msgstr "当前世界"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Note: "
msgstr "备注："

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Some of these options may produce unexpected results if changed."
msgstr "更改某些选项可能会产生不可预料的后果。"

#: src/options.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Prerequisite for this option not met!\n"
"(%s)"
msgstr ""
"该选项所需前置条件未满足！\n"
"（%s）"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid "Invalid input: not a number"
msgstr "无效输入：非数字"

#: src/options.cpp
msgid ""
"Please wait…\n"
"Applying option changes…"
msgstr ""
"请等待……\n"
"应用选项更改……"

#: src/options.cpp src/path_display.cpp
msgid "options"
msgstr "选项"

#: src/output.cpp
#, c-format
msgctxt "query_yn"
msgid "%s (Case Sensitive)"
msgstr "%s（区分大小写）"

#: src/output.cpp
#, c-format
msgctxt "query_yn"
msgid "%s"
msgstr "%s"

#: src/output.cpp
msgid "Type part of an item's name to filter it."
msgstr "输入物品部分名称以筛选。"

#: src/output.cpp
msgid "Type part of an item's name to move nearby items to the bottom."
